[13512]={"Thorkell, el hermano de Thorgest, fue asesinado hace unos días por los sierpes.","Thorkell ha Caído","Las cavernas de los sierpes están al sureste de la morada de Thorgest.\
\
Thorgest te ha pedido que encuentres y devuelvas las pertenencias de Thorkell.","Recoge el yelmo de Thorkell","Hacha de Thorkell recogida","Recoge el hacha de Thorkell","'¿Se lo han comido todo los sierpes? Algo debe quedar de las pertenencias de mi hermano que puedas recuperar...'","Yelmo de Thorkell recogido","'Ah, ¿esto es todo lo que queda de mi buen hermano Thorkell? Ojalá hubiese caído yo en su lugar....\
\
'Pero no, hablo como un necio en mi duelo. Mi querido hermano siempre fue el auténtico guerrero y aventurero —más que yo, de lejos. Dio su vida como quiso, para salvar la mía, y nunca más cuestionaré su valor por ello. Tampoco deshonraré su nombre dejando de vivir como él deseó que yo viviera.\
\
'Parece que tengo mucho por hacer, ${PLAYER}, y hundirme en mi pena mientras el viento implacable desgasta estas montañas no me llevará a nada.'","'Ah, gracias por la ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Con el tiempo me recuperaré de estas heridas, pero nada puede hacerse ya por mi hermano Thorkell. La última vez que lo vi estaba atrapado en las fauces de un gran sierpe. Solo puedo esperar que su final fuera rápido.\
\
'Los gusanos no dejan nada que enterrar, pero no comen acero enano. Si te atreves a internarte en sus cavernas y recuperar lo que quede de las pertenencias de mi hermano, te recompensaré generosamente.\
\
'Las cavernas de los gusanos están al sureste.'","Devuelve las pertenencias de Thorkell a Thorgest"},
[13513]={"'Los Espinar, granjeros de estas tierras desde hace generaciones, han escapado en gran parte del peligro por parte de los bandidos. Sin embargo, se ha informado que el patriarca de la familia ha desaparecido tras ir a enfrentar a los enemigos del norte.\
\
'Si puede hacerlo, te pediría que visites a Rosa Espinar, al oeste, en su hogar, y preguntes por su esposo.'","Encuentra a Robb Espinar","'¡Oh, gracias por encontrar a Robb!'","Rosa Espinar está en su casa, al oeste de la cabaña de Saeradan.\
\
El Montaraz Saeradan te sugirió que hables con Rosa Espinar sobre la desaparición de su esposo.","Granja de Espinar","'¡Ayuda al fin! ¡Debemos salir de aquí rápidamente!'","Habla con Rosa Espinar en Granja de Espinar","Un grupo de bandidos que se hacen llamar Hombres de Zarquino se ha apoderado de la antigua granja de los Maderal, amenazando las propiedades vecinas.","'¿Robb ha desaparecido? ¿Cómo lo sabes? ¿Eres ${PLAYERNAME:uno[m]|una[f]} de esos sureños que vienen a robar este lugar? ¡Verás que somos más duros que la tierra que trabajamos!\
\
'No... no lo eres... ¿verdad? ¿Te han enviado los Montaraces? Nunca confié mucho en ellos, pero debo admitir que últimamente siento algo de gratitud. Al menos desde que Robb desapareció.\
\
'Robb salió con la espada de su padre, intentando ahuyentar a esos hombres brutales del norte. Se fue hace unos días y aún no ha regresado. Ya no sé qué excusas darles a los trabajadores. ¿Podrías buscarlo, por favor?'","'Por favor, ¿buscarás a Robb? Esos brutos que perseguía parecían dirigirse al norte y cruzar el camino hacia el este.'","Robb fue visto por última vez dirigiéndose al norte por el camino.\
\\Rosa Espinar te ha pedido que encuentres a su esposo.","'Debes hablar con Rosa Espinar en su granja.'"},
[13514]={"'Por favor, ¡debes ayudarme! Estos orcos me capturaron mientras estaba lejos de mi granja por negocios. Por favor... ¡ayúdame a escapar!'","Habla con Rosa Espinar en la Granja de los Espinar","El Rescate de Espinar","Rosa Espinar se encuentra en su granja, en los Campos de Bree, al sur del campamento orco\
\
La esposa de Robb Espinar, Rosa, debe ser informada de la huida de su esposo de los orcos.","Robb Espinar, un granjero de las Tierras de Bree, ha sido capturado por orcos saqueadores","Robb Espinar te ha pedido que lo ayudes a escapar del campamento orco","'Robb aún se está recuperando, pero está mejorando, ¡muchas gracias!'","'Estoy muy agradecida de que hayas rescatado a Robb. Está descansando ahora, pero me pidió que te diera una recompensa. También ha pedido algo más...'","Robb Espinar ha escapado","Libera a Robb Espinar y escolta a un lugar seguro"},
[13515]={"'Robb está descansando ahora y se recupera bien, gracias a ti, pero te pide otro favor\
\
'Dijo que no puede dormir, pensando en esos malditos orcos que lo emboscaron en el Camino Verde. Cuando fue capturado, dijo que un orco grande vino a atormentarlo desde un campamento al oeste de donde estaba retenido, el que está detrás de una empalizada de madera. Dice que los otros orcos llamaban a ese monstruo el Despojador Rojo. Robb dice que debe vengarse del Despojador Rojo y estará encantado de darte las monedas que pueda si logras someterlo.\
\
'Ahora, no puedo decir que me guste todo este derramamiento de sangre, y me parece bastante peligroso, pero si le enseñas algo a ese horrible monstruo que torturó a Robb, supongo que mereces una recompensa.'","'¿Ya te has deshecho del Despojador Rojo?'","Habla con Rosa Espinar en la Granja de los Espinar","La venganza de los Espinar","Derrota al Despojador Rojo","Rescataste a Robb Espinar de los orcos, golpeado y malherido, pero no se conforma con haber sido rescatado. Quiere venganza","La granja de los Espinar está al sur, a lo largo del Camino Verde, desde la empalizada orca\
\
Debes regresar de inmediato a la granja de los Espinar para contarle a Rosa tu victoria y reclamar tu recompensa.","El Despojador Rojo está en la empalizada orca en el lado oeste del Camino Verde, al norte de la granja de los Espinar\
\
En nombre de su esposo, Rosa Espinar te ha ofrecido una recompensa si vas a la empalizada y matas al Despojador Rojo","'Robb estará muy feliz de saber que te has deshecho de esa bestia de orco. Y yo también te agradezco por hacer del Camino Verde un lugar más seguro. Por favor, acepta esta recompensa de parte de los dos'","Despojador Rojo derrotado"},
[13516]={"Se ha cobrado una venganza justa contra los orcos Tarkrîp que capturaron y torturaron a Robb Espinar. Ahora es el momento de enfrentarse a aquel a quien llaman el Despojador Rojo.","Cobra más venganza (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Montaraces de las Tierras de Bree están preocupados por la aparición de un enemigo al que han combatido durante mucho tiempo en el norte: los orcos Tarkrîp. Ya has matado a muchos, pero aún quedan bastantes. A Robb Espinar probablemente le vendría bien un poco más de venganza.","¡Robb Espinar ha sido vengado!","Más venganza cobrada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orcos Tarkrîp derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Has acabado con el Despojador Rojo? ¡Robb se alegrará mucho de saber que has eliminado a esa bestia de orco! Yo también te doy las gracias por hacer del Camino Verde un lugar más seguro'.","La venganza de los Espinar","¡El Despojador Rojo está aquí!","Los Montaraces de las Tierras de Bree están preocupados por la aparición de un enemigo al que han combatido durante mucho tiempo en el norte: los orcos Tarkrîp. Deberías derrotarlos para que la familia Espinar pueda volver a dormir tranquila por las noches.","Robb Espinar ha sido rescatado de los orcos, maltrecho y apaleado, pero no se conforma con el rescate. Exige un castigo, especialmente contra el orco al que llaman el Despojador Rojo.","Derrota a los orcos Tarkrîp (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se ha cobrado una venganza justa contra los orcos Tarkrîp que capturaron y torturaron a Robb Espinar. Ahora es el momento de buscar a aquel a quien llaman el Despojador Rojo.","Derrota al Despojador Rojo","Encuentra al Despojador Rojo"},
[13518]={"'Our actions have left Esh Mêkag in a state of revolt. Those left in the pit-mine now fight for their lives. We cannot abandon them now! I saw the Ordâkhai moving medical supplies into the mines with their reinforcements. Do what you can to keep our people in fighting shape.'","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. This is a battle we must win! We will take Esh Mêkag from the Ordâkhai and burn it to the ground!'","Talk to Ebuzâm","You have done much to aid the thralls revolting in Esh Mêkag.\
\
You should return to Ebuzâm.","Esh Mêkag's pit-mine has erupted into full revolt. The thralls inside need your help.","The thralls in Esh Mêkag need help fighting the Ordâkhai.\
\
You should collect medicinal bandages and use them on injured thralls.","Used medicinal bandage on freed thralls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Those Left Behind","Use medicinal bandage on freed thralls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13519]={"Mildir and Cenedel can be found in Ost Lontir, and Boradan can be found outside Ost Lontir near the beacon, Amon Lontir.\
\
Gilanor has asked you to acquaint yourself with the people of Ost Lontir and aid them where needed.","'It is true that times are grim for my people, ${PLAYER}. With so many gone to the aid of the Steward at Minas Tirith in the east, we were left ill-prepared for a Corsair attack. It was necessary, but now I fear that we have left ourselves far too exposed.\
\
'If you would aid me, we could strike back against the Corsairs and keep safe the people of Belfalas.'","Holding the town of Ost Lontir with few men and resources, Gilanor hopes to see his people safely through the war.","'You have come at a fortuitous time, ${CLASS}. My people have great need of one with your skills... for the Corsairs raid the Havens even as we speak.\
\
'There is much to be done, but with so many raids, we have had precious little time to bolster our defences or even tend to simple tasks. Very few remain here, but I am certain you can aid them in some way if you are willing.\
\
'Speak to them, aid them where you can, and you will have my gratitude and trust, traveller.'","Gilanor can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas.\
\
You have spoken to the people of Ost Lontir and should now return to Gilanor.","Those That Remain","Talk to Mildir","Talk to Cenedel","'Hello, traveller... I am glad you have come to Ost Lontir, for it means that perhaps not all hope is lost. The Enemy rallies in the north, and I find our days growing darker as more Corsairs spill from the sea into Gondor.\
\
'With you here, one more can stand against those that strike at us, and we can work to push the Corsairs from our home!'","Talk to Boradan the Beacon-warden","Talk to Gilanor","DNT -- will not be seen","'Welcome to Ost Lontir... the light waiting to be snuffed out.\
\
'I do not see any reason to stay here, and if it were not for my wife, I would have long since fled to Dol Amroth.\
\
'I suppose if I am stuck here, I may as well enlist your aid in protecting us... do you have a moment?'","'If you have come expecting to see the splendour of Gondor, I am afraid you will find it rather dulled.\
\
'The city of the Prince is as beautiful as ever, but grim times have come to the Havens. If you have a moment more to speak with me, there is something I would like to show you....'"},
[13520]={"Defeat cultists of the Order of the Eye at Lûghash (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Oppressed by Zôreth and now by the Order of the Eye, the Stout-axes of Lûghash have long fought for their survival as slaves of Mordor.","Talk to Dréri in Lûghash","Those We Have Lost","Dréri can be found at the Stout-axe barracks within Lûghash.\
\
You have defeated many cultists of the Order of the Eye and buried the Stout-axes slain by them. You should now return to Dréri.","Slain Stout-axes and cultists of the Order of the Eye can be found surrounding Lûghash.\
\
Dréri has asked you to bury slain Stout-axes outside Lûghash and avenge the fallen by defeating cultists of the Order of the Eye.","Buried Stout-axes slain by the Order of the Eye (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated cultists of the Order of the Eye at Lûghash (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'May those Men rot upon the plains for what they have done! We may serve Mistress Zôreth, but we are not slaves to all the fools of Mordor! A fire burns within us yet!\
\
'My kin have been given a final honour, and for that, I offer you my thanks.'","'Hail, ${PLAYER}! So finally you come to Lûghash, eh?\
\
'It is not a very fitting a home for dwarves, but the Mistress has kept us from the Deathless and the others of her kin. Or so she did until Sauron fell....\
\
'Now this ridiculous \\qOrder of the Eye\\q won't leave us be! They actually believe he'll come back again! A foolish lot, they are!\
\
'If they were harmless, I'd leave them to their fantasies, but now they have come to the Spire. They have tortured and killed my kin all to gain Mistress Zôreth's knowledge of Sauron's artifacts. What would we know? We are her servants - not her trusted allies and advisors!\
\
'If you wish to aid me, bury my kin upon the fields surrounding Lûghash. They deserve that final honour!\
\
'Come to think of it... if those cultists are still snooping about outside, bury them as well. Even if he does come back again, I don't want them to be around to see it!'","Bury Stout-axes slain by the Order of the Eye (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13521]={"'Parece que no tienes la mente tranquila, ${PLAYER}. ¿Qué ocurre?'\
\
Después de un momento de reflexión, le dices a Svanr que sigues teniendo curiosidad por el Puente de Khazad-dûm.\
\
'Eso es algo extraño de decir, pero puedes echarle otro vistazo si eso te tranquiliza. No sé qué pasó allí, ni por qué se rompió así.\
\
'No te hagas ilusiones de que habrá más pruebas, pero míralo una vez más si es necesario.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta es una instancia solo para un jugador, y no puede ser completada en una comunidad.</rgb>","El lado este del puente destruido de Khazad-dûm se encuentra al oeste de la Primera Sala en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes colocarte en el lado este del puente destruido y mirar nuevamente el abismo, ya que sientes la necesidad de verlo antes de abandonar Moria.","Svanr se encuentra en la Primera Sala de Moria, en el este de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes regresar con Svanr.","Vuelve con Svanr","'Por supuesto, ve a echarle otro vistazo, ${PLAYER}.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta es una instancia solo para un jugador, y no puede ser completada en una comunidad.</rgb>","Aquellos que vinieron antes","'¿Viste algo interesante, ${PLAYER}? ¿Alguna prueba de lo que ocurrió?'\
\
Sientes perturbación por lo que viste, y no tienes la certeza de la verdad en ello. Eliges no decir nada por el momento.\
\
'Ah, bueno. No pensé que habría mucho interés en volver a echarle un vistazo. ¡Quizás algún día resolveremos el enigma!'","Tuviste una visión extraña de Gandalf y un enemigo aterrador: una visión terrible. ¿Acaso la comunidad pasó por aquí...?","Sientes la obligación de echar un último vistazo al puente de Khazad-dûm por razones que no comprendes completamente.","Contempla una vez más el puente de Khazad-dûm"},
[13525]={"Recoge flores hermosas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Las flores se pueden encontrar creciendo al sol en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, cerca de la Puerta Este de Moria.\
\
Debes recoger flores hermosas para tu tributo a tus compañeros caídos.","Se pueden encontrar viejos jarrones sin usar a lo largo de las escaleras este fuera de Moria, en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
Debes plantar las flores que recogiste en los jarrones para conmemorar a los enanos que perdieron la vida sin llegar a pasar la puerta este.","Flor colocada como memorial (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has conmemorado adecuadamente a los enanos caídos de la expedición.\
\
Las flores brillantes crecerán aquí como la esperanza y el valor encendidos en el corazón de cada enano. Pueden haber perdido la vida, pero su legado vivirá.","'¿Te gustaría rendir homenaje a los enanos caídos de Moria, verdad? Bueno, he notado algunas flores hermosas y jarrones vacíos en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
'Quizás puedas mostrar tu respeto a aquellos que nunca lograron salir con vida plantando algunas flores blancas en su memoria.'","Planta flores para recordar a los enanos caídos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Flor recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge flores para conmemorar a los enanos caídos","Debes recoger flores en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío y plantarlas en la escalera este para conmemorar a los enanos que nunca lograron atravesar Moria.","Aquellos que nunca salieron","Has conmemorado adecuadamente a los enanos caídos de la expedición."},
[13526]={"'Egwylf ha decidido que debe dejarnos. Es una pena, pero tiene obligaciones con su reino. ¡No la culpo por ello!'","Bingo está en el camino que atraviesa la ciudad arruinada de Marton, en el Folde Oeste.","Te reuniste con Bingo y Crinloca, pero la experiencia aterradora ha dejado al hobbit con un nudo en el estómago y un anhelo por la comida de su hogar.","'Hemos llegado sanos y salvos a Bosque Oscuro. Espero de verdad que nuestra amiga pueda empezar una nueva vida aquí.'\
\
La mujer te sonríe tristemente, a ti y a Bingo. Las cicatrices de la pérdida de Marton siempre permanecerán, pero su expresión muestra la determinación de reconstruir y recuperarse de lo vivido.\
\
'Esto ha sido más que suficiente por un día', continúa Bingo. 'Nos han invitado a cenar en el Salón de Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro, en lo alto de la colina. ¡Te esperaré adentro, ${PLAYER}!'","'Fue un viaje agradable desde Arboleda del Paso, ${PLAYER}, y agradecí tu compañía. Sé que Bingo estará seguro contigo cuidándolo, y tanto el lince como el poney parecen guardianes muy capaces.\
\
'Pero no puedo viajar con ustedes para siempre. Mi deber es con Rohan, y debo informar a Erkenbrand sobre lo que aprendí acerca de los cultistas del Ojo Sangriento en mi viaje. Esta es su fortaleza, y si algún lugar debe estar preparado en tiempos de guerra, el Abismo es el mejor lugar para ello.\
\
'¡Vayan con mi buena voluntad, amigos míos! ¡Cuídense de los orcos en el Folde Oeste!'","'Te veré dentro del Salón de Hidromiel.'","Derrota enemigos que amenacen el Folde Oeste (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Bingo frente a la muralla del Abismo de Helm","'¡Vaya fortaleza! ¿La ves, ${PLAYER}?'","Habla con Bingo fuera de Marton, en el Folde Oeste","Ella asiente a regañadientes y accede a ir a Bosque Oscuro, para buscar un nuevo hogar","'Ha sido un día largo, ${PLAYER}. Gran parte de mi viaje ha sido agradable, lleno de días soleados y buena compañía, pero ver a Marton arder... bueno, me ha dejado muy alterado, y no sé qué hacer ahora. Y no soy el único. Incluso Willem parece bastante decaído.\
\
'Me preocupa la Comarca. ¿Será hora de volver a casa? ¡Oh, no sé qué hacer! Pensar en el hogar debería reconfortar, pero estos pensamientos sobre la Comarca me tienen confundido y revuelto, y ahora te digo con total sinceridad que ¡ni siquiera sé hacia dónde mirar!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Siguiente semana: 'Willem Bigote y el Ancho Mundo' (Nivel recomendado: 93)</rgb>","'¡Debemos hacer algo! ¡Podría haber supervivientes atrapados en los escombros! ¡Podría haber orcos y huargos aún cazando a los que quedan! ¡Tenemos que ayudar a cualquiera que aún esté en Marton! Esto no es un paseo, ${PLAYER}... ¡esto es serio!'","La mujer te mira con los ojos llenos de lágrimas, y entiendes al instante que nunca vivió en otro lugar que no fuera Marton. Con palabras suaves, le dices que no estará a salvo aquí y le pides que vaya contigo y con Bingo a Bosque Oscuro, al sureste.\
\
'Mi hogar...', dice con tristeza.","Bingo nunca había visto antes a esta mujer, pero tú ya la has encontrado más de una vez. Su mirada es aturdida, y Clemencia contempla ahora la destrucción que las huestes de Saruman causaron en Marton, con el dolor marcado en su rostro.\
\
'No sabía a dónde ir', te dice, y nada más. Le dices que podría encontrar seguridad y un hogar propio en Bosque Oscuro, si está dispuesta a ir.","Habla con Bingo en el centro de Bosque Oscuro, en el Folde Oeste","Bingo quiere viajar al pueblo de Marton, al noreste del Abismo de Helm, en el Folde Oeste, para buscar algo de comida que calme su estómago hambriento.","Habla con Bingo en la ciudad de Marton, en el Folde Oeste","Enemigos derrotados en el Folde Oeste (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Busca entre los escombros quemados de Marton (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Revisas los escombros, pero no encuentras nada","Pensamientos del Hogar","Egwylf asiente en despedida y se dirige hacia la fortaleza","'Encontré a esta mujer entre las ruinas. Parece estar en estado de shock, y he intentado animarla todo lo posible. Creo que vivía en esta ciudad antes de que fuera atacada, pero ahora necesitará un nuevo lugar donde quedarse. Creo que deberíamos llevarla a Bosque Oscuro, al sureste. Si queda algún lugar seguro en el Folde Oeste, será allí... al menos según los hombres con los que hablé en el Abismo de Helm.\
\
'Por favor, dile que la llevaremos a Bosque Oscuro a un lugar seguro. Ha pasado por mucho, ¡no podemos dejarla aquí entre tantos peligros y en este estado!'","Egwylf ha decidido que ha llegado el momento de informar a Erkenbrand sobre el resultado de su misión buscando a los cultistas del Ojo Sangriento","Bingo está fuera de la gran muralla de la fortaleza del Abismo de Helm.","'Oh no...'\
\
Bingo observa las ruinas de Marton con desesperación, y toda la alegría desaparece de su rostro.\
\
'Ya no tengo hambre, ${PLAYER}. La guerra ya ha llegado al Folde Oeste, ¡y las buenas gentes que vivían aquí han sufrido tanto!\
\
'¡Debemos hacer algo! ¡Podría haber supervivientes atrapados entre los escombros! ¡Podría haber orcos y huargos cazando a los que quedan! ¡Tenemos que ayudar a cualquiera que aún esté en Marton! Esto no es un paseo, ${PLAYER}... ¡esto es serio!'","'No sé por qué Clemencia no quiso intentar empezar una nueva vida en Bosque Oscuro. ¡No lo entiendo!\
\
'No tiene sentido seguir dándole vueltas, supongo. ¡Te veré dentro del Salón de la Hidromiel, ${PLAYER}!'","'Siempre es triste despedirse de compañeros de viaje, pero Egwylf tiene un deber, ¡y no sería yo quien la retenga! Estará bien. ¡Mira esa muralla impresionante!\
\
'Debemos hacer algo con los gruñidos de mi estómago, ${PLAYER}. No pediré comida a estos soldados, pues deben racionar sus provisiones en tiempos de guerra. Sigamos la carretera hacia el noreste y veamos si en el primer pueblo encontramos algo de cena. Escuché a unos hombres hablar de un lugar llamado Marton. ¡Busquemos allí algo para aplacar el apetito!'","'Por favor, dile que la llevaremos a Bosque Oscuro a un lugar seguro. Sé que ha pasado por mucho, ¡pero no podemos dejarla aquí entre tantos peligros, y en este estado!'","'Estoy casi recuperado de esa experiencia tan aterradora, ${PLAYER}, pero si soy sincero tengo que confesarte algo: ¡tengo muchísima hambre! Deseo comida... ¡cualquier comida! Pasteles, quesos, panes, cerveza deliciosa, carnes asadas... ¡lo que sea! Crinloca se hartó de manzanas, ¡pero eso no me sirve de nada.\
\
'Hablé con Egwylf, y parece que desea partir de nuestro lado. La acompañaremos hasta su destino y luego seguiremos nuestro camino.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Cuando aceptes esta misión viajarás automáticamente al destino de Egwylf.</rgb>","Bingo aprieta los puños con rabia","'Esa es la gran fortaleza donde reside Erkenbrand. Le informaré sobre lo que he aprendido de los cultistas del Ojo Sangriento.'","'Sigamos la carretera al noreste y busquemos algo de cena en el primer pueblo que encontremos. Escuché a unos hombres hablar de un lugar llamado Marton. ¡Busquemos allí algo para saciar el hambre!'","'Por favor, dile que la llevaremos a Bosque Oscuro a un lugar seguro. Ha pasado por mucho, ¡pero no podemos dejarla aquí entre tantos peligros y en este estado!\
\
'Los hombres del Abismo de Helm me dijeron que Bosque Oscuro sigue siendo lo bastante pacífico, por ahora. Está al sureste, en el Folde Oeste. ¡Vayamos allí cuanto antes! No debería permanecer cerca de este triste escenario.'","Bingo está en el centro de Bosque Oscuro, en el Folde Oeste.","Bingo está devastado por las pruebas de la destrucción de Marton y quiere que busques entre las ruinas a cualquier superviviente atrapado. También desea que derrotes a los enemigos que amenacen el Folde Oeste.","Habla con Egwylf frente a la muralla del Abismo de Helm","Bingo quiere reunirse contigo dentro del Salón de Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro, ubicado en lo alto de la colina en el centro de Bosque Oscuro.","'No sé cuándo ocurrió, ${PLAYER}, ¡pero en algún punto entre Marton y aquí, Clemencia se nos escapó!\
\
'No entiendo por qué no quiso intentar establecer un hogar aquí en Bosque Oscuro. Podría haber sido perfectamente feliz en Rohan, ¿no crees? Supongo que hicimos lo que pudimos. Ojalá esté bien allá fuera en lo salvaje.\
\
'En cualquier caso, nos han invitado a descansar los pies y a cenar en el Salón de Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro, en lo alto de la colina. ¡Te veré adentro!'","Clemencia no responde, pero vuelve a mirar hacia las ruinas ardientes","Bingo encontró a una mujer vagando entre las ruinas de Marton, en el Folde Oeste. Te pidió decirle que la llevarán a salvo a la ciudad de Bosque Oscuro.","Habla con Bingo dentro del Salón de Hidromiel de Bosque Oscuro","Habla con la mujer aturdida fuera de Marton"},
[13528]={"Entrega una caja de armadura tejida al líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Fabrica una caja de armadura tejida para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","El gremio de sastres de Umbar Baharbêl suministra ropa y tapices históricos por toda la ciudad. Estás poniendo de tu parte para ayudarles.","'Excelente. Estas túnicas estarán disponibles en toda la ciudad para cualquiera que tenga Tami para pagarlas.'","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de armadura tejida.","Proporciona la caja de armadura tejida al líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Encajonada una caja de armadura tejida para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Enhebrando las agujas (Diario)","'Los tapices cuentan historias de antaño. Los hilos de seda más finos se sienten frescos contra la piel bajo el sol abrasador. Los linos y los cueros nos protegen de los elementos y de cosas peores. ¿Qué sería de Umbar Baharbêl sin el gremio de sastres? Una masa de tontos sin lavar y sin vestir. Bromeo, por supuesto. Pero, hay una medida de verdad en nuestro papel de mantener las necesidades de toda la gente de Umbar.\
\
'¿Nos ayudarás con las peticiones de los muchos clientes de la ciudad?'"},
[13529]={"Entrega una caja de armadura tejida al líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Fabrica una caja de armadura tejida para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","El gremio de sastres de Umbar Baharbêl suministra ropa y tapices históricos por toda la ciudad. Estás poniendo de tu parte para ayudarles.","'Excelente. Estas túnicas estarán disponibles en toda la ciudad para cualquiera que tenga Tami para pagarlas.'","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Empaqueta una caja de armadura tejida.","Proporciona la caja de armadura tejida al líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Encajonada una caja de armadura tejida para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Enhebrando las agujas (Diario)","'Los tapices cuentan historias de antaño. Los hilos de seda más finos se sienten frescos contra la piel bajo el sol abrasador. Los linos y los cueros nos protegen de los elementos y de cosas peores. ¿Qué sería de Umbar Baharbêl sin el gremio de sastres? Una masa de tontos sin lavar y sin vestir. Bromeo, por supuesto. Pero, hay una medida de verdad en nuestro papel de mantener las necesidades de toda la gente de Umbar.\
\
'¿Nos ayudarás con las peticiones de los muchos clientes de la ciudad?'"},
[13531]={"El jirón de tapiz que has encontrado es antiguo y raído pero algunos detalles todavía se pueden distinguir. Quizá si encuentras más, podría ser de interés para los Montaraces de Tinnudir.","'Mira cómo incluso después de todos estos años los colores todavía mantienen su intensidad. Me pregunto si los fragmentos que encontraste pertenecen todos al mismo tapiz o a varios...'","Lleva los fragmentos de tapices a Nadfaron","Los tapices descoloridos de Tham Nambarth hablan de una heráldica perdida hace mucho tiempo en Evendim.","Tham Nambarth está al este de Tinnudir.\
\
Debes buscar fragmentos de antiguos tapices para los Montaraces de Tinnudir.","Retales de tapices antiguos recuperados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Montaraces están en Tinnudir, al oeste de Tham Nambarth.\
\
Uno de los Montaraces de Tinnudir estará interesado en examinar los fragmentos de tapices que has recuperado.","Hilos del pasado","Recupera retales de tapices antiguos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13532]={"'Hombres vestidos como lobos que profanan el bosque...'","Ayuda a Erchiel con las reliquias de los Gauredain","'Los hombres del norte, que se visten como lobos, no son como los montaraces del este. Veneran la tierra, pero luego la usan para crear el mal y la oscuridad. Son una estirpe de hombres corrompida, en la que no confío.\
\
'Han empezado a venir más al sur, incluso hasta los límites de esta arboleda. Esto me preocupa mucho.'","Los Gauredain han empezado a avanzar poco a poco cada vez más hacia el sur, y ahora amenazan incluso las Agujas de la Linde.","Ayuda a Erchiel a cazar a los cazadores","La amenaza del norte","El campamento de los Gauredain está al norte de las Agujas de la Linde.","Ayuda a Remmenylf con las protecciones de los Gauredain","'Una vez hechas esas cosas, ha llegado el momento de poner límites.'","Erchiel está en las Agujas de la Linde.\
\
Erchiel querrá saber que las primeras tareas se han completado."},
[13533]={"'¿Cómo llevas la tarea? ¿Me has traído las armas?\
\
'El campamento de los Rauta-väki está al sureste de Sûri-kylä, en el camino hacia la tierra de Forodwaith.'","La amenaza venida del sur","'Todavía nos quedan muchas batalla por luchar, ${PLAYER}.'","'¡Saludos, ! Has llegado aquí desde muy lejos... puedo decirle por tus extraños ropajes pero también por tu mirada: ¡la de ${PLAYER:un verdadero guerrero[m]|una verdadera guerrera[f]}!\
\
'Últimamente hemos tenido muchos problemas, más de los que los ancianos están dispuestos a decir en voz alta. Yo mismo he visto a los Rauta-väki de Angmar con sus oscuras armas, que buscan hacer la guerra contra mi gente. ¡No lo toleraré mientras siga con vida!\
\
'Si ayudaras a los guerreros de Sûri-kylä estaría en deuda contigo. ¡Busca a la amenaza del Sur y ayúdanos a aplastarla! Los Rauta-väki se encuentran en su campamento en el camino a las tierras llamadas Forodwaith, al sureste de Sûri-kylä. Tráeme sus armas como prueba de tu hazaña.'","Lleva las armas de los Angmarim a Pasi","El campamento de los Angmarim está al sureste de Sûri-kylä, cerca del paso de Forodwaith.\
\
Pasi te ha pedido que le ayudes a derrotar a los Angmarim invasores.","Pasi está en Sûri-kylä, al noroeste del campamento Angmarim.\
\
Deberías volver inmeditamente a ver a Pasi y mostrarle las armas de los Angmarim.","Los Lossoth culpan al duro invierno de la invasión de los Angmarim y te han pedido tu ayuda para expulsarlos.","Consigue armas de los Angmarim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Armas Angmarim conseguidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Impresionante. Debes ser ${PLAYER:un verdadero guerrero[m]|una verdadera guerrera[f]} de tu gente, . Ven, queda más por hacer.'","'Todavía no has reunido suficientes armas, ${PLAYER}.'"},
[13534]={"Los Orcos de los Ghâshfra se pueden encontrar por toda la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Hyrrokkin te ha pedido que derrotes a los Ghâshfra que han invadido la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.","Derrota a los Ghâshfra (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Amenaza de fuego","Los Ghâshfra, una raza de Orcos de fuego de Angmar, han invadido la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.","'Pequeño ser, quizás puedas ayudar a los Eldgangs. Aunque no construimos este lugar, es nuestro hogar ahora, y está amenazado por los Ghâshfra del mundo de la superficie.\
\
'Hay muchos lugares en Nûrz Ghâshu a los que los Eldgangs no pueden ir, porque son demasiado pequeños. Quizás podrías entrar en estos agujeros y expulsar a los Ghâshfra? Entonces podríamos tener la paz de nuevo.\
\
'Hay muchos Ghâshfra en Nûrz Ghâshu. Son como una plaga.'","'Por favor, destruye a los que violan nuestro hogar, ${PLAYER}.'","Ghâshfra derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Muchos han notado tu trabajo al matar a los Orcos de fuego ${PLAYER}.'"},
[13535]={"Habla con Derwent Correhuela y ayúdalo con su problema","Derwent Correhuela se encuentra fuera de la Cárcel de Bree.","'¡Muchas gracias! ¡Contigo a mi lado, no se atreverán a hacer nada!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta es una misión individual y no se puede completar con una comunidad.</rgb>","'Nosotros, los Luchadores, tenemos cierta reputación, ${PLAYER}. La gente dice que donde hay problemas, es probable que uno de los nuestros esté allí empeorándolo todo. ¡Pues yo digo que eso es injusto! A veces mejoramos las cosas, ¿no? ¡Claro que sí!\
\
'Me han llegado rumores de algo así. Hay un Hombre aquí en Bree que se llama Derwent Correhuela, y se encuentra en una situación delicada. Encuéntralo fuera de la Cárcel de Bree y ayúdalo en lo que puedas. Me parece que su problema podría resolverse mejor con un poco de lucha bien aplicada, ¡y quizá les muestres a los incrédulos de qué estamos hechos realmente!\
\
'Seguro que tú también aprenderás algo, y ¿a qué Luchador no le gusta tener un poco más de empuje en cada golpe?'","Derwent Correhuela se encuentra en algún lugar fuera de la Cárcel de Bree, esperando que alguien lo ayude con una situación complicada.","'Supongo que estaba equivocado, ${PLAYER}. La amenaza de un buen puñetazo a veces puede ser suficiente... pero ocasionalmente los puñetazos en sí mismos también pueden ser necesarios.\
\
'Aún así, creo que podría ser hora de que mi familia encuentre un nuevo hogar. No creo que Bill Helechal vaya a dejarnos en paz, incluso con usted cerca para hacer entrar en razón a sus compañeros. Le diré a Robb Espinar que tendrá que encontrar a otra persona. Podría ralentizar el progreso en su sitio de trabajo, pero no hay nada que hacer al respecto.\
\
'Asegúrate de decirle al enano con el que hablé que eligió al Luchador perfecto para ayudarme. Realmente lo aprecio, ${PLAYER}. Quizá nos volvamos a ver.'","'Asegúrate de decirle al enano con el que hablé que eligió ${PLAYER:al Luchador adecuado[m]|a la Luchadora adecuada[f]} para ayudarme. De verdad lo agradezco, ${PLAYER}. Tal vez volvamos a vernos.'","Brom Barbadehalcón se encuentra en la Cárcel de Bree.","'¿Estás... aquí para ayudarme? Me he metido en una situación bastante apretada y no sé cómo salir de ella.\
\
'Verás, he estado trabajando en la Obra de Espinar durante las últimas semanas, y algunos sujetos poco recomendables me han estado presionando para que les pague una parte de mi salario. Logré darles largas unos días, pero si no lo hago pronto temo que puedan ir tras mi familia. Exigieron que me reuniera con ellos en las viejas ruinas de la parte sur del pueblo, después de que caiga la noche, ¡y no sé qué hacer!\
\
'Pareces bastante ${PLAYERNAME:bueno[m]|buena[f]} para pelear. ¿Crees que podrías venir conmigo a la reunión y quizá quedarte cerca con aspecto serio? No quiero que nadie salga herido, pero tal vez verte sea suficiente para convencerlos de que me dejen en paz. ¿Qué dices?'","La amenaza de un buen puñetazo","Habla con Derwent Correhuela fuera de la Cárcel de Bree","'Hay un Hombre aquí en Bree que responde al nombre de Derwent Correhuela, y se encuentra en una situación bastante delicada. Encuéntralo fuera de la cárcel y ayúdalo en lo que puedas. Me parece que su problema podría resolverse mejor con un poco de lucha hábil, ¡y quizá les muestres a los incrédulos algo de nuestra verdadera calidad!\
\
'Seguro que tú también aprenderás algo, y ¿a qué Luchador no le gusta tener un poco más de empuje en cada golpe?'","Los Luchadores tienen fama en todas las tierras de la Tierra Media de estar siempre metidos en problemas, pero a veces pueden evitar males mayores con solo hacerse presentes.","'Les mostraste a esos rufianes que no deben meterse con un Luchador, ¿eh? ¡Ja! Bien hecho, y que lo recuerden. Claro que, si los golpeaste tan fuerte como parece, quizá no recuerden la lección en absoluto...\
\
'En cualquier caso, me hiciste sentir orgulloso, ${PLAYER}. ¡Toma esta recompensa y sigue evitando problemas... o causándolos!'"},
[13536]={"'Thank you for your help, ${CLASS}. I will be more vigilant in my watch of our realm so the Taurogrim can never again return.'","Threat of the Taurogrim","Defeat Taurogrim in Tholkát (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Thorlind","Thorlind can be found near Tholkát.\
\
You should talk to Thorlind.","The Taurogrim have taken over an area of Eryn Lasgalen called Tholkát. Thorlind has asked you to defeat them so their evil cannot spread.","'Though we have defeated one of their leaders, the Taurogrim still swarm these pine barrens. We have truly come to the heart of this evil and must purge these abominations before they threaten Felegoth. Enter Tholkát and defeat as many Taurogrim as you can before their numbers can overwhelm us.'","Taurogrim wood-trolls can be found in Tholkát, in northern Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should defeat wood-trolls in Tholkát.","Defeated Taurogrim in Tholkát (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13537]={"'Well done. The blow you have dealt these Orcs is sure to have left them reeling. Without a doubt, they will be fleeing from this region in no time.'","Talk to Lanbert at the Cuthstan-camp","Lanbert is at the Rohirrim-camp at the base of the Cuthstan.\
\
You have thinned the numbers of the Orc-tribe, and Lanbert awaits your return.","The tribe of Orc-vandals is south-west of the Cuthstan.\
\
Lanbert has asked you to thin out the numbers of the Orc-tribe, in the hopes of scaring them from the area.","Defeat Nink-hai sentries (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A band of disorganized Orcs has roamed into the areas south of the Cuthstan and has vandalized the monument. The leader of the Rohirrim there hopes that thinning the tribe's numbers may scare the rest of the Orcs into retreating from the area.","Defeated Nink-hai skirmishers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Nink-hai ravagers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Nink-hai skirmishers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Orcs have built some small huts and tents to the south, and there have been several roaming just south of the roads. Remember to return here when your work is done.'","Threatening the Vandals","'I assure you that the wretched Orcs responsible for damaging the Cuthstan pose no further threat. They seem wholly disorganized. We are simply here to protect the statue, and that is what we will do.\
\
'Their intrusion onto our lands from their caves in the mountains, however, has become quite bothersome. I wager that if you were to thin their numbers a bit, they would feel threatened enough to retreat back into their holes.'","Defeat Nink-hai ravagers(${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Nink-hai sentries (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13538]={"'Al enfrentarlo, un temible bandido llamado Dirk Espino, temo haber condenado a todos. Instaló un campamento inmediatamente al este, justo en el lado sur de las ruinas.\
\
'Amenazó con volver con suficientes fuerzas para \\qborrar mi pequeño hogar antes de que pueda ser reconocido como algo más que un terreno quemado\\q. ¡Por los cielos! Qué necio he sido.\
\
'Por favor, ${PLAYER}, ayúdame a corregir este error para que pueda ver este sueño hecho realidad.'","Derrota a Dirk Espino","Dirk Espino está en el lado sur del muro en ruinas, al pie de las colinas que rodean las Quebradas de los Túmulos, al este del campamento de Adso.\
\
Adso teme que el líder bandido, Dirk Espino, regrese y mate a sus trabajadores durante la noche, y te pidió que te ocuparas de esta amenaza antes de que cumpla su amenaza.","Habla con Adso Henoloma","Adso espera tu regreso en su campamento junto al Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Los bandidos en el muro en ruinas demostraron no ser una verdadera amenaza y fueron eliminados con facilidad.","Dirk Espino derrotado","'Con Dirk Espino fuera de juego, ¿me pregunto si podremos darle a Bill Helechal de su propia medicina?'","'Por favor, no dejes que los bandidos vengan aquí y maten a esta gente. Todos son inocentes. Odiaría que les ocurriera algo por mi imprudencia.'","Amenazas y consecuencias","Los problemas de Adso se agravan a medida que los bandidos se vuelven más agresivos hacia el pobre hobbit."},
[13539]={"A fearsome two-headed troll Grush-and-Flak has been attacking a wide array of troops throughout the countryside. Find the creature and drive it from the battlefield.","Threats to the Battlefield: Grush-and-Flak","A fearsome two-headed troll named Grush-and-Flak has been routing a wide array of troops throughout the countryside. Find the creature and drive it from the battlefield.","Defeat Grush-and-Flak","'The fearsome two-headed troll Grush-and-Flak has been routed, bringing some stability to the region.\
\
'Thank you kindly for this dangerous work.'","Let Hlóthi know that Grush-and-Flak has been driven off.","The fearsome two-headed troll Grush-and-Flak has been attacking a wide array of troops throughout the countryside. Find the creature and drive it from the battlefield.","Within the troops pushing towards our encampment, the monstrous two-headed troll Grush-and-Flak has battered the forces of the Gabil'akkâ throughout the region. This horrific beast is said to have consumed several patrols during its reign of terror.","Defeated Grush-and-Flak","Speak to Hlóthi"},
[13541]={"The ferocious Warg Mozlut has been rampaging across Elderslade. This beast has struck fear in the hearts of many proud dwarves and feasted upon several patrols.\
\
Drive back this foul creature, so that patrols may resume throughout the area.","Defeat Mozlut","Threats to the Battlefield: Mozlut","'With this horrific beast driven off, patrols securing our flanks can resume unencumbered.'","Drove off Mozlut","Speak to Hlóthi","Find Hlóthi and inform him that you were able to drive off the beast.","Mozlut is an enormous Warg who has been rampaging across the battlefield. Drive off this foul beast."},
[13543]={"Talk to Scout-master Ausma","You have aided the dwarf scouts with their missions.\
\
You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in Bárgstad.","'Many questions remain unanswered, and much of the Pit of Stonejaws has yet to be explored. I have sent out my apprentices to investigate areas of interest. Your next mission is to go out and find each one, help them if they require it, and report back with what they have learned of the hobgoblin and Angmarim plans. Most importantly, learn what you can about this Loknashra! She is an unknown factor in all of this, and I don't like not knowing things!'","Three Dangerous Spots","Complete 'Lair of the Frost-horde' from Ausma","Ausma has sent her apprentices to several points of interest around the Pit of Stonejaws to investigate the plans of the hobgoblins and Angmarim.","Complete 'The Tombs of Akhaldarâg' from Ausma","Scout-master Ausma's apprentices have been sent to points of interest around the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should find Kyrstig, Molkha, and Klúso and assist them with their missions.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, you have returned. How are my apprentices doing? Tell me everything!'\
\
You tell Ausma of the out-camp you ransacked, pinning the blame on Gorgar's forces; of the drake nest you disrupted; of the unpleasant information you learned regarding the Angmarim and Loknashra. You hand her the two notes you found. She reads them quickly and looks at you with an eyebrow sharply raised.\
\
'The Cult of Drugoth? Wasn't he one of the Gauntlords? And isn't he dead? I think we're dealing with necromancers. And this Loknashra character seems to have more influence here than the warlord wanted to admit, if her agreement with the Angmarim was sufficient to end all hobgoblin-raids on their settlements. This is very troubling. Is there something else, ${PLAYER}? I see that look on your face.'\
\
You carefully remove the crystal the goblin gave you from your bag and hand it to her slowly. She hesitantly accepts it, and winces.\
\
'Ah, the Angmarim are still playing with their crystals, I see. This one seems a little different than those Mother Amma showed me in the Elderslade. A more thorough investigation will have to wait. We need to move on the Angmarim and remove them from the Pit of Stonejaws before they raise an army of ancient dwarf lords to kill us all!'","Complete 'The Camps of Stazg Vozag' from Ausma"},
[13545]={"Having secured the pledge from the Easterling Lord Khôpol, you should return to Kurtil and the other forge-workers where they had been, on the height above Maudhúl Vôr.","You deliver the hail correctly and presently an Easterling Lord appears with several men","You begin to explain the case of the forge-workers, but he quickly interrupts you.\
\
'You speak as if the Eye was fallen. You speak as if the Cause was lost. This is not so and cannot be. How could it be, for the Black Gates still stand and the great banner still waves like a lone wing above the parade grounds. Why, only this morning I sent an Orc with a letter to the Black Word's commissary in Maudhúl Vôr. As sure as the ground I stand on, it has been delivered and needed provisions are on their way.'\
\
When you do not back down, he stares hard at you.\
\
'Folly! There is deceit afoot, if not by you, then by someone. I will send Yordam. He will go with you so that the truth may be known to me. Go.'","This is a good spot to hail the Easterlings","You should talk to the Easterling Lord who responded to your hailing, outside Rhûd Vorn, on the northern slopes of Udûn.","'Long is the tale to tell, but short is the time. Do you remember that the Captain of the Pit does not hear the signal flags' speech? He is the master of all Udûn, but many do not wish it so.\
\
'When the ground shook and the gates fell and the Eagles crossed the skies, a light dawned upon our minds - that we might fly ourselves. Fly like the eagles and in Udûn dwell no more. But how? And then we remember the Easterlings camped in Rhûd Vorn. Perhaps, we thought, perhaps we might go back with them, to the lands far from Captains and cruel Gondorians and Elves.\
\
'And so in flags was it written and in flags was it read by you and me and by others. Ushkbál the goodly overseer agreed to go before the Easterlings and plead our case. Now Ushkbál is gone and our hope rests on you, ${RACE}-${CLASS}. We ask you to go in Ushkbál's place and parley with the Easterlings. Only to meet! To speak awhile of what may be. \
\
'Stand before Rhûd Vorn high on the height and hail them with the words that I will teach you. \
\
Kurtil teaches you a formal military hail in the Easterling tongue.\
\
'If fortune smiles upon us, they will agree.'","You have agreed to petition the Easterlings for a meeting with the forge-workers, so that they may beg safe passage out of Udûn.","'I have seen the proofs, though I hardly believed my eyes. A ${RACE} from the West has spoken the truth! I return to Rhûd Vorn, as should you.'","Three Proofs","You should lead Yordam the Easterling to a view of the Black Gates, the Great Flag on the parade grounds, and seek the letter dispatched to Maudhúl Vôr.\
\
If you get separated from Yordam, wind his horn to call him back to you.","'I will go with you, as my Lord commands. We will see what we will see.'","Now that you have found the fallen banner, the dead letter-bearer, and the Black Gates broken, you should talk to Yordam.\
\
If you get separated from Yordam, wind his horn to call him back to you.","The Orc messenger lies dead, the letter still in his hand","Talk to the Easterling Lord","You should hail the Easterlings as Kurtil taught you before their camp, Rhûd Vorn, on the northern slopes of Udûn.","'So you are the ${CLASS}. Kurtil did not mention you were ${RACE}! If you ask me, we're in a hard place, all told. I don't know where to turn.'","'Go with Yordam to the Great Banner, Maudhúl Vôr, and the Black Gates. You will see. The war is not lost, even if it is not yet won.'","'I see. So it is as you spoke.'\
\
The Easterling Lord thinks for a moment.\
\
'Yes, we will meet with these forge-workers and speak to them. You may carry them this pledge, ${CLASS}.'","'You are returned! And they have pledged their word? Strong as iron, an Easterling's pledge.\
\
'See now who has also arrived. It is Gradrágh, another overseer. He wants only some persuading.'","Find the letter","Now that you have collected the proofs, you should return to Khôpol before Rhûd Vorn, on the northern slopes of Udûn.","DNT find quartermaster loc","'The Captain of the Pit and the Men of the West are like two stones, ${PLAYER}, and we the roots who will be ground between them. We must beg the Easterlings safe passage back to their lands, and we rely on you to go before them. \
\
'Go then. Go to Rhûd Vorn and hail them as I showed you.'","<rgb=#FF00FF>Hail</rgb> the Easterlings before Rhûd Vorn","Talk to Yordam","Return to Kurtil","DNT banner loc","Return to Khôpol","Bring Yordam to the Black Gate","Find the great banner","The great banner lies torn and muddied on the ground"},
[13546]={"'¡Ah, una cara de alguien civilizado por fin! ¿Podrías ayudarme? Nuestra comunidad llegó a Forochel hace unos días, pero por tonterías y contratiempos nos separamos. He pasado los últimos dos días huyendo por esta tierra indómita tratando de escapar de hombres y bestias salvajes por igual, hasta que finalmente encontré refugio aquí.\
\
'¡Imagina mi consternación cuando descubrí que varias partituras de mi más preciado himno se habían perdido durante mi huida! ¡Necesito recuperar esas partituras! Pensando en mis desventuras de los últimos días, creo saber dónde podrían haberse perdido. Verás, había un enorme oso, que intentó robar las raciones de mi mochila antes de que lograra calmar a la criatura con mis canciones y escaparme... solo para tropezar con una banda de esas horribles bestias de nieve o lo que quiera que sean... Creo que los lugareños las llaman peikko. En cualquier caso, casi los tenía encandilados a todos ellos con mi mejor actuación hasta ahora, ¡cuando un cazador Gauredain se acercó sigilosamente y casi me atraviesa con una lanza!\
\
'Huelga decir que esos hombres salvajes son pobres mecenas del arte en el mejor de los casos, y tomé la señal para huir al amparo de la noche. No fue hasta más tarde, cuando tuve la oportunidad de recuperar el sentido común, que me di cuenta de que mi preciado himno había desaparecido. ¿Podrías dar caza a esas horribles bestias y recuperar mi música? Podría recompensarte por ello.'","Encontrada la segunda partitura de Burgthryth","Tres partituras al viento","Encuentra la primera partitura de Burgthryth","Encuentra la segunda partitura de Burgthryth","Llévale a Burgthryth las partituras de su himno a Jänis-leiri","Encontrada la primera partitura de Burgthryth","Encontrada la tercera partitura de Burgthryth","Encuentra la tercera partitura de Burgthryth","Burgthryth cree que la primera de sus partituras fue sacada de su mochila por un oso de la tundra. Tendrás que dar caza a estos animales hasta que encuentres al que se la robó, suponiendo que no la haya devorado ya.\
\
Los osos de la tundra pueden encontrarse en la tundra de Länsi-mâ.","Burgthryth te ha dicho que un peikko curioso podría haber cogido la segunda partitura de su himno mientras ella tocaba.\
\
Tendrás que dar caza al peikko que se la robó.\
\
Hay muchos peikko en una pequeña cueva al este de Zigilgund.","Burgthryth piensa que probablemente la tercera partitura de su himno se le cayó cuando era perseguida por cazadores Gauredain. Tendrás que dar caza a los Gauredain y recuperar esa partitura antes de que la usen como pañuelo... o algo peor.\
\
Los Gauredain pueden encontrarse en la tundra de Länsi-mâ.","Después de separarse del resto de su comunidad a causa de una tormenta, Burgthryth fue perseguida por una variedad de bestias hostiles. Durante su huida, perdió algunas de sus más preciadas partituras y está desesperada por volver a encontrarlas.","Burgthryth está en Jänis-leiri.\
\
Has encontrado todas las partituras perdidas del himno de Burgthryth. Deberías devolvérselas cuanto antes.","'¿Las has encontrado? ¡Las has encontrado todas! ¡Oh, muchas gracias!\
\
'Este es uno de los mejores himnos de nuestra época... bueno, lo será una vez lo haya terminado. ¿Vendrás a escuchar mi actuación cuando esté listo, ¿verdad? Debería ser capaz de terminarlo una vez encuentre al resto de mi comunidad y salgamos de esta indómita y maldita tierra.\
\
'Sin embargo, todavía hay un pequeño problema más...'","'Oh, ${PLAYER}, ¿podrías ayudarme a encontrar esas partituras perdidas? No podría soportar perderlas de esta manera.'"},
[13547]={"'Nuestra presa tiene un gusto espantoso en lo que come, pero ataca todo lo que se acerca demasiado. Los sinnombre deberían bastar para complacerla.'","Emoción del peligro","Dithrik te ha encargado obtener materiales que ayudarán a desafiar un antiguo horror de eras pasadas.","'Bien hallado, ${PLAYER}. Buscabas a Dithrik, y a Dithrik has encontrado. Soy un defensor de mis hermanos enanos y de todos los buenos pueblos de esta Tierra Media; en eso somos parecidos.\
\
'Puedo ver que tu brazo del escudo es tan fuerte como la piedra que sostiene las montañas, y en tus ojos reconozco la luz de una viva esperanza que desafía la oscuridad de la desesperación. Eres ${PLAYER:un verdadero Guardián[m]|una verdadera Guardiana[f]}, y tengo justo la tarea adecuada para alguien como tú.\
\
'Existe un horror ancestral de días anteriores incluso a cuando el Daño de Durin afligió nuestro hogar de Moria. Los enanos lo han visto cerca de aquí, en las Fundaciones de Piedra, y los rumores sobre su terror se esparcen lejos. Encuentra y mata a los Sinnombre, pues caminan sin oposición. Tráeme las cabezas intactas de estas criaturas para que podamos preparar un cebo adecuado para el terror más antiguo.'","Los seres Sinnombre y la antigua criatura merodean por los alrededores de las Fundaciones de Piedra, especialmente hacia el sureste de esta región.\
\
Dithrik te ha pedido que recojas doce cabezas intactas de los Sin Nombre de las Fundaciones de Piedra.","Regresa con Dithrik en las Fundaciones de Piedra","Recoge cabezas de Sinnombre (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cabeza de Sinnombre recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Excelente trabajo, ${PLAYER}. Ahora, pasemos a tu siguiente tarea...'"},
[13550]={"'We have no time to waste, ${PLAYER}. Every moment we delay allows Zarhal Kôz a chance to bolster his defences or flee. Yet, he is fool enough to have camped within these very lands!\
\
'He dwells in a camp called Uya Hujûm, and its defences are built into the slopes of the Mountains of Shadow. \
\
'There are two ways by which we can approach Uya Hujûm. The first is through the pass of Cirith Negen. Zarhal Kôz may be a fool, but none would underestimate its value as an ideal spot for an ambush. We cannot go by that way, ${CLASS}. The second way is along the western road, which snakes northward towards Dagorlad and then forks to the east... to the base of his encampment beyond the pass of Cirith Negen.\
\
'This is the path we must take, and we must move now.\
\
'If you wish to follow us, you need not fear the Khundolar as you travel. My men and I shall make sure Zarhal Kôz knows we are coming... and that his warriors cannot stop us!'","Find Jarl Gurthilm and his company near Uya Hujûm","Jarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the south-east of Uya Hujûm.\
\
You have followed Jarl Gurthilm's company to a trail of dead and should now seek the Variag company nearby.","Follow the roadway eastward towards Uya Hujûm","Follow the roadway northward towards Dagorlad","Talk to Jarl Gurthilm outside Uya Hujûm","The roadway north can be found far to north-west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You are following the roadway and should continue to follow Jarl Gurthilm's company to the Khundolar encampment.","Even more Khundolar have fallen in the Variags' wake...","A trail of slain Khundolar leads to the north-east...","These Khundolar appeared to turn eastward to flee before they were slain...","Cair Andros can be found on the Anduin in north-western North Ithilien and its road leads northward towards Dagorlad.\
\
Jarl Gurthilm has asked you to follow the western roadway northward through Ithilien and follow his company to the Khundolar encampment.","A journey home has become a journey of vengeance as the Variags seek to avenge their fallen kin and slay their treacherous Khundolar benefactor.","'It has all led to this, ${CLASS}.\
\
'Across the river, our foe cowers behind his men... but he cannot hide from us any longer.'","More slain Khundolar are strewn across the bridge...","Continue to follow the roadway towards Dagorlad","Jarl Gurthilm's warriors pace restlessly as he peers across the river at Uya Hujûm","Jarl Gurthilm's company has cut a path through the Khundolar along the roadway!","The roadway travels eastward through North Ithilien can be found to the north of Henneth Annûn.\
\
The roadway has forked eastward and you should continue to follow Jarl Gurthilm's company to the Khundolar encampment.","Through War-torn Lands","Follow the western roadway northward from Cair Andros","Jarl Gurthilm can be found in north-eastern North Ithilien at the foot of Uya Hujûm.\
\
You have found Jarl Gurthilm and his company and should now speak to him."},
[13551]={"'Adiós, amigos. Volveremos a vernos, si Teodoro no logra que me devore un dragón antes. Ahora que lo pienso, soportar un poco más de su estupidez quizá haría que eso pareciera una misericordia.\
\
'Avísame si en tus futuros viajes encuentras algún dragón hambriento, ${PLAYER}. Por si acaso.'","'Ha sido un viaje muy agradable, amigos míos, pero hay aventuras aún mayores que reclaman mi atención. Puede que me haya retirado de la búsqueda de tesoros y que ya haya tenido suficiente de dragones, pero sin duda hay otras aventuras ahí fuera, esperando ser vividas.\
\
'¡Les doy a ti y a Bingo una afectuosa despedida! Y si alguna vez necesitan un compañero de viaje en el futuro, busquen el lugar más peligroso... ¡porque allí es donde me encontrarán!'","Bingo está listo para dejar Maur Tulhau y continuar su viaje hacia el norte.","Habla con Haley Pradodulce en Andrath","'Orcos, semiorcos y otros tipos aún más repugnantes han levantado un campamento en el camino del norte y no dejan pasar a nadie. Puede haber combates si intentan seguir esa ruta. ¡Cuida de Bingo! Sé que no hace falta que te lo diga, pero hazlo de todos modos, ${PLAYER}!'","'Supongo que al final no eres un duvodiad. Viaja con cuidado por los caminos que salen de los Valles Sombríos. ¡Regresa algún día con Bingo y seguro que Rhus te dará una bienvenida cordial!'","'Me alegra mucho haberlos conocido a ambos y haber visto su encantador pueblo. ¿Hobbits tan lejos de la Comarca y tan lejos de Bree? ¡Qué maravilla!'","'Me despediré de la buena gente de este pueblo y me reuniré contigo en el sendero del sur a la salida del pueblo, ${PLAYER}.'","'¿Orcos en el camino del norte? Fue muy amable por parte de Iola advertirnos, pero no dejaremos que el miedo nos impida continuar nuestro viaje.\
\
'Avísame cuando puedas partir y volveremos a poner los pies en el camino.'","'Me entristece verlos partir, ${PLAYER}, pero supongo que todo viaje debe llegar a su fin en algún momento. ¡El final de mi propio viaje se acerca!\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Bartolín ha llegado a Andrath, en las Tierras de Bree.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Siguiente semana: 'Bingo Regresa a Casa' (Nivel recomendado: 93)</rgb>'","'Are you ready to leave Maur Tulhau? I will say my good-byes to the good folk of this village and meet you at the southern path out of the village, ${PLAYER}.'","Bingo ha atravesado el bloqueo y ahora se encuentra en Andrath, en el extremo sur de las Tierras de Bree.","Habla con Teodoro Tojo en Andrath","Haley Pradodulce y Teodoro Tojo se encuentran ahora en Andrath, en el extremo sur de las Tierras de Bree.","'Hemos recorrido un largo camino, ${PLAYER}, y los senderos arbolados de las Tierras de Bree resultan muy acogedores en comparación con algunos de los lugares que hemos atravesado. ¿Recuerdas cuando comenzamos? Bree parecía tan lejano y exótico, pero ahora se me antoja amigable y pintoresco.\
\
'Es un regreso alegre, pero mi corazón no está del todo contento hoy, pues Haley y Teodoro han decidido separarse de nosotros ahora que hemos vuelto a las tierras del norte.'","Habla con Bingo en Andrath","'Estoy listo para partir si tú lo estás, ${PLAYER}.'","Habla con Rhus Cornchúthur en la entrada de Maur Tulhau","'¡Voy a extrañar a estos dos, ${PLAYER}!'","Bingo está en la entrada de Maur Tulhau, en los Valles Sombríos.\
\
Bingo ya se ha despedido y ahora está listo para continuar su viaje hacia el norte.","'¡Ya estamos casi en casa!'","'Realmente deberíamos volver.'","Habla con Iola Isbrun en la entrada de Maur Tulhau","'No solemos alejarnos mucho de Maur Tulhau, pero de vez en cuando alguien de nuestra gente siente el llamado del viaje y nos trae noticias de tierras lejanas. Por eso quiero advertirte sobre el camino del norte.\
\
'Orcos, semiorcos y otros tipos aún más repugnantes han acampado por allí y no dejan pasar a nadie. Puede haber combates si intentan seguir ese camino. ¡Cuida de Bingo! Sé que lo harás, pero aun así te lo digo, ${PLAYER}!'","A Través del Bloqueo","Habla con Bingo en la entrada de Maur Tulhau","Bingo se está despidiendo de los hobbits de Maur Tulhau y dijo que se reuniría contigo en la salida sur del pueblo.","Habla con Bingo en la entrada de Maur Tulhau y continúa el viaje hacia el norte","Bingo se encuentra ahora en Andrath, en el extremo sur de las Tierras de Bree."},
[13552]={"Find the raven that spied upon the Grey Mountains","'You have done well to rescue my people, ${PLAYER}, but now I ask that you hear my counsel.\
\
'I shall tell what I have learned, and you would be wise to listen. There are strange faces come to the Iron Hills; alike yet different. I do not think they shall play a role in these dealings, but that remains to be seen. Karazgar moves silently under the eaves of the forest that was Mirkwood, but he has not travelled far. Whatever wound he once bore no longer burdens him. The cold-drake named Vethúg has stirred in the old halls of the great folk of Durin. The gates of the Steel Keep are open, and a bitter cold has swept over the Grey Mountains. He shall soon fly for Erebor, and it is then Durin's Folk shall be tested. The Mountain is wide enough to shelter all, but there must remain those who will take up arms.\
\
'The wisdom of King Thorin and those he trusts must now decide your course. I have spoken.'","Talk to King Thorin III","The raven who spied the Grey Mountains can be found upon the western slopes of Erebor.\
\
You have found the lost raven and should now examine it.","Arcah can be found at Ravenhill.\
\
You found the ravens who failed to answer Arcah's call and should now return to her with these tidings.","Talk to Arcah","The missing raven would have flown from the Grey Mountains, so it can likely be found somewhere among the north-western slopes of Erebor.\
\
After it failed to return from spying in the Grey Mountains, Arcah has asked you to seek a lost raven on the slopes of Erebor.","A lone raven lies wounded upon the western slopes of Erebor...","To your relief, it appears the raven was only left stunned by a recent encounter with a foe, but escaped before a more serious wound could be inflicted.\
\
As you move to aid the raven, it lets out a bubbling croak in fear!","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have learned that Vethúg Wintermind has stirred in the Grey Mountains and now prepares to fly for Erebor. You should inform King Thorin III at once.","Having regained its strength, the raven flies for Ravenhill!","Arcah can be found at Ravenhill.\
\
You were able to rescue the raven that spied upon the Grey Mountains. You should now return to Arcah.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}. I did not expect to see you this day, but it has proven to be one of many curiosities.\
\
'I called my people to return to the hill, but four have not yet returned from their spying. One among them flew the furthest abroad, but the other three did not have such a journey ahead or behind them. We are fewer in number still than we were in the days of the last king to bear Thorin's name, and I grow concerned on their behalf.\
\
'Perhaps they did not hear my call, or perhaps they were discovered by unfriendly eyes. One flew into the forest that was Mirkwood, another to the Iron Hills, and another among the Dale-lands.\
\
'If King Thorin seeks the sight and wisdom of the ravens, you must do this. Seek out my people and send them to the hill. It is then you shall learn what you seek!'","Find ravens that failed to answer Arcah's call and send them to Ravenhill (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Three of my people were lost, and three are now found.\
\
'If you would hear my counsel, you must now seek the fourth. I sent him to spy upon the Grey Mountains, and it will be his account that determines the course of the folk of Durin.\
\
'You should begin your search on the slopes of Erebor. If some trouble has befallen him, he will have flown there.'","'I am glad you have returned, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I received word from Dís that Arcah's ravens have begun to return to Ravenhill, and I would like to know what they have learned concerning the plots of Karazgar and Vethúg Wintermind. Alas, there are matters I must attend to here in Erebor or I would make the journey myself!\
\
'Will you go to Ravenhill and seek the counsel of Arcah on my behalf? I trust you will recount every detail to me upon your return!'","Through the Eyes of Ravens","Talk to Arcah at Ravenhill","Arcah can be found at Ravenhill.\
\
After learning that some of Arcah's ravens have begun to return from their spying, King Thorin III has asked you to seek the counsel of Arcah at Ravenhill.","Arcah, the raven-chief, has summoned her kin back to Ravenhill, but a few of her ravens have not answered her call.","The missing ravens can likely be found in the heights of Eryn Lasgalen and Dale or somewhere near the banks of the River Running.\
\
After they each failed to answer her call, Arcah has asked you to seek three ravens in the lands of the North and send them to Ravenhill.","Appearing to understand, the raven flies off towards Ravenhill!","'It has been quite some time, ${PLAYER}. What tidings do you bring? What did Arcah's ravens discover?'\
\
You recount Arcah's telling of what her people spied in Eryn Lasgalen, Dale, the Iron Hills, and the Grey Mountains. You warn King Thorin that Vethúg Wintermind prepares to fly from the Steel Keep in the Grey Mountains, and that Karazgar still plots some evil from the shadows of Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
'Arcah is of the great ravens, and so, I do not doubt her wisdom. Vethúg will soon come to Erebor, and I shall make certain that the other folk of this realm are protected from his wrath.'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Next week: 'Many Preparations'</rgb>","Examine the wounded raven"},
[13553]={"'¿No encontraste nada? Es como yo creía. Mithrandir no sería tan imprudente como para dejarse atrapar de nuevo por Saruman el Blanco. La Compañía no pasó por aquí.'","Rinneldor te ha pedido que busques a Limlaer, que vigila cerca de la frontera sur de Eregion.","Habla con Limlaer","Limlaer se encuentra al suroeste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon.\
\
Debes informar tus hallazgos a Limlaer.","A través del Paso de Rohan","'¡Nan Curunír es un lugar peligroso! ¡Ten cuidado en tus viajes, ${PLAYER}!'","'La torre se encuentra al suroeste, a la vista de Limlaer. Encuentra la colina y <rgb=#FF0000>mira</rgb> señales del paso de la Compañía.'","Encuentra la torre en la colina","La torre se encuentra en una colina, al suroeste de Limlaer, que se encuentra cerca del camino que conduce al suroeste desde Echad Dúnann.\
\
Limlaer te ha pedido que vayas a una torre cercana y <rgb=#FF0000>mires</rgb> señales del paso de la Compañía.","Busca señales de la Compañía","No ves ningún signo de la Compañía","'¡Mae govannen! ¿Fuiste enviado por Rinneldor, verdad? Me han encargado buscar en las fronteras del sur de esta tierra señales del paso de la Compañía, pero hasta ahora no he encontrado nada.\
\
'Rinneldor cree que podrían haber pasado por aquí, aunque cualquier viajero cerca de Nan Curunír tendría que ser cauteloso... ¡y ninguno más que la Compañía!\
\
'Te pido que viajes hacia el suroeste y me ayudes en mi búsqueda. Encontrarás una torre justo al suroeste de aquí, en la cima de una colina. Está orientada hacia el Paso de Rohan. <rgb=#FF0000>Mira</rgb> desde esa colina y reporta cualquier cosa que encuentres.'","Encontraste la torre en la colina"},
[13554]={"Heed the Ranger's orders","Talk to Thurindol at Henneth Annûn","'I am glad you have come as I asked, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Some of my brethren here appear to have captured a band of Southrons. I cannot understand their purpose in doing so, as the Rangers do not often permit prisoners... or even guests!\
\
'I trust that there is wisdom in their actions, but I do not have time to remain here and investigate further. Instead, I leave that task to you.\
\
'I must return to my captain, Anborn, and tell him of the many things I have witnessed in Ithilien and on the Pelennor.\
\
'I shall continue onward to Henneth Annûn, and when you are ready, you should follow in my path. Head north along the roadway, and I will guide you to the refuge.'","A Ranger calls out to you and orders you to hold!","'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Even after such a great battle, the memory of your deeds in South Ithilien has not left me or my company. Lord Faramir is safe and heals within Minas Tirith, and my captain, Anborn, has returned to the refuge of Henneth Annûn with most of our company.\
\
'The Dark Lord has not taken his defeat lightly, and he has sent his forces into North Ithilien to strike before the Host of the West can reach the Black Gate.\
\
'My company and I would have much use for a ${CLASS} of your skill, especially after such a victory has been won against the Enemy. \
\
'There are a few more matters I wish to speak of here, but then I would ask that you meet me at the baths of Aelin Veren - far to the north along the roadway. Will you aid me, my friend?'","Aelin Veren can be found in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have arrived at Aelin Veren to find a party of Rangers in need of aid. Thurindol has asked you to aid them before meeting him further north along the road.","Thurindol can be found within Henneth Annûn in north-central North Ithilien.\
\
You have been brought to Henneth Annûn by Dornach and should now seek out Thurindol.","Dornach is standing along the main roadway in central North Ithilien.\
\
A Ranger named Dornach has asked you to heed his orders if you wish to travel to Henneth Annûn.","North Ithilien, home to the last refuge of the Rangers of Ithilien, is the border between Gondor and the lands of the Enemy.","Aid the Rangers at Aelin Veren as much as you are able, and when you are ready to move on, meet Thurindol along the road to the north","Thurindol can be found at Aelin Veren, far to the north of the Cross-roads in North Ithilien.\
\
Thurindol has asked you to aid him with a few tasks before meeting him at the baths of Aelin Veren.","Aid Thurindol with as many of his tasks as you are able, and when you are ready to move on, meet him at Aelin Veren","Through the Gardens of Gondor","Thurindol stifles a laugh as you approach him.\
\
'I'm sorry, ${PLAYER}...\
\
'Dornach is a careful man, and that has always been a boon to our company. This time, it had the benefit of giving all of us a good laugh!\
\
'In the end, we have reunited as I had hoped. You are here, and there is much to be done if we are to clear the way for the Host of the West.'"},
[13555]={"'Greetings again, ${PLAYER}. I waited at the Forest Gate until the Elves finally allowed me to pass through, a process that took much longer than I liked! I did not wish to anger my sire, so I did not complain very much to the Elves about their obvious reluctance to open the way.\
\
'I have not left the Beorninghús since I returned. Langhár's stories about the Wolf-denes have filled me up with caution, and I do not plan to venture past the vineyard.'","'Look around you, and tell me what you see. You see peace, and you see safety! It is not easily won, and even less-easily kept! My husband, Grimbeorn, fought many battles to make it so, and he has shown no sign of stopping any day soon. Let the darkness beware!\
\
'I am Gírta, matron of the Beorninghús. My husband and our kin will fight to protect this way of life from each danger that threatens. If you search for such dangers, you will find them nearby.'","Talk to Varthmath","'I was shown kindness by the Elves of Felegoth, as I would not have expected. I told Grimbeorn my story of the foes that ambushed me, and of the evil that lurks within the Elf-woods. They say they have cleansed the forest, but I hold that no Beorning should take the risk. It is still \\qMirkwood\\q to me.'","Talk to Hállkell","Gírta, Sterkist, Varthmath, and Hállkell can all be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should talk to Gírta, Sterkist, Varthmath, and Hállkell before you set out to explore the Vale.","Bring the trophies to Grimbeorn","'These trophies are certainly respectable, though they were not in life! Ha!\
\
'They show what I expected them to show: that although the war may be done, its soldiers remain a threat to the Vales of Anduin. The trade route must remain closed, for the safety of my people.'","Find a suitable trophy from Ylgraf","Grimbeorn, the leader of the Beornings, is worried about threats in the Vales of Anduin that are affecting his people and their way of life.","Talk to Gírta","The entrance to the Floodfells and Ylgraf can be found at the northern edge of the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should scout the entrance to the Floodfells and Ylgraf for Grimbeorn.","This Orc head will do well as a trophy for Grimbeorn","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorninglands.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","Wargs are numerous here","Scout the entrance to the Floodfells","'I am called Varthmath. I have recently come home after travelling in the Misty Mountains, where my people once lived. Alas for the dwarves and the Orcs, for their wars drove us out and now it is no longer safe to return. A pox on the cursed halls of Moria! So many evils have come out of the darkness of that place that now the mountains are lost to us. I do not know if it will ever be safe to return there.'","Orcs from Gundabad have blocked the road and few keep watch over the northern edge","Through the Vale","Find a suitable trophy from near the Floodfells","'The darkness has spread across the mountains into formerly peaceful valleys, and these lands of mine are no exception. Orcs and wargs spy on my people from among the trees. Goblins creep from their holes in greater numbers than ever before. Even the beasts of the wood are angered... not just by strangers, but by me, once their trusted friend and companion!\
\
'Speak to my kin in the vales, and every one of my people will confirm I speak the truth, and that it needs addressing! Once you have spoken to them, journey north to the edge of the Floodfells and find signs of the danger that creeps ever nearer to my home.'","Talk to Sterkist","This warg hide will do well as a trophy for Grimbeorn","Scout Ylgraf"},
[13556]={"Plas-maru lies to the east of Ilar's camp.\
\
Ilar has asked you to defeat the wights guarding the entrance to Plas-maru and put to rest their captain.","Ilar is at his camp, west of Plas-maru.\
\
You should bring word to Ilar of your victory against the wights.","'These are sad days for our people, Duvodiad. Those who went before us and guided us for generations are being defiled by those who have betrayed us. I fear that Plas-maru, the cairn of our greatest leaders, has fallen as well, but it may be that you will learn more of the evil there.\
\
'The entrance to Plas-maru lies to the east of here. Travel there and defeat the wights which stand guard outside its entrance.'","'I hope that with the defeat of these abominations, our ancestors will be left to rest.\
\
'Thank you for your aid in this task.'","Defeat wights near Plas-maru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Ilar at his camp in the Bonevales","'Have you dealt with the wights yet?'","Plas Maru is a great cairn which was reserved for the ancient brenins and their brehur.","Defeat the Asgurn-capten","Defeated the Asgurn-capten","Throw the Yoke","Defeated wights near Plas-maru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13557]={"'We should get started on the field over there first!'","Speak with Gárwig","'The enemy mentioned an artifact or weapon that Núrzum is using? That is interesting news, but may not make much difference. Núrzum will be the end of us all, no matter what kind of artifact he is or isn't using.\
\
'It is unfortunate that we lost the farm and those poor farmers, but there is not much we can do for them. Their efforts will not be forgotten, but they are likely lost to us like many of our good men have been lately.'","Help Oter prepare Thrymm's Farm","The farmers are desperate to get Thrymm's Farm growing crops again for Forlaw.  The supplies in Forlaw may not last much longer with this unnaturally long winter.","Thrymm's Farm was burned to the ground, and the farmers were captured by the Lieutenant of Núrzum, Laudh. Gárwig should be informed of what has happened.","Thrymm's Farm","Work has begun to repair Thrymm's Farm and it is almost time to begin working the fields.","'The next step is to get a field prepared so we can start planting. The sooner the better! Let me know when you are ready to get started.'"},
[13560]={"Derrotaste a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 1","Completado.","Solo los héroes más poderosos pueden derrotar a Thrâng a esta fuerza. ¿Estás listo para el desafío?","Completado","Desafío de Thrâng - Nivel 1","Te has encontrado en la arena de Thrâng.\
\
¡Debes derrotar a Thrâng!","¡Has derrotado a Thrâng y sus Ghâshfra! Por tus esfuerzos, serás ${PLAYERNAME:recompensado[m]|recompensada[f]}.","Derrota a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 1","En lo profundo de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu, Thrâng, el jefe de los Ghâshfra, está listo para enfrentarse a todos los que desafíen su poder.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando abandones la instancia.</rgb>"},
[13561]={"¡Has derrotado a Thrâng y sus Ghâshfra en todo su poder! Por tus esfuerzos, serás ${PLAYERNAME:recompensado[m]|recompensada[f]}.","Desafío de Thrâng - Nivel 2","Solo los héroes más poderosos pueden derrotar a Thrâng en todo su poder. ¿Quieres comenzar el desafío?","Completado.","Completado","Derrotaste a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 2","Te has encontrado en la arena de Thrâng.\
\
¡Debes derrotar a Thrâng!","Derrota a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 2","En lo profundo de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu, Thrâng, el jefe de los Ghâshfra, está listo para enfrentarse a todos los que desafíen su poder.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando abandones la instancia.</rgb>"},
[13563]={"Trueno en las Colinas","Trolls de piedra han descendido en gran número desde las Montañas Nubladas hacia el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.","Trolls de Piedra derrotados en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hay trolls de piedra acampados al norte del camino principal en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, deberías encargarte de los trolls de piedra que se han asentado allí.","Derrota Trolls de Piedra en el Bosque de los Trolls Sur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13564]={"Trueno en las Montañas","Habla con Golhador en el campamento del Risco Alto","Golhador está en el campamento del Risco Alto, en las Montañas Nubladas, al noreste de Rivendel.\
\
Deberías regresar con Golhador y hacerle saber que el Señor del Trueno ha sido derrotado.","'Has derrotado a un enemigo formidable, ${PLAYER}, y has demostrado tu valía más allá de toda necesidad, pero sigo preocupado. El Señor del Trueno ha sembrado una inquietud en mi corazón.\
\
'Se avecinan días oscuros para toda la Tierra Media. ¡Permanece alerta, ${PLAYER}! Temo que una sombra terrible se ha cernido sobre estas tierras desde lejos.'","¡Eres emboscado por gigantes!","Los gigantes de la Mesa de los Gigantes mencionaron al Señor del Trueno, a quien sólo puedes suponer como su líder. Tal vez, si el Señor del Trueno fuera derrotado, los gigantes podrían apartarse de su camino perverso.\
\
Es probable que el Señor del Trueno gobierne desde los confines más lejanos de Iorbar, al sur y al este de la Mesa de los Gigantes. Debes tener cuidado, pues debe de ser un oponente letal, y sólo un grupo decidido de guerreros podría esperar derrotarlo.","Se derrotó al Señor del Trueno","El Señor del Trueno, líder de los gigantes, ha ordenado a su pueblo marchar a la guerra. Si puede ser derrotado, esta amenaza podría caer con él.","El Señor del Trueno gobierna a los gigantes desde Iorbar, al sur y al este de la Mesa de los Gigantes, en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
El Señor del Trueno es la fuente de la reciente hostilidad de los gigantes, y debe ser derrotado antes de que todos los gigantes de la región obedezcan sus órdenes. Necesitarás la ayuda de valientes aliados si esperas vencerlo.","Derrota al Señor del Trueno","Párate sobre la Mesa de los Gigantes"},
[13565]={"Thunder on Zirakzigil","Collect trophy-bones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have done much to aid the Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir at Rung-shakam.","Destroy Orkish drums at Rung-shakam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Trolls of Moria and Orkish drums can be found at Rung-shakam. Trophy-bones can be collected from Orcs and some goblins at Rung-shakam.\
\
You should aid the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir by defeating the Moria-trolls at Rung-shakam. You should also destroy Orkish drums and collect trophy-bones for the Haban'akkâ.","You raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin in defiance of Azog!","'What do you say, my friend? It is not that far to the north-west, but it is too far for me to go beneath the notice of my father or grandfather Grór.\
\
'Would you aid our kin and cousins at Zirakazhâr?'","Although the battle on Zirakzigil is not yet ended, your efforts have done much to aid the Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir.","'You were at the council, yes? I saw you among the Iron-folk. Why have you come to Zirakazhâr?'\
\
You introduce yourself to King Jegín and explain that you have come to aid the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ. King Jegín raises a single eyebrow appraisingly.\
\
'Is that so? You must forgive me, but that may have been more helpful while any others of my father's line still drew breath. I do not begrudge you your King's misjudgements, but the Temámir have learned to be wary.\
\
'My scouts have discovered crude war-drums at the Orcs' encampment on Zirakzigil. Silence the drums and perhaps the trolls might tire of hurling stones into the dale. If not, Drógar and her Narfanghoth know what is to be done.'","'What tidings do you bring from Amdân, Iron-folk?'\
\
You introduce yourself to King Drógar and tell her that you have come to aid the Haban'akkâ at Zirakazhâr.\
\
'Hah! I am sure I can find some use for you. We have made slow but steady inroads against our foes on the mountain, in no small part due to King Jegín's guidance. For one who is so young and who has lost so much, she has led her House admirably—far more admirably than some of the Kings on Bundushâthur, I would dare to say!\
\
'The greatest danger facing the Haban'akkâ are those trolls out of Moria. If they were slain, the Orcs' encampment would prove little more than a poorly-placed camp-site so high upon Zirakzigil.'","Scout Rung-shakam","Collected trophy-bones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Moria-trolls at Rung-shakam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hoping to hinder the trolls of Moria laying siege to Azanulbizar, Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir have made for the slopes of Zirakzigil.","King Agni the Wild, King Drógar Bloodwhisker, and King Jegín can be found at Zirakazhâr.\
\
You have arrived at Zirakazhâr. You should speak to the Kings of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir leading the assault on Rung-shakam.","Talk to King Drógar Bloodwhisker","Defeated Moria-trolls at Rung-shakam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rung-shakam can be found to the north-west of Zirakazhâr.\
\
The Kings of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir have asked you to scout Rung-shakam and defeat Azog's forces upon Zirakzigil.","'Hail!'\
\
King Agni the Wild greets you warmly, but appears distracted.\
\
'I am not used to such subtle tactics, Longbeard. I expected Drógar to be more alike in mind to me and the Landorrim, but she and Jegín plot a more careful climb up Zirakzigil. As long as I might take a few trophy-bones of my own, I will command the Landorrim to aid them as best we can.\
\
'I tire of sitting behind these walls, Longbeard. You and your Iron-folk surely know this pain! It is not our way... and the battle calls to us!'","Talk to King Jegín","The Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir have taken Zirakazhâr!","Raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam","Talk to King Agni the Wild","Travel to Zirakazhâr","Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir can be found at Zirakazhâr on the slopes of Zirakzigil to the north-west of Amdân.\
\
Dáin has asked you to travel to Zirakazhâr and aid the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ.","Driven by Orc-drummers, Trolls of Moria lay siege upon the dale below from Rung-shakam","Completado","Destroyed Orkish drums at Rung-shakam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have done much to hinder Azog's forces at Rung-shakam.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam."},
[13566]={"Defeat sûlokil in An Shêru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The sûlok herd gathering at Modan Rôkh, the Beast-fields, has little access to food and water, making them more aggressive than usual and posing a threat to passers-by. Culling some of their numbers would be beneficial for both travellers as well as the herd.","You have culled some of the sûlokil in An Shêru, making it easier for the others to survive in this harsh wasteland.","Thunder on the Plains","You should defeat sûlokil in An Shêru. A herd can be found gathering at the Beast-fields in the south-eastern part of the region.","Sûlokil gather in large numbers on An Shêru's dusty southern plains. There are more of the large beasts here than the land can support.","Your culling of some of the sûlokil in An Shêru has made it easier for the others to survive in this harsh wasteland, while also making the nearby road a little safer for travellers.","Completado","Defeated sûlokil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13567]={"Thurmaer se encuentra en Kuru-leiri, al norte del glaciar.\
\
Deberías devolverle la flecha a Thurmaer.","'¿No has tenido suerte buscando mi flecha? Vaya semanita.\
\
'Al menos no hay nadie por aquí que sepa jugar a las cartas, o de lo contrario habría perdido hasta la última moneda tal y como están yendo las cosas.'","Flecha de la suerte de Thurmaer encontrada","'¡Maldita sea mi suerte! Últimamente todo me va ml, y ahora estoy aquí atascado en este diminuto campamento en medio de la nada. Sin mi mejor flecha no tengo esperanzas de hacer que las cosas mejoren. ¡Necesito tu ayuda, te lo ruego!\
\
'Desde que me separé de mis compañeros y terminé en la parte más remota y fría de Forochel, las cosas han ido de mal en peor. He perdido mi flecha de la suerte, que sé que hizo diana y golpeó en esa sierpe que estaba cazando. ¡Pero momentos antes de disparar, fue emboscado por un grupo de cazadores Gauredain! Escapé de su emboscada y volví aquí, pero me torcí el tobillo durante la huida y no puedo recuperar mi preciada flecha. Ha estado conmigo durante más de una larga cactería y perderla de esta manera es un terrible presagio.\
\
'Estoy seguro de que mi flecha está todavía en la piel escamosa de esa sierpe. Los cazadores de este campamento la llaman Beleganc y dicen que es la más astuta de las sierpes del glaciar. Encontrarla no será tarea fácil, me temo.'","'¿Podrás recuperar mi flecha de la sierpe Beleganc?'","Beleganc vaga a lo largo y ancho del gran glaciar, al sur de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Thurmaer te ha pedido que des caza a la sierpe de las nieves llamada Beleganc y recuperes su flecha de la suerte de ella.","Deuvelve la flecha a Thurmaer en Kuru-leiri","Encuentra a la sierpe Beleganc y recupera la flecha de Thurmaer de su cuerpo","Thurmaer ha perdido su 'flecha de la suerte' favorita durante una reciente cacería en Talvi-mûri. En ella tenía como objetivo a una sierpe de las nieves particularmente astuta y disparó justo cuando le emboscó un grupo de cazadores Gauredain que le forzaron a huir. Aunque consiguió ponerse a salvo, Thurmaer se torció el tobillo durante la huida.","La flecha de la suerte de Thurmaer","'¡Ajá, mi flecha de la suerte! ¡La has encontrado!\
\
'¡Muchas gracias! Quizá mi suerte esté empezando a mejorar por fin. Después de los últimos días empecé a preguntarme si alguna vez lo haría.\
\
'¡Ahora todo lo que debo hacer es encontrar mi mapa!'"},
[13569]={"¡Frustrar a los Bugan del Tesoro!","Completa '¡En busca de los Bugan del Tesoro!' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Teodoro Tojo en Bree, Rivendel o la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Teodoro Tojo, un buscador de tesoros con experiencia, busca los muchos tesoros que le fueron robados en sus numerosas aventuras.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el evento asociado.</rgb>","Completado '¡En busca de los Bugan del Tesoro!' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Teodoro Tojo, un buscador de tesoros con experiencia, busca los muchos tesoros que le fueron robados en sus numerosas aventuras.","Teodoro Tojo busca sus tesoros robados y puede encontrarse en Bree, Rivendel y en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Debes hablar con Teodoro Tojo.","Teodoro Tojo busca sus tesoros robados.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Los Bugan del Tesoro pueden encontrarse en muchas de las Instancias Escalables.</rgb>","'¡Lo has logrado! ¡Todas mis arriesgadas excursiones perdidas han sido recuperadas! ¡Se puede decir con certeza que ahora soy un Maestro Buscador de Tesoros! Sí, dije que compartiría las recompensas, y Teodoro Tojo es un hombre de palabra. Toma, acepta este pequeño obsequio. Es lo mínimo que puedo hacer.'"},
[13570]={"Thwarting Their Plans","Defeat fugitives (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I cannot believe it! You rescued Khetúku! You have lifted such a burden from my shoulders as well as my heart. You are welcome to stay with us as long as you like. Here is your reward, as promised.'","Free Khetúku","You have defeated many of the fugitives and freed Khetúku. You should return to Porókho at his camp in the sewers to bring him the news.","Porókho has told you that a group of forsaken Heirsworn and All-seeing Eye believers hiding in Ilmabiri have kidnapped his nephew Khetúku in an attempt to coerce the Morutágya clan into giving them transport out of Umbar. He tells you that if you rescue Khetúku, there will be a handsome reward.","You found the forsaken camp","Discover where the forsaken Heirsworn and Church of the All-seeing Eye are encamped. Porókho said they are in the southernmost part of Ilmabiri.","Find the forsaken camp","Defeated fugitives (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have found the location of the camp of forsaken. You should defeat some of them so Khetúku will be able to escape.","Talk to Porókho","'I am sorry stranger, but you brought us this news when we were already having a bad day. My nephew Khetúku has been taken captive by wicked Men who are trying to force us to help them. There is a group of Heirsworn and those depraved Church of the All-seeing cowards that stowed themselves away in our sewers. They have been in the southern part of Ilmabiri since the Sea-stone Mutiny, hiding and trying to get someone to ferry them to safety.\
\
'We have no more love for that khmêg than we do for Gondorians. Let them rot, I say! Their time ruling Umbar was not a pleasant one for my people. But now they have captured Khetúku and say they will kill him if we do not help them, and I have no doubt that they will.\
\
'I know you have no reason to help us, but you look hardy and resourceful. If I can persuade you to rescue Khetúku, I will see to it that you are rewarded!'"},
[13571]={"'The Longbeards of Othrikar had mentioned to us recently that their wayward kin, the Dourhands, have been attempting to open mines here in the hills of Nan Amlug. Now my scouts tell me that, despite our efforts, their work is nearly complete, and they are preparing to send shipments of iron north to their allies in Angmar.\
\
'I need you to make a foray into Nan Amlug to attack the Dourhands in and around their mines, and do as much as possible to disrupt their operations there. The last thing we want is for Angmar to gain yet another supply of metals for their armies.'","Thwarting the Dourhands","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, south-east of Nan Amlug.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of your battles against the Dourhands.","Talk to Handarod","Defeated Dourhands in Nan Amlug (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'My scouts tell me that the Dourhand operations are in some measure of disarray thanks to your efforts. Keep up the good work -- we need to disrupt the flow of war materials into Angmar as much as possible if we are to have any hope of preventing their Orcs from sweeping over us in the months to come.'","Defeat Dourhands in Nan Amlug (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Handarod is concerned with the growing threat of the Dourhands in western Nan Amlug.","Dourhands can be found throughout the hills of western Nan Amlug, north-west of Esteldín.\
\
Handarod has asked you to disrupt the Dourhand mining efforts in Nan Amlug."},
[13573]={"Ayuda a Yngvi a derrotar al general Talug en Fil Gashan","'Mis asistentes y yo hemos estado vigilando este lugar durante algún tiempo, y hemos aprendido mucho sobre lo que está sucediendo dentro de las murallas de Fil Gashan.\
\
'Mis ayudantes pueden explicar con más detalle, pero déjame decirte lo que sé. Los orcos no son las criaturas más inteligentes, aunque no son estúpidos en absoluto. Aprendimos mucho mientras nos colábamos dentro de Fil Gashan nosotros mismos. Nos escondimos bajo sus narices simplemente usando armaduras toscas. Por supuesto, nos mantuvimos alejados de los que parecían un poco más inteligentes, pero podrías tener el mismo éxito.\
\
'Si quieres ayudar, seguramente le diré a Narfi que me has asistido, una vez que Úlfur, Vagun y Yngvi estén satisfechos con tus esfuerzos, claro está. Puedes encontrarlos aquí en Anazârmekhem.'","Fil Gashan es el cuartel y punto de concentración de la invasión orca de Lothlórien. Oculto en lo más profundo de un paisaje ígneo y con una entrada adyacente a las Forjas de Khazad-dûm, los orcos se entrenan aquí bajo la atenta vigilancia del general Talug.","'Fil Gashan ya no representa una amenaza, gracias a ti.'","Ayuda a Vagun a desactivar las alarmas en Fil Gashan","Úlfur, Vagun y Yngvi se encuentran en Anazârmekhem.\
\
Teitur te indicó que hablaras con sus asistentes y completaras sus tareas antes de que le informe a Narfi que Fil Gashan ya no representa una amenaza.","'Encontrarás a Úlfur, Vagun y Yngvi dentro de los límites de nuestro campamento aquí en Anazârmekhem. Habla con ellos y completa las tareas que te asignen, y hablaré muy bien de ti a Narfi.'","Frustrando a los orcos de Moria","'Un logro digno, ${PLAYER}, muy digno en verdad. Aunque queda mucho trabajo por hacer para recuperar Moria, creo que hemos detenido esta incursión contra los Elfos. No hay necesidad de enfadar a otros, digo yo.\
\
'Todo lo que has hecho será recordado aquí, ${PLAYER}. Hablaré muy bien de ti a Narfi.'","Ayuda a Úlfur a recopilar los planes de Fil Gashan","Teitur se encuentra en Anazârmekhem.\
\
Has completado con éxito cada una de las tareas que Úlfur, Vagun y Yngvi te dieron. Ahora deberías regresar con Teitur para informarle de tu progreso.","Ayuda a Vagun con los tenientes en Fil Gashan","Habla con Teitur en Anazârmekhem"},
[13574]={"'Tus esfuerzos contra la Mano Blanca han concluido, y te estoy agradecido por ello.'","Ayuda a Thithrand a derrotar a los líderes de los orcos de la Mano Blanca en la Gran Escalera","'He observado a los orcos que llegan desde el sur, y te aseguro que no tienen intención alguna de permanecer leales a las fuerzas de Moria. Tienen propósitos propios y, si se les da la oportunidad, podrían derrocar al líder actual y tomar el control de sus fuerzas para sus propios fines.\
\
'No podemos permitir que esto ocurra, así que debo encargarte la tarea de frustrar sus planes. Tengo dos tareas para ti, así que escucha con atención.'","'Debemos reducir el número de orcos de la Mano Blanca aquí, en la Gran Escalera, y eliminar también a sus líderes. Solo entonces podremos aspirar a despojarles de su poder y detener su intento de arrebatar el control de Khazad-dûm.'","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Deberías regresar con Thithrand para informarle de tus éxitos en la Gran Escalera.","Habla con Thithrand en la Guardia Orca","Ayuda a Thithrand a debilitar el poder de la Mano Blanca en la Gran Escalera","La Gran Escalera se alzaba antaño al pie de un gran cruce de caminos dentro de Moria. En el apogeo de la gran ciudad, conducía a todas las zonas de las salas y era una maravilla majestuosa de contemplar. Ahora ha quedado bajo el control de Igash, un lugarteniente de Mazog, el líder de los orcos de Moria. Igash ha reunido en un solo lugar a las fuerzas de orcos y trolls de Moria y ha recaudado tributos de cada uno para llevarlos algún día al líder de los orcos. Por ahora, cada tribu pugna por ganarse el favor del lugarteniente, un seguidor fanático de Mazog.","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Thithrand cree que la Mano Blanca se rebelará abiertamente contra los orcos de Moria, pero teme que puedan reunir la fuerza suficiente como para tomar el control por sí mismos. Para evitarlo, desea que completes una serie de tareas.","Frustrando a la Mano Blanca"},
[13575]={"Pieles manchadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Bueno, esas son algunas bestias menos acechando a nuestros caballos. Mi agradecimiento para ti.'","'No hay escasez de bestias en estas tierras salvajes... Mantén los ojos abiertos.'","Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Pieles manchadas","Se busca: Pieles manchadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas.","Se busca: Pieles manchadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelas y entrégaselas al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","Recoge pieles manchadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entrega las pieles manchadas al capataz en Forthbrond","Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir pieles manchadas. Debes entregárselas al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere pieles manchadas. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen."},
[13576]={"Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir vainas de espada decorativas. Debes entregárselas al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere vainas de espada decorativas. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen.","Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Vainas de espada decorativas","Se busca: Vainas de espada decorativas de los enemigos en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelas y entrégaselas al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","Recolectar vainas de espada decorativas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No hay escasez de oponentes en estas tierras salvajes. Ten cuidado ahí fuera.'","Entrega las vainas de espada decorativas al capataz en Forthbrond","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Bueno, esas son algunas amenazas menos con las que tendremos que luchar en los próximos días. Mi agradecimiento para ti.'","Vainas de espada decorativas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Vainas de espada decorativas de los enemigos en el este de las Tierras Brunas."},
[13577]={"Entregar las pieles marcadas al capataz en Forthbrond","Se busca: Pieles marcadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelas y entrégaselas al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Pieles marcadas","'Bueno, esas son algunas bestias menos acechando a nuestros caballos. Mi agradecimiento para ti.'","'No hay escasez de bestias en estas tierras salvajes... Mantén los ojos abiertos.'","Pieles marcadas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolectar pieles marcadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir pieles marcadas. Debes entregárselas al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere pieles marcadas. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen.","Se busca: Pieles marcadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas."},
[13578]={"Recolectar escudos perforados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Escudos perforados","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere escudos perforados. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen.","Se busca: Escudos perforados de los enemigos en el este de las Tierras Brunas.","Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir escudos perforados. Debes entregárselos al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","Se busca: Escudos perforados de los enemigos en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelos y entrégaselos al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","'No hay escasez de oponentes en estas tierras salvajes. Ten cuidado ahí fuera.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entrega los escudos perforados al capataz en Forthbrond","'Bueno, esas son algunas amenazas menos con las que tendremos que luchar en los próximos días. Mi agradecimiento para ti.'","Escudos perforados recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13579]={"Orejas moteadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de adquirir orejas moteadas. Debes entregárselas al capataz de los Rohirrim en Forthbrond.","'Bueno, esas son algunas bestias menos acechando a nuestros caballos. Mi agradecimiento para ti.'","Se busca: Orejas moteadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas. Recógelas y entrégaselas al capataz en Forthbrond para ganar el favor de los Jinetes de Théodred.","'No hay escasez de bestias en estas tierras salvajes... Mantén los ojos abiertos.'","Recoge orejas moteadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los Jinetes de Théodred: Orejas moteadas","El capataz de los Rohirrim quiere orejas moteadas. Se le puede encontrar en el campamento de los Rohirrim de Forthbrond en el Valle del Isen.","Entrega las orejas moteadas al capataz en Forthbrond","Se busca: Orejas moteadas de las bestias en el este de las Tierras Brunas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."},
[13580]={"Bring the seashells to Darôma","'There is a thing I have been wanting to do but never seem to have the time. It is not unusual for beautiful seashells to be found on the island's northern shores. I wanted to take a break and collect some of them to decorate the cabins, but my duties have kept me from enjoying the beaches.\
\
'If you bring me some beautiful seashells from Furtherholm's beaches, I would happily pay you for them. The best place to find seashells is on the island's north side, specifically in and around the channel there.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","'Oh, these are handsome shells indeed! They will do quite well, ${PLAYER}, thank you.'","Seashells collected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Darôma has offered to pay you for bringing seashells to her. She suggested looking on the island's northern shores, particularly in and around the channel.","You have collected many splendid-looking seashells from the beaches of Furtherholm. You should bring them to Darôma inside The Cracked Flagon to receive your reward.","Collect seashells (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Darôma wants seashells from the nearby beaches to decorate the inn.","Tidal Treasures"},
[13582]={"Cleaned up reeking garbage (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Picked up dirty dishes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Basil Wyndham","Tidying Up","Clean up liquid spills (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cleaned up liquid spills (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You know, ${PLAYER}, some days I really loathe this job. Mabel never pulls her weight. I swear, I would give anything to trade with those beggars. They really have it easy compared to me!\
\
'The worst of it has to be the garbage left by some of the sloppier festival patrons. Stinking, slimy garbage and refuse all around the Eating Contest, and the Mayor's wife demands that the patrons don't see any of it! But it keeps piling up.\
\
'I can't bear to touch the stuff, myself. I don't even want to look at it. Mabel keeps saying she's too busy. Say...you don't look too busy!'","Clean up reeking garbage (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Pick up dirty dishes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Garbage can be found at each of the Eating Contest stations in Winter-home, and the servant Basil Wyndham deems himself above the task of cleaning it up.\
\
You should clean up garbage, spills, and dirty dishes around the Eating Contest's tables.","The festival patrons have left a lot of filth in their wake and tidying up is a rather unpleasant chore that must be performed.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Basil Wyndham can be found in Winter-home.\
\
You should return to Basil Wyndham now that you have cleaned up some of the mess from the Eating Contest.","'That garbage is still piling up, you know. Disgusting stuff. Please go take care of it before the Mayor's wife sees it, or else she'll think I'm not pulling my weight. This is all that Mabel's fault....'","'I don't see any more garbage or spills! Thank goodness -- the very sight of them was most nauseating. I can't imagine how disgusting it must be to actually have to touch such things. \
\
'Really, I do think I might be in the wrong line of work.'"},
[13583]={"'The process to enter Gapholt is the same as it always has been. It will stay that way. My priority is making certain that Gapholt remains secure. Making a few refugees wait is unfortunate, but necessary.'","Thane Nothmar is near the bridge of Gapholt.\
\
The guard told you to take your concerns to Thane Nothmar.","Tied Hands","Talk to Hrothwaru","Hrothwaru is near the bridge of Gapholt.\
\
Thane Nothmar would not recant his position regarding entry into Gapholt.","'I do not have the authority to grant their entry without papers. They have all tried, and I will tell you what I told them: their papers must be checked and signed before I can allow entry, without exception.\
\
'If you have concerns, then feel free to bring them up with Thane Nothmar. I am only doing my duty.'","'My children are crying and hungry, and I am at my wits' end. These guards refuse to let us enter until we present papers and have them approved and signed. Can anything be done to expedite this process?\
\
'I have said everything I can, and they will not relent. Will you speak with them and see if you can sway them?'","Talk to Thane Nothmar","There is a Gapholt guard behind a mountain of papers.\
\
You should speak with a guard to see if there is an exception that can be made to help the refugees settle into Gapholt sooner.","'Do we look like Dunlending riffraff? It is absurd that we must wait to enter the safety of Gapholt...what if the Dunlendings fall upon us?'","Talk to the guard","The guards of Gapholt are not allowing entry without papers being checked and signed. This process is causing too much delay for the long line of refugees."},
[13584]={"Acquire a delving zircon (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You left the instance and failed the delving","A malice spreads through the area...","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","'The enemy grew stronger? Well... that bodes ill. We should be cautious about freeing whatever evil is within these gems.\
\
'I promised you a reward and I shall not disappoint.'","Without a delving zircon you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space.","Affix the delving zircon to the delving stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tier 01: Delving Zircon","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","You must place a delving zircon into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","The delving zircon fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The zircon cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you but passes.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success."},
[13590]={"You left the instance and failed the delving","Acquire a delving zircon (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","Without a delving zircon you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space.","Tier 03: Delving Zircon","Affix the delving zircon to the delving stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The delving zircon fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The zircon cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you, but passes.","A potent malice spreads through the area...","You must place a delving zircon into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","'The stories people tell about you are true it appears, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Evil comes in many shapes, sizes, and places but wherever you are it cannot root. You are a benefit to all the Free Peoples.\
\
'Take this as my thanks.'\
\
After a short pause, they continue.\
\
'Take this, I think that you are not yet done in your efforts.'","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success."},
[13593]={"'Another victory it appears. You are improving on an already impressive history of effort, ${PLAYER}. Soon we may be seeing those calling for erecting statues in your honour.'\
\
They smile broadly.\
\
'I think then you are ready for this. Be careful though. The more of these gemstones we find, the greater the risk becomes. Use caution in all you do.'","Tier 04: Delving Garnet","You left the instance and failed the delving","Without a delving garnet you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space.","The delving garnet fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The garnet cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you but passes.","You must place a delving garnet into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","A powerful malice spreads through the area...","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success.","Affix the delving garnet to the delving stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Acquire a delving garnet (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13596]={"'Again you return to us victorious. This is a bold effort, indeed. Rewards are needed for adventurers as stalwart, capable, and eager as you. Take this with my thanks.'\
\
They look you over.\
\
'I have another gemstone here. Likely more virulent than the last. Are you willing to face the evil within?'","The delving garnet fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The garnet cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you, but passes.","You left the instance and failed the delving","Without a delving garnet you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space.","You must place a delving garnet into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","A formidable malice spreads through the area...","Tier 05: Delving Garnet","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success.","Affix the delving garnet to the delving stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Acquire a delving garnet (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13599]={"You left the instance and failed the delving","The delving garnet fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The garnet cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you, but passes.","Without a delving garnet you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space.","Tier 06: Delving Garnet","A forceful malice spread through the area...","You must place a delving garnet into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","'Let any who question your temper and resolve be silenced. Was the battle as fierce as I expected it would be?'\
\
Before you can answer they are on to their next statement.\
\
'Reward for your effort and another challenge are in order, yes? You are proving yourself quite well, ${PLAYER}.'","A forceful malice spreads through the area...","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success.","Affix the delving garnet to the delving stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Acquire a delving garnet (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13602]={"You left the instance and failed the delving","Acquire a delving emerald (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","'You return with good tidings again, ${PLAYER}. I should not be as surprised as I am. You have oft proven your capacity for destroying evil in the world. Still... there is something grim about these gemstones and we have found more. Your reward, of course. And another challenge, if you so choose.'","You must place a delving emerald into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","The delving emerald fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The emerald cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you, but passes.","Tier 07: Delving Emerald","Affix the delving emerald to the delving stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success.","Without a delving emerald you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space.","A vile malice spreads through the area..."},
[13605]={"A dire malice spreads through the area...","You left the instance and failed the delving","Acquire a delving emerald (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Again you return to me victorious, ${PLAYER}. This habitual destruction of evil is a boon to the Free Peoples and we are lucky to count you among our number. Here -- take this for your efforts and take this if you should like to further your growing legend.'","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","You must place a delving emerald into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","The delving emerald fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The emerald cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you, but passes.","Tier 08: Delving Emerald","Affix the delving emerald to the delving stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success.","Without a delving emerald you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space."},
[13608]={"You left the instance and failed the delving","Acquire a delving emerald (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","You must place a delving emerald into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","The delving emerald fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The emerald cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you, but passes.","'There is a strength in your resolve that I think few possess. Without your strength and those like you where would we be? Certainly under more dire threats than we are even now. You continue to protect and defend, ${PLAYER}. It is an honour to know you. Still, the threats that we face are manifold and we are not yet done examining these tainted stones. I have another if you wish to investigate.'","Affix the delving emerald to the delving stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","An overwhelming malice spreads through the area...","Tier 09: Delving Emerald","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","Failure: Leave the instance","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success.","Without a delving emerald you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space."},
[13611]={"Failure: Do not leave the instance","You left the instance and failed the delving","A dread-filled malice spreads through the area...","Acquire a delving amethyst (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The stone is inert. There is a clear fissure in the surface where one, with a little effort, could affix a gem of some sort. Perhaps you have such a gem in your possession.","Delving deeply into the world, the forces of the enemy are more powerful and vicious.","You must place a delving amethyst into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world.","A malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world.","'What vileness was within that gemstone, ${PLAYER}. You return having bested the foes you faced but I can see from your countenance that the battle there took a toll. We have more of the gemstones and more to reward you and those like you willing to risk life and limb to defeat the great evil in the world. Will you fight on? I shall let you make that choice.'","Without a delving amethyst you cannot unlock the greater strength of the enemies in this space.","The delving amethyst fits into the fissure within the delving stone. The amethyst cracks and the darkness within creeps out of the stone and moves into the air as a black tendril. A flash of dread fills you, but passes.","Tier 10: Delving Amethyst","Complete the current mission and find the scout","Habla con la persona que te confió la miniaventura","Affix the delving amethyst to the delving stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Having completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success."},
