[13626]={"Talk to Skalla","'While you are out there talking to the others, would you do us a favour? We need timber for repairs to our buildings and walls. The goblins could attack at any time, and we must be ready for it. Find timber from fallen trees nearby and bring it to me.'","Skalla can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes.\
\
You should talk to Skalla.","'These will do. I have another task, if you still wish to help.'","Collected fallen timber (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Skalla has asked you to gather fallen timber to repair the buildings in Vegbár.\
\
You should collect fallen timber from the area surrounding Vegbár.","Collect fallen timber (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Timber from the Forest","The Beornings of Vegbár must keep constant watch on both the High Pass and Goblin-town, and can do neither with their buildings and walls in disrepair."},
[13627]={"Lúksu can be found in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Captain Róglarg has offered you a break, and now expects you to eat an Orkish meal. You should find Lúksu and do your best to pretend that you have eaten his food.","Lúksu can be found in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have done your best to pretend that you ate and enjoyed Lúksu's food. You should now speak to Lúksu.","'It's been a long day, hasn't it? I think you've earned a break!\
\
Captain Róglarg smirks.\
\
'I've had Lúksu cook something up for you in the Tower. Some Thrulbuz, some Zau, and even some Blúgzor! A nice, full meal to make the other Orcs jealous!\
\
Go on, now! There's still more to be done once you're back!'","Talk to Lúksu","Pretend to eat Blúgzor","'Hai! You must have been hungry, Silent One! You put all that down faster than any Orc I've ever known!\
\
'Must be easier without a tongue! Ha!'","Time Enough for a Meal","It's meat all right, wrapped in... innards?","Pretend to eat Zau","Pretend to eat Thrulbuz","Lúksu has set out three crates of repulsive food...","Crates of Blúgzor, Zau, and Thrulbuz can be found near Lúksu in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have found Lúksu and must now \\qsample\\q his cooking.","Find Lúksu in the Tower of Cirith Ungol","Mmm! This stew is certainly... crunchy!","After performing many of his tasks without question, Captain Róglarg has offered you a meal in Cirith Ungol.","The grubs are still wriggling in the crate. How exciting!"},
[13629]={"'Me avergonzaría reparar este escudo, ya que no tiene valor alguno.'","Rauno está en Sûri-kylä, al oeste de Nef en la Gran Cabaña de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Nef te ha pedido que vuelvas a ver a Rauno y trates de convencerle de que le fabrique un nuevo escudo.","'Tendré que hablar con ese tipo, Bill Helechal, sobre el escudo que me vendió.'","'¿Ya has conseguido los huesos macizos y las escamas de sierpe, ${PLAYER}?'","'¿Has vuelto con los huesos macizos y las escamas de sierpe? Empezaré a trabajar en el kilpi ahora mismo. No debería tardar mucho, ya que he adelantado mucho del trabajo mientras no estabas.'","Habla con Nef","'Si tuviera otra elección no les pediría a los Hombres de las Nieves otro escudo, pero no hay otros herreros que puedan hacer el trabajo.'","Lleva los huesos macizos y las escamas de sierpe a Rauno","'Estoy seguro de que no será tan bueno como uno nuevo, pero quizá los Hombres de las Nieves puedan reparar mi escudo.'","Lleva el escudo a Nef","'Espero no volver a ver nunca más al bajito.'","Los artesanos de los Lossoth están en la Gran Cabaña de Sûri-kylä, al oeste de Nef.\
\
Nef te ha pedido que hables con los artesanos Lossoth para saber si serían capaces de reparar su escudo roto.","Rauno está en Sûri-kylä, al norte de donde has conseguido los objetos que te pidió.\
\
Deberías llevarle los huesos macizos y escamas de sierpe a Rauno para completar el escudo de Nef.","Hora de un escudo nuevo","Nef está en Sûri-kylä, al este de la Gran Cabaña.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Nef y decirle lo que te ha dicho Rauno.","Consigue huesos macizos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rauno está en Sûri-kylä.\
\
Deberías hablar con Rauno para ver si el escudo de Nef está listo.","'El kilpi está terminado. Llévaselo a Nef, y pídele que busque a sus compañeros y vuelva a su propia casa.'","Escamas de sierpe conseguidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Consigue el escudo de parte de Rauno","'¿Ya ha terminado Rauno mi escudo?'","'Si voy a hacer un nuevo kilpi para este Nef, necesitaré hueso macizo y escamas de sierpe.'","Habla con los artesanos Lossoth","Has encontrado el escudo de Nef, pero la bestia que lo ahuyentó lo ha destrozado.","Huesos macizos conseguidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nef está en Sûri-kylä, al este de Rauno.\
\
Rauno te ha pedido que lleves el escudo que ha fabricado a Nef y le pidas que se vaya de Sûri-kylä.","'Me pregunto cómo ha aguantado tanto este escudo sin ser dañado, ${PLAYER}. Su calidad es muy pobre, como los materiales con los que está fabricado.\
\
'No repararé este escudo inservible. Avergonzaría a mi familia y a mí mismo si lo hiciera.'","El hueso macizo puede encontrarse en las bestias que habitan Jä-rannit. Las escamas de sierpe se pueden conseguir de las sierpes de la misma región.\
\
Rauno te ha pedido que consigas huesos macizos y escamas de sierpes para hacer un nuevo escudo para Nef.","'Bien... parece un trabajo decente.\
\
'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Esto debería bastar, pero lo reemplazaré con algo más resistente una vez llegue de nuevo a Bree.'","Habla con Rauno","'No me gusta la idea de hacer un escudo para Nef. Vino con peticiones descabelladas, y cuando le dije lo que tenía a mano en cuanto a materiales me dijo muchas cosas que no voy a repetir. No es necesario ofender también a tus oídos.\
\
'Pero no se irá sin su escudo terminado. Lo haré, solo para que verle marchar. Los objetos que necesito serían hueso macizo y escamas de sierpe. Ambos son raros, pero vitales para la fabricación de kilpi, o escudos, como los llaman los Kivi-väki.\
\
'El hueso macizo puede encontrarse en muchas de las bestias de Jä-rannit y las escamas de sierpe en las sierpes que habitan la misma región. Vuelve a verme cuando hayas encontrado estos objetos, y fabricaré el escudo para el pequeño extranjero de barba larga y mal temperamento.'","Consigue escamas de sierpe (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Vergüenza? ¡Qué desfachatez! Iría a hablar con Rauno yo mismo si no hubiera tenido ya un altercado con él.\
\
'Le pregunté de forma inocente por los secretos de su oficio, pero no quiso hablar del tema. Intercambiamos unas cuantas palabras, ¡y dice que ya no está dispuesto a hablar conmigo! Es un patán de mal genio. No consideraría su silencio una gran pérdida si no fuera por mi necesidad actual.\
\
'Quizá puedas hablar con él para ver si puede darme uno de los resistentes escudos de los Lossoth. ¡No podré volver hacia el Sur sin un nuevo escudo!'","'¿Ya está terminado el escudo? ¿Qué ha dicho Rauno?'","'¡Bah! ¡Esto no servirá! ¿Qué es un guardián sin su escudo? Solo un medio enano. No estaré satisfecho hasta que mi escudo no sea reparado.\
\
'Ve a hablar con los artesanos Lossoth, aquí en Sûri-kylä. Son hombres extraños, pero quizá puedan repararlo. De otra forma, no sabría qué hacer.\
\
'Los artesanos Lossoth están dentro de la Gran Cabaña de Sûri-kylä. ¡Ve, corre! No quiero que malgastes el tiempo revoloteando por aquí como una mosca.'"},
[13630]={"'Debería haber alijos de suministros con armas y armaduras escondidos por la ciudad. Si puedes encontrarlos y traérmelos, podremos reemplazar algo de nuestro equipamiento dañado y continuar el combate contra los Angmarim. Quizá algunos de estos alijos ya hayan sido saqueados por el enemigo.'","Los alijos de suministros están escondidos en lugares apartados de caminos principales en Annúminas.\
\
Dannassel te ha pedido que busques alijos de suministros escondidos por la ciudad y que le lleves sus contenidos. Te ha advertido que las patrullas Angmarim podrían ya haber descubierto y saqueado alguno de estos alijos.","Lleva los suministros recuperados a Dannassel","Dannassel está en Echad Garthadir, el campamento de montaraces en el corazón de Annúminas.\
\
Has recuperado algunos de los suministros de los alijos escondidos por Annúminas y deberías llevarlos de vuelta a Dannassel.","Suministros recuperados de alijos escondidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hora de necesidad","Dannassel te ha dicho que en tiempos de paz se escondieron por la ciudad cierto número de alijos.","Recupera los suministros de los alijos escondidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Gracias de nuevo por localizar los alijos escondidos, ${PLAYER}.'","'Has hecho un buen trabajo, ${PLAYER}. ¡Gracias por buscar estos alijos! Tenían que estar bien escondidos para no haber caído en manos del enemigo, por lo que has demostrado gran sagacidad al encontrarlos.\
\
'Fainneleg se alegrará de que podamos reemplazaralgo de nuestro equipo dañado. ¡Con estos suministros, la lucha contra los Angmarim en Annúminas puede continuar durante varios días más!'","'Nuestras armas y armaduras están en buenas condiciones de nuevo, gracias a ti.'","'No has encontrado lo suficiente de los alijos escondidos que te envié a recuperar, ${PLAYER}.'","Alguien ya ha saqueado este alijo, pues está vacío.","'${PLAYER}, estamos en una posición delicada. Los Angmarim no han sido capaces de expulsarnos de Echad Garthadir hasta ahora, pero cada asalto merma nuestras fuerzas un poco más. No podemos aguantar eternamente, aun con los esfuerzos de Badhordam para reabastecernos y las astutas estratagemas de Fainneleg.\
\
'Hace mucho, los Dúnedain escondieron cierto número de alijos con armas y armaduras por la ciudad, por el miedo a que el enemigo intentara tomar Annúminas. Si puedes encontrar algunos de estos alijos escondidos y traerme su contenido, podremos reemplazar el equipo dañado y continuar la lucha contra los Angmarim en la ciudad.\
\
'No sé la localización de estos alijos escondidos, pero si buscas en lugares apartados de los caminos principales en Annúminas, seguro que los encuentras. Es posible que los Angmarim se hayan topado con alguno de ellos y los hayan saqueado.'"},
[13631]={"'You have done enough for now, ${PLAYER}. Please, rest. Take some time to yourself. We will bury the Thane, and begin to pick up the pieces.\
\
'It is our turn to bear the burden of what befalls our lands. Go! Come back when you are rested.'","Return to Ránmald","Reflections upon those who died come unbidden to your mind....","'Other survivors! I agree with the others -- it is madness to go into the Balewood. That forest is haunted.'","The voices you heard came from below your thinking spot in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should climb down and see if you can find the women you heard.","Time to Think","Ránmald can be found in the cave north of Byre Tor.\
\
You should return to Ránmald.","A good resting spot might be north behind the mountain cave, away from Byre Tor.\
\
You should head north to the other side of the mountain and find a spot to rest.","Nearby, a rocky overlook offers a fine view of the north","Head north behind the mountain to find a place to rest","As you look out at the green hills of the Great River untouched by Núrzum, you are filled with overwhelming grief and anger at the plight of Wildermore","The dead are many, and the vision fills you with grief.\
\
The forces of Isengard -- Núrzum especially -- must pay for what they have done.","A good spot to stand and look beckons to you in the northern High Knolls.\
\
You should stand at the cliff's edge and look, and think on all the people who have been lost.","Memories of the dead come unbidden to your mind....","After all that has come to pass since setting foot in Wildermore, you find that it is rather a lot to bear. Some time to clear your head will be helpful.","The sound of women's voices from below startle you from your reverie","Find the women whose voices you heard","'Don't ye come any closer! Stay back!' The woman relaxes when she realizes that you are not an enemy.\
\
'Yes, we escaped Byre Tor. We make north to cross the river into Eorlsmead.\
\
'There are others that went towards the Balewood -- madness! And others that went with the Thane's family who were pursued by Orcs. We believe this is the safest way.'","You wish the women luck on their journey -- but more importantly, there may be other survivors!","Stand and think at the cliff's edge"},
[13632]={"Return to Aragorn in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing and tell him you have stayed with a number of dying men through their final moments.","The wounded and dying can be found in the High Hall, House of Remedies, and House of Rest, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Find those wounded who do not have long in this world and stay with them while they are here.","Stay by the sides of the dying (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Many of the wounded here are beyond the reach of treatment and will not see the dawn. Some will not even see the coming hour. I am struck by inexpressible sorrow, ${PLAYER}, when I reflect how they will depart quietly with no one by their side, unless perhaps the harried healers as they make their rounds. The healers and I must expend our every precious moments with the living. But you... \
\
'If you are as moved as I am by this thought, ${PLAYER}, perhaps you will go and spend some moments with the dying? My heart tells me that someone must.'","Many among the wounded will never rise from their beds in the Houses of Healing, and have no one to spend their final moments with them.","Return to Aragorn","Time with the Dying","'Thank you, friend. I know all too well what a heavy task it is that you have performed. But I feel sure it was an immeasurable good and a great mercy, and shall not go forgotten.'","The wounded man has passed on"},
[13633]={"Habla con Orchalwë en Tinnudir","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir, al norte y al oeste del Coloso.\
\
Después de agradecerte tu ayuda, los Montaraces del Coloso te han indicado cómo llegar a la isla de Tinnudir.","'Nos has ayudado mucho aquí, y por eso te estoy agradecido. Pero este Coloso y Barad Tharsír no son más que pequeños puntos de Evendim. Annúminas al oeste y los dominios al norte tienen más valor que las ruinas de por aquí.\
\
Sigue el camino hacia el norte, luego gira a la izquierda en la encrucijada hasta llegar a Tinnudir. Allí, habla con Orchalwë para saber más.'","Tinnudir es donde los Montaraces tienen su base de operaciones en Evendim.","Tinnudir, vestigio de los Hombres","'Tinnudir está un poco más adelante en el camino... lo reconocerás cuando llegues.'","'Ah, sangre fresca. Puede que seas justo lo que necesitamos para comenzar a recuperar los dominios del este.'"},
[13634]={"'Our victory could be short-lived if reinforcements are not sent from Glân Vraig. The Enemy will return quickly, and we do not have the forces to slow their progress to the Captain-General.\
\
'I need you to make your way to Glân Vraig to inform Tordúr that we hold the tower and that we need reinforcements, or we will not hold.\
\
'Go swiftly and do not suffer defeat.'","'Your message is well-received. I will dispatch forces to Tirith Rhaw at once.'","Support must not be present at Tirith Rhaw","Glân Vraig lay to the south and east of Tirith Rhaw.\
\
After taking Tirith Rhaw away from the Enemy, the army of the Free Peoples sent you to Glân Vraig to request reinforcements for the tower.","Tirith Rhaw Reinforcements","Your mission has failed","Angmar's Army has taken Tirith Rhaw","Angmar's Army cannot control Tirith Rhaw","Another has informed the Captain-General, support arrives shortly","Inform Captain-General Tordúr that Tirith Rhaw needs reinforcements","Tirith Rhaw is once again under the control of the Free Peoples. The forces here are still meagre, and a strong show of force from the Enemy could mean that the tower is lost as quickly as it is taken.","'Be swift. We must reinforce the tower quickly.'","You must reach Glân Vraig without being defeated"},
[13635]={"El Titán de Tyl Annûn debe caer.","'¿Ves a la criatura de ahí delante? Es un terrible gorthorog, una de las criaturas más fuertes que tienen aquí. He visto a ese derrotar a por lo menos una docena de Montaraces.\
\
'Lo llamamos el Titán de Tyl Annûn, y nunca sale de esta isla. Su sola presencia aterroriza nuestros avances.\
\
'Es hora de poner fin a su reinado de terror. Derrotemos a la bestia.'","Un terrible gorthorog se yergue en la terraza de Tyl Annûn, dominando todo el lago Evendim.","Titán de Tyl Annûn derrotado","Derrota al Titán de Tyl Annûn","Titán de Tyl Annûn","Orchalwë querrá hablar de la batalla contra el Titán de Tyl Annûn.","Habla con Orchalwë","'La abominación ha caído y Tyl Annûn es un poco más seguro. Todavía hay muchos más con los que lidiar, pero ahora piso aquí con más confianza.'"},
[13636]={"'Hay un lugar del que debes saber, un lugar lleno de gran corrupción y grave peligro. Se llama Agamaur, el Pantano Rojo. El agua de este lugar es roja como la sangre, sangre que brota de una herida llamada Garth Agarwen.\
\
'Y, sin embargo, hay quienes se han atrevido a adentrarse en el corazón de Agamaur. Quizás puedas ayudarlos. Algunos de mis parientes, los Eglain, han acampado en medio de la oscuridad, y te ruego que vayas a su ayuda. Habla con Eriac el Fuerte, y estoy seguro de que podrá hacer uso de tu fuerza.\
\
'Agamaur está al este y al norte de aquí. Encuentra el Paso Rojo en el pantano de Haragmar, y encontrarás el camino hacia Agamaur.'","Agamaur es un lugar lleno de corrupción y grave peligro, hogar de un mal terrible.","Agamaur está al este y al norte de Ost Guruth, más allá del Paso Rojo, en el pantano de Haragmar.\
\
Frideric te ha pedido que vayas a Agamaur para hablar con Eriac el Fuerte.","'¿Vienes de parte de Frideric? Entonces eres bienvenido. Hay muchas amenazas por aquí contra las que podrás poner a prueba tu fuerza.'","Rumbo a Agamaur"},
[13637]={"Hacia Amon Raith","Amarion se encuentra en Amon Raith, al este del campamento de Mincham.\
\
Debes hablar con Amarion en Amon Raith.","'Mincham te envía, ¿eh? Es un buen nombre. Podría dar uso a un par de manos capaces por aquí. Hay muchas bocas que alimentar...'","Habla con Amaron en Amon Raith","'Has sido una bendición para nosotros, pero imagino que mi amigo Amarion necesita más tu ayuda que yo.\
\
'Se ha asentado en Amon Raith justo al este de aquí, protegiendo a algunos refugiados de las Quebradas del Norte. Sé que podría necesitar ayuda para ocuparse de ellos.'","Mincham te ha pedido que busques a Amarion, un compañero Montaraz, que actualmente protege a un grupo de refugiados, cerca de las ruinas de Amon Raith."},
[13638]={"Annâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Agátur the Boastful at Annâk-khurfu.","Planted banners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Plant banners along the road leading to Annâk-khurfu (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, there you are! What took you so long? Did Rúzat put you to work at the Rushgate? Bah, I knew it. Does he not know that time is of the utmost importance in order for the Gabil'akkâ to succeed?\
\
'Now then, enough idle chatter, there is much to be done here at Annâk-khurfu! I know that I can count on you, ${PLAYER}. That is why I am giving you these important tasks. Come talk to me again when you have completed them!'","The Gabil'akkâ has secured Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.","Assist Lúkhag with 'A Strange Encounter'","Rúzat has asked you to plant banners along the road leading to Annâk-khurfu and to investigate Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
You should plant banners along the road leading to Annâk-khurfu.","'We march to Gundabad, together. All of us who march, we are all the Gabil'akkâ, the Great Force!\
\
'Are you on your way to Annâk-khurfu? You must be, as the Rushgate is but the start of the march! Could you do something for me on your way to Annâk-khurfu, my friend? I want to lift the spirits of all those in the Gabil'akkâ. Let us raise banners along the path, as it is now under control of the Gabil'akkâ!\
\
'Oh and one more thing. Could you investigate the small encampment of Khadâsh-gâra for me? I am not sure what the dwarves there doing to keep themselves busy!'","Annâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should journey to Annâk-khurfu.","Investigate Khadâsh-gâra","Assist Mother Amma with 'Hunting Crystals'","The dwarves at Khadâsh-gâra seem eager to talk with you","Journey to Annâk-khurfu","'You have assisted everyone at Annâk-khurfu? You always seem to find a way to impress me, ${PLAYER}! Now then, let us see how your talents might best serve the Gabil'akkâ next.'","The stronghold is filled with many dwarves from across the lands","There is much to be done at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should assist the dwarves at Annâk-khurfu.","Assist Gunvald with 'The Overdue Scout'","Assist Lóssi with 'The Missing Scouts'","To Annâk-khurfu","Talk to Agátur the Boastful at Annâk-khurfu"},
[13639]={"Has recogido el cesto de champiñones","Has dejado caer los champiñones","Lleva el cesto de champiñones al Mercado de los Granjeros","¡La tienda de champiñones está casi sin existencias! Bamfurlargo es el proveedor principal de la Feria de los Granjeros, así que es el momento de hacer un viaje para reponer el stock.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento al que está asociada. </rgb>","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","'¡Hurra, ${PLAYER}! ¡Has salvado la Feria de los Granjeros!'","'¡Apúrate, ${PLAYER}! ¡No es momento de perder el tiempo!'","A Bamfurlargo: Reposición de la tienda de champiñones","Bamfurlargo está en el Marjala, en la parte más al sureste de la Comarca que aún queda al oeste del Brandivino.\
\
Debes correr hasta la famosa granja de champiñones y regresar con un cesto antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Recoge el cesto de champiñones (come pastel para un impulso de energía)","'¡Oh no! ¡Nos hemos quedado sin champiñones! Dirígete a Bamfurlargo para encontrar otro cesto para el mercado y tráelo de vuelta tan rápido como puedas.\
\
'Toma... coge este pastel. Utiliza la receta secreta de mi tatarabuela, y se dice que te concede una velocidad increíble cuando das un bocado. Date prisa ahora. ¡No te entretengas!'","Se ha acabado el tiempo"},
[13640]={"Gilded cage retrieved","Place the sand-sifter near Kûruna to summon the craban from the sky","Kûruna becomes docile","Galamê told you to collect the cage beside him before you head into the wild to collect a sand-sifter corpse to coax the largest craban, Kûruna, in Khûd Zagin.","'My Lord Igbâl offers you thanks for your service.'\
\
The man places the cage near the merchant.\
\
'Speak with me when you are prepared for your next effort.'","'To draw the largest craban, Kûruna, from the skies, you will need a meal the crebain desire. Collect a corpse from the sand-sifters in the waste-plains to the south. Then bring it to the crebain circling south-east of Jirush.'","You captured Kûruna. You should return the bird in the cage to Galamê at Jirush.","You retrieved the gilded cage. Galamê mentioned collecting the carcass of a sand-sifter to coax the craban, Kûruna, from the sky. You will find sand-sifters roaming the waste-plains of Khûd Zagin to the south.","Kûruna reluctantly steps into the cage.","Find a location to place the sand-sifter corpse to draw down the largest craban, Kûruna, from where the crebain circle in the sky south-east of Jirush.","Deliver Kûruna and the cage to Galamê in Jirush","Coax Kûruna into the cage","'Place the sand-sifter's corpse near the where the crebain circle in the sky. The largest among them will smell the corpse and approach to eat the sand-sifter. Defeat the craban, Kûruna, then and capture it in the cage.'","Kûruna is defeated and docile. Talk to the creature and draw it into the cage.","The craban moves to attack.","You collected a sand-sifter corpse","Defeat a sand-sifter in Khûd Zagin and collect its corpse","You cage Kûruna","'My Lord Igbâl does not speak the common tongue. He will not converse with you in his tongue, so all communication comes through me.\
\
'You are here to ingratiate yourself to my lord. There are three tasks he bids you.\
\
'Task one is to go into the desert and collect Kûruna, the largest of the craban in Khûd Zagin. The crebain are used by the Ordâkhai to spy upon their enemies. My lord would do the same to them.\
\
'First take the cage beside me. Then, collect a carcass of a sand-sifter in the south. Find a spot near where the crebain circle far to the south-east and place the carcass where it can be seen. This will draw down Kûruna. When you've captured Kûruna return it here, to me.'","Galamê explains Lord Igbâl wants a craban to train against the Ordâkhai. He has seen them use the creatures as spies and would do the same. He asks you to acquire the most impressive beast you can capture.","To Be His Eyes","'Your cage is still empty. Have you beaten Kûruna into submission, yet? Hurry now, see the craban collected.'","Retrieve the gilded cage from beside Galamê"},
[13642]={"To Bring Light to The Dark","With fresh flames dancing at their cores, the lanterns now hold the shadows at bay. Here, the darkness of Deepscrave does not feel so suffocating.\
\
Perhaps, in time, the dwarves shall see the rest of Deepscrave illuminated and claim it as their home once more.","Completado","You have lit the lanterns.","Lanterns lit (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thrúthug has asked you to light the lanterns near the main staircases circling 'Abad-nuhbu.\
\
Half of the lanterns can be found above Aslíf on the upper tier, and half below.","Light is scarce in Deepscrave. The lanterns around 'Abad-nuhbu have gone unlit for too long.","'Came up from Aslíf to try and help Felgar here. Can't say it was easy finding my way up and down the main staircases circling 'Abad-nuhbu through all that darkness. There're lanterns near the stairs, but the Orcs have snuffed 'em out.\
\
'You headed down? Maybe you could light the lanterns along the way. Half of 'em are above Aslíf on the upper tier, and half below.\
\
'It'd be nice if getting lost in the dark became the least of my worries.'","Light lanterns (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13643]={"Bolgovado se encuentra a dos pueblos al este de Delagua, pasando los Ranales por el Camino del Este.\
\
Corre a las granjas de cerdos en Bolgovado y regresa con una cesta de delicioso y salado tocino recién hecho antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","'¡Ay, no! ¡Se nos está terminando el tocino! Ese tocino delicioso, salado y en lonchas gruesas... ¿Qué vamos a hacer? Ve a Bolgovado a buscar otra cesta para el mercado y tráela lo antes posible.\
\
'Toma, aquí tienes este pastel. Está hecho con la receta secreta de mi bisabuela, y se dice que te otorga una velocidad increíble cuando le das un bocado. Date prisa. ¡No te demores!'","Cesta de tocino recogida","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","'¡Hurra, ${PLAYER}! ¡Has salvado la Feria de los Granjeros!'","¡Dejaste caer el tocino! ¡Nooo!","'¡Apúrate, ${PLAYER}! ¡No es momento de perder el tiempo!'","Lleva la cesta de tocino al Mercado de los Granjeros","¡El puesto de carnes está a punto de quedarse sin tocino! Bolgovado es el proveedor principal de la Feria de los Granjeros, y ya es hora de ir a reponer suministros.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","A Bolgovado: Reponiendo el tocino","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Recoge la cesta de tocino (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)"},
[13645]={"Calembel is south of Lothgobel in Lamedon.\
\
You should make your way to Calembel.","'Hail, traveller. Did you escape Lothgobel as well? As you see we have many folk here who came from that town.'\
\
You explain that Jajax and the Corsairs have left Lothgobel, and a truce has been reached.\
\
'Oh! Well, that is great news, and unexpected, for we have not the soldiers to keep the enemy at bay.'","You should go to Calembel and see if any refugees from Lothgobel have made their way there.","To Calembel","'I cannot believe you got those Corsairs to leave! It is amazing, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I hope people come back soon. The Corsairs were good for business, but I would rather have peace and quiet any day.\
\
'Calembel is not far from here. I would imagine the townsfolk went there, if they're smart.'","Speak with someone in Calembel"},
[13647]={"<rgb=#FF0000>Scold</rgb> the child","The child is very sorry for what he did and gives you the bracelet","Follow the child","'You, kind ${RACE}! Some errand-boy ran into me in the tunnels just now and it seems my bracelet has suddenly gone missing! I chased him towards Pipers' Bend but can't find the thieving child! The bracelet is a family heirloom and I must have it back!'\
\
You spot the child thief and assure the woman that you will retrieve her bracelet and give the child a stern talking to.","'Oh, thank you very much! I was afraid I would never see this bracelet again. It was my mother's, and her mother's before.\
\
'I shall continue on my way to the Houses of Healing where I am currently training. If you have not already visited the Sixth Circle, there are some beautiful gardens to be admired. I do recommend a peaceful rest for the mind now and again, even in these dreadful times.'","A little thief has just stolen a priceless bracelet from a noblewoman!","Looks like this child has been taking various valuables and stashing them here","Return the bracelet to the noblewoman","The child has run off somewhere.\
\
Follow the child to get the bracelet for the noblewoman.","The child is in his hiding place.\
\
You should scold the child for stealing.","The noblewoman can be found near Pipers' Bend on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should return the bracelet to the noblewoman.","To Catch a Thief"},
[13648]={"'${PLAYER}! I have new orders from Scout-master Ausma for you! Our forces have moved into the forested tiers of Clovengap, but reports of crystal-encrusted beasts and dragon-kind concern her greatly. You are to investigate the reports and do what you can to assist the efforts of our troops.\
\
'Look for Gunvald in southern Clovengap. He waits for you at a camp along the river called Stókkset.'","Ausma has sent word that reports of crystal-encrusted beasts and dragon-kind. You are to investigate the reports and do what you can to assist the efforts of our troops.\
\
Your orders are to look for Gunvald in southern Clovengap. He waits for you at a camp along the river called Stókkset.","A runner from Scout-master Ausma has found you. Your orders are to assist Mother Amma on the tiers of Clovengap!","To Clovengap","Talk to Gunvald in southern Clovengap, at a camp called Stókkset","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! Ausma's runner found you. Welcome to the Forest Beneath the Mountains!'"},
[13649]={"Dejaste caer la cesta","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","'¡Hurra, ${PLAYER}! ¡Has salvado la Feria de los Granjeros!'","Recoge la cesta de repollos (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","¡El puesto de repollos está a punto de quedarse sin repollos! La granja de Coto es el proveedor principal de la Feria de los Granjeros, y ya es hora de ir a reponer suministros.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Lleva la cesta de repollos al Mercado de los Granjeros","A la Granja de Coto: Reponiendo repollos","'¡Vaya! ¡No estaba prestando atención a los repollos, pero se han agotado antes de lo que esperaba! Ya casi se nos acaban. Ve a la Granja de Coto a buscar otra cesta para el mercado y tráela lo antes posible.\
\
'Toma, aquí tienes este pastel. Está hecho con la receta secreta de mi bisabuela, y se dice que te otorga una velocidad increíble cuando le das un bocado. Date prisa. ¡No te demores!'","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Cesta de repollo recogida","La Granja de Coto está en Delagua, no muy lejos de la Feria de los Granjeros.\
\
Corre a la granja de Tolman Coto y regresa con una cesta de repollos antes de que se acabe el tiempo."},
[13650]={"Suspicious of Ingór's priorities, Durin has ordered you to join the Zhélruka expedition in Câr Bronach","'${PLAYER}? You are a welcome sight to these weary eyes!'\
\
Gárjan shifts uneasily.\
\
'Suffice it to say... things have gone awry.'","'Your timing is impeccable, ${PLAYER}. I have just received new orders from Prince Durin.'\
\
Scout-master Ausma produces a missive from her pocket and hands it to you.\
\
'Or rather I should say that you have, my friend!'","Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate can be found in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
Scout-master Ausma has informed you of the path taken by the scouts sent into Câr Bronach. You should travel to the Witch-gate in the Pit of Stonejaws and enter Câr Bronach.","Múta or her scouts might be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate in Câr Bronach.\
\
After passing through the Witch-gate, Múta and her scouts were to travel to join the Zhélruka expedition. You should search for some sign of Múta or her scouts at the Witch-gate.","Concerned by the news that Prince Ingór has sent a significant Zhélruka expedition into Câr Bronach, Prince Durin hopes to enlist you to discover their purpose and aid in their efforts against the remnants of the Iron Crown.","Beyond the harsh, black stone of the Witch-gate lies Câr Bronach, the Sorrowglen","Orders from Prince Durin can be found in your inventory.\
\
Scout-master Ausma has given you new orders from Prince Durin. You should read the orders.","You find one of Múta's scouts, Gárjan, wounded and taking shelter beside a rampart","Talk to Scout-master Ausma","To Câr Bronach","Read the orders sent to you by Prince Durin","As you pass out of Mount Gundabad into Câr Bronach, an uneasy chill runs up your spine","Scout-master Ausma can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws at Bárgstad.\
\
You have read the orders sent to you by Prince Durin. You should talk to Scout-master Ausma.","Gárjan can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\
\
After passing through the Witch-gate, you have found one of Múta's scouts, Gárjan, injured and taking shelter beside a rampart. You should talk to Gárjan.","Travel through the Witch-gate, in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws, and enter Câr Bronach","'Prince Durin has commanded you to join the effort in Câr Bronach? He has made a wise decision, I think.\
\
'Before you arrived, Lord Glóin asked me to choose several of my scouts to make contact with the Zhélruka expedition. Since the Iron Crown still holds Câr Bronach, I chose Múta to lead the party. With her, I sent Kársa, Gárjan, and Uzvát -- three of my kin and fine scouts of their own.\
\
'As you may or may not know, there is an eastern gate which leads out of Mount Gundabad. I am told it was long ago claimed by the realm of Angmar, and that whatever its true name once was was lost. It is called the Witch-gate, and it is the swiftest path into Câr Bronach.\
\
'If you wish to aid Prince Durin, find Múta and her scouts beyond the Witch-gate. The Zhélruka will have their reinforcements... whether they want them or not!'","Search for any sign of Múta or her scouts at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","Talk to Gárjan at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate","Travel to the threshold of the Witch-gate, in the north-eastern reaches of the Pit of Stonejaws"},
[13651]={"Hacia Hendidura Profunda","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! It is good of you to join our expedition; there is much to do. Should you seek to help us, Lord Náin might have just the task.'","Deepscrave is below Máttugard, in Gundabad.","'If you are seeking Deepscrave, it is not far from here. You can find it by travelling south. Tread carefully, for very few dwarves have yet to venture within the deep shaft.\
\
'If you do venture there, you should first seek out Féli, an advisor to Náin the Slakeless. Náin has led a group of dwarves into Deepscrave just recently; they should be on the upper tier, in Aslíf.'","Talk to Féli in Aslíf","Féli can be found in Aslíf, on the upper tier of Deepscrave.\
\
You should seek him out."},
[13652]={"Haerandel se ha llenado de asombro al oír que flores semejantes al legendario Anarlossë crecen en abundancia dentro de los límites de la Comarca.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","'Mae govannen, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. ¿Qué te trae hasta nosotros con tanta urgencia? Quédate un momento y descansa; pronto seguiremos nuestro camino, pero por un rato me agradaría conversar.'\
\
Te presentas y transmites el mensaje de Haerandel.\
\
'Mi hermano cree que una hobbit ha visto una flor de la legendaria Anarlossë... ¡Me cuesta mucho creerlo! Estas flores empezaron a desaparecer al final de la Segunda Edad y, conforme Arnor decayó, también lo hizo la Anarlossë. Hace cientos de años que nadie las ve. Tu amiga hobbit debe de estar equivocada, y mi hermano se deja llevar por la esperanza.'","Alcanza a Edlothon en el País de las Colinas Verdes de la Comarca, antes de que su compañía élfica parta","'La compañía de Edlothon planeó tomar la ruta habitual de nuestro pueblo a través de las Colinas Verdes. Ve a la Comarca y búscalos en las colinas boscosas sobre la carretera. ¡Y apresúrate! Me despedí de mi hermano no muy lejos de aquí, pero eso fue ayer, y desde entonces habrá avanzado bastante.'","El campamento élfico no está abandonado... por ahora","'¡Apenas puedo creerlo, ! ¿Puede ser cierto que flores de la Anarlossë hayan logrado preservarse dentro de los límites de la Comarca? No quiero que mi hermano Edlothon abandone la Tierra Media sin saberlo. Pensar que podría partir creyendo que toda huella de la Anarlossë desapareció me llena de pesar; mis años venideros serían tristes sabiendo que zarpó engañado.\
\
'Tienes el porte de ${PLAYERNAME:un[m]|una[f]}  ${PLAYERNAME:decidido[m]|decidida[f]}, . ¿Podría pedirte que alcances a la compañía de mi hermano y le lleves noticias de estos girasoles? No te pido que lo hagas cambiar de opinión, solo que sepa que las flores que amamos en nuestra juventud no se extinguieron del todo, sino que aún pueden encontrarse en el mundo. Eso será suficiente para mí, y también para Edlothon.\
\
'Su compañía de Elfos planeaba tomar la ruta tradicional de los nuestros a través de las Colinas Verdes. Ve a la Comarca y búscalos en las colinas boscosas sobre la carretera. ¡Y date prisa! Me despedí de mi hermano no muy lejos de aquí, pero eso fue ayer, y desde entonces habrá recorrido mucho camino.'","El hermano de Haerandel, Edlothon, viaja con una compañía de Elfos por la ruta habitual de su pueblo a través de la Comarca en dirección a los Puertos Grises. Haerandel cree que los encontrarás en el País de las Colinas Verdes, en los bosques sobre la carretera. ¡Te instó a ir con prisa antes de que continúen su marcha!","<rgb=#FF0000>Debes alcanzar a Edlothon antes de que los Elfos partan</rgb>","Habla con Edlothon en el País de las Colinas Verdes","Partir en Primavera","Edlothon se encuentra en el País de las Colinas Verdes, viajando con un grupo de Elfos rumbo a Mithlond, los Puertos Grises, desde donde dejarán la Tierra Media y zarparán hacia el Oeste."},
[13653]={"Defeated foes at Hanksar-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól","Scout Kulûg-mokh","'Did you find any hidden entrances into Gundabad or any weaknesses in the enemies defences? Nor did I! Bah, between these well organized Orcs and impeccable dwarf-craft, we are up against quite an enemy force here!'","Defeat foes at Kulûg-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Scouted Kulûg-mokh","Drenghól can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Drenghól.","The Gabil'akkâ has secured Drenghól in Elderslade.","Defeat foes at Hanksar-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Scout Dûn Traikh","Journey to Drenghól","Scout Hanksar-mokh","Defeated foes at Dûn Traikh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated foes at Kulûg-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'How did you know that we were here, ${CLASS}?! Oh, Náth told you? I suppose that is all right then, as we captured  Zudramdân together. A few of us went on to establish this small but very well hidden encampment. What do you think? Yes, it is quite well hidden!\
\
'We are scouting the outer walls of Gundabad. Will you assist us? Good, good!'","To Drenghól","The dwarves at Drenghól have asked you to scout the forces gathered near the outer walls of Gundabad.\
\
You should assist the dwarves at Drenghól.","Scouted Hanksar-mokh","'A few dwarves went on ahead, though I begged them not to. It is too dangerous to the west. I gave them a warning, but I am not here to argue with them. I am here to win this war. I would appreciate it if you would search for them. The last I heard they had found a cave under a statue. Drenghól I think it was called. I am sure they could use assistance. They are behind enemy lines, after all!'","This hidden cave gives those a chance to safely scout the outer walls of Gundabad","Defeat foes at Dûn Traikh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Scouted Dûn Traikh","Drenghól can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should journey to Drenghól."},
[13655]={"The Boar-clan is holed up in the fishing-village of Durgors.","The leaders of the Boar-clan can be found at Durgors, south-west of Lhan Rhos.\
\
Elder Déin has asked you to report to the leaders of the Boar-clan movement.","'Report to the leaders of the Boar-clan in Durgors.'","Talk to Tecwin at Durgors","To Durgors","'Thank you for coming. This is terrible news. With the reported kidnappings, the Abominations, and now the attack on the Pristine Glade, Saruman is clearly planning something terrible. We need to prepare to meet with the leaders of the Boar-clan.\
\
'Speak with me again after you have caught your breath. We need to gather supplies for a long journey.'","'The Assembly has made their decision. We have pushed back and stopped Saruman for now, but perhaps at too great a cost. I require one last favour of you. \
\
'You must report to the fishing-village of Durgors in the south-west corner of the Dunbog. There, you will find some of the leaders of the Boar-clan movement. They must be told what has happened. Saruman is becoming a greater threat than we had ever believed.\
\
'Hurry!'"},
[13657]={"'Hold there, stranger! You come at a dire time and the doors of the Mead Hall are closed.'","To Eaworth","Reeve Ingbert is at Eaworth in the Entwash Vale, west of Faldham.\
\
Thane Elfmar has asked you to journey to Eaworth and offer your services to Reeve Ingbert.","Talk to Reeve Ingbert at Eaworth in the Entwash Vale","Thane Elfmar has heard rumours of trouble in the Entwash Vale.","'${PLAYER}, rumour has come to my ear of troubles in the Entwash Vale, Riding of Reeve Ingbert of the House of Léotharn. It is said that goblins and Orcs out of the Misty Mountains have descended upon the Riding and are preparing to lay siege upon Eaworth.\
\
'If you wish to be of aid to the Eastemnet, journey west to Eaworth and offer your services to Reeve Ingbert. I am sure that he will be grateful for the assistance. The people of Faldham must carry on under their own defences, but we will not forget your aid.'"},
[13658]={"The presence of traders from the town of Elthengels to Harwick has been all but extinguished. Etta worries that the tragedies befalling Thane Mildrith of Elthengels have thrown the farmers of the Norcrofts into a state of peril.","Speak with Thane Mildrith of Elthengels, in the Norcrofts","'Traders from the western towns were once a common sight along the road to Harwick. Of late, the troubles befalling Thane Mildrith and the people of Elthengels seems to have stalled all travel from that once calm land.\
\
'The loss of supplies from the Norcrofts will have a terrible impact on us all. If you desire to offer your skills to Mildrith and her people, travel with haste, due west along the road.'","Thane Mildrith resides in the town of Elthengels, in the Norcrofts, south-west along the road from Floodwend.\
\
Etta has suggested that you lend aid to Thane Mildrith of Elthengels.","To Elthengels","'Welcome to Elthengels, traveller. I must ask your pardon for the sorrowful state of matters. We mourn for the former Thane, my husband Pendrad, and our son Pendulf. Do not feel obligated to grieve on our behalf; it will help matters not for you to dwell in sadness.'"},
[13659]={"Speak with Arodor","Rangers man the look-out, but Faramir is nowhere in sight","'Greetings. I am guessing you are the traveller who has been helping Rangers around Southern Ithilien. Your deeds precede you, ${CLASS}. I am Arodor, commander of Faramir's Look-out.\
\
'You seek Faramir? As you can see, he is not here. He had gone commanding a garrison in Osgiliath when the Morgul-host attacked the city. We've yet to make contact with anyone inside the city.'","You spot some Orcs moving about in the ruins below","The ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should locate the cairn on the western side of the ruins and look around.","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should travel to Faramir's Look-out.","You spot ruins on the crest of the next hill which must be where Faramir moved his camp.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> for the Ranger outpost from the northern cairn","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should speak with a Ranger at Faramir's Look-out.","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> for the Ranger outpost","Travel to Faramir's Look-out","The ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should travel to Tuntham and learn if Faramir is still there.","Travel to Tuntham","Anborn sends you on your way to the last known location of Faramir's camp.","'Ithilien is a large stretch of land. Faramir travels constantly to visit Ranger camps and to keep us abreast of enemy movements. It has been many days since we last saw him, but I know that he had established a look-out in the ruins of Tuntham. You will find the ruins north-east of here, past Brangobel.\
\
'Whether Faramir is there still, none in Bâr Húrin can say. If you arrive at the ruins and find them empty, do not fret. We Rangers leave cairns to share knowledge with each other after we have left. Stay strong in these dark days, my friend.'","As Anborn predicted, there is no trace of a Ranger camp","The ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin.\
\
You should locate the cairn on the northern side of the ruins and look around.","To Faramir's Look-out","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> for the Ranger outpost from the western cairn"},
[13660]={"'I am glad you have returned, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Ifbar-athrâkh may not be a house of healing, but the dwarves you rescued will be safe here for a time. I shall see that their wounds are tended at once.\
\
'You have my thanks... and those you aided have offered their truest gratitude!'","Talk to Lági Helmbiter","To Fight Another Day","Aided wounded dwarves on the battlefield around Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aid wounded dwarves on the battlefield around Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I have received reports that several wounded dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ have become trapped on the battlefield.\
\
'It seems many have only sprains and minor wounds, but if they cannot soon get to shelter, the Orcs of Gundabad will put them to death. You must find the wounded on the battlefield and aid them as best you can.\
\
'Do whatever you must to get them back on their feet. Once they are able to stand, send them to Ifbar-athrâkh.\
\
'The Gabil'akkâ leave none behind!'","Across the battlefield, dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ fight against the Orcs of Gundabad. However, even the halest dwarf can be laid low by the underhanded ploys of the Orcs, and those wounded in the field are in dire need of aid.","Lági Helmbiter can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.\
\
You have aided several wounded dwarves on the battlefield and sent them to recover at Ifbar-athrâkh. You should report news of your success to Lági Helmbiter.","Wounded dwarves can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Lági Helmbiter has received word that several wounded dwarves are trapped on the battlefield in the War of Three Peaks. You should aid them and send them to Ifbar-athrâkh."},
[13661]={"'Ah! I almost didn't hear you, ${PLAYER}. As you'll soon learn for yourself, there are strange echoes in this place... strange, indeed.\
\
'It seems I was perhaps misinformed of the state of things in Gloomingtarn. I arrived quite prepared to survey the sacred tarn as it was tasked of me by Prince Durin himself, but I did not expect my studies to be hindered by Orcs and wicked Men of all things!\
\
'No matter, I shall press on—as I always do!'","To Gloomingtarn","Deep within Mount Gundabad lies Gloomgintarn, the hallowed caverns where Durin the Deathless is said to have awoken in the Elder Days.","Spall can be found at Zâram-mekhem, the tarn-gate, where Deepscrave meets Gloomingtarn.\
\
You have received word from a Longbeard messenger that Spall, a lore-master of Erebor, has requested your presence in Gloomingtarn. You should travel to Zâram-mekhem in Gloomingtarn and meet with Spall.","'Hail, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I have come bearing a message on behalf of the lore-master, Spall. He humbly requests your presence at Zâram-mekhem, the ancient tarn-gate, to aid him in his survey of Gloomingtarn. In addition, Lord Hermáth Stormhammer has led an expedition into the ancient cavern charged with securing Gloomingtarn and making safe the way to the Clovengap of Mount Gundabad.\
\
'If you wish to aid them, you must navigate the Deepscrave. When you have travelled as far west as you are able, you will find Zâram-mekhem, the sacred threshold of Gloomingtarn.'","Accompanied by Hersegg, Spall appears to be studying the runes at Zâram-mekhem","Talk to Spall at Zâram-mekhem in Gloomingtarn"},
[13662]={"Talk to Kholnedák","Garaphir has collapsed, winded, on the stairs","'The note that you found mentions someone named Garaphir, who is moving on to Imloth Melui. The gang you encountered in Aegollant was to report to him once they had finished moving this shipment of stone into our warehouse.\
\
'We must find out who is behind this! I recommend you go to Imloth Melui and speak with the Captain of the Guard, Merenir. He may know something of this Garaphir.'","After collapsing on one of Imloth Melui's incredibly tall set of stairs, Garaphir was more than willing to point the finger at his employer, the noble, Maengar.\
\
You should look for Maengar at his warehouse in Imloth Melui, and look for proof he was behind the infiltration of shoddy stones.","Interrogate Garaphir","'All right, I'll talk. Oof, my aching side! Bah, why are there so many steps?! This blasted city is too hilly, ouch, huff.\
\
'Wait, wait, I said I'll talk. You are wasting your time with me anyhow! I'm just the middle man! You really want Maengar. He paid me to organize the shipment of his stone down to Arnach and the Harlond.\
\
'He's at his warehouse, in the western part of the city, but you had best leave him be! He won't go down without a fight, and he has plenty of protection. Now leave me be! I was just doing my job!'","Merenir has suggested that you look for Garaphir in the market district in Imloth Melui.","After a brief chase through Imloth Melui, Garaphir has collapsed on a tall stair-case, panting for breath.\
\
You should talk to Garaphir.","'Garaphir? Yes, I know of him. In fact, I wish his name had come to my attention less lately. He's an awful brute who has no qualms about trying to swindle the good folk of this town.\
\
'You should try looking for him in the market. I think I saw him slink that way earlier.'","Maengar has been defeated!","Talk to Merenir","Realizing he was found out, Maengar attacked you to keep his secrets safe. He was no match for you, however, and has been defeated. You should collect his accounts book and bring it to Merenir.\
\
The accounts book is in Maengar's warehouse.","Garaphir sees you and makes a run for it!","Pursue Garaphir through Imloth Melui!","'${PLAYER}! Glad am I to see you, friend. Dingási sent me to check on things up here, but it seems like you have already handled the situation.'\
\
You hand her the journal and explain Maengar's involvement and demise. She flips through the pages, shaking her head.\
\
'Handled it, you certainly have! My, my. I thank you for your continued help! Those slabs of soft-stone Maengar was trying to slip in could have led to structural damage at best, and loss of life at worst. You have done a great service to Gondor and the Dwarves of Furukzahar, my friend. I will let Dingási know that the threat to our reputation - ah, and the danger of shoddy stone work, is over.'","You found a journal full of incriminating accounts","To Gondor's Garden","Examine Maengar's warehouse for evidence","You should bring the accounts book to Merenir in Imloth Melui.","The crumpled note you found mentioned someone named Garaphir, who Kholnedák thinks can be found in Imloth Melui.\
\
She has recommended that you go to Imloth Melui and speak with the Captain of the Guard, Merenir.","Talk to Garaphir","Pick up the accounts book","Shoddy stones have found their way into the stockpiles in Arnach - the work of someone named Garaphir. He must be stopped, lest he continue to taint the dwarves' supply chain and reputation.","Return to Merenir","'So, Maengar was behind the shoddy stone? That does not surprise me, but I am saddened that someone would try to profit in a way that could cause harm to others. I am sorry that you had to deal with him, but glad that you did.\
\
'While you were busy with Maengar, a dwarf named Kholnedák came 'round looking for you. You will find her just over there.'","You managed to find Garaphir in the marketplace, but he fled when you drew near.\
\
You should pursue Garaphir through Imloth Melui.","Merenir mentioned that someone had been looking for you while you were dealing with Maengar. You can find Kholnedák in Imloth Melui."},
[13663]={"Hierbas curativas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sanar a un sanador","'¡Eh, tú! Se ve que sabes desenvolverte bien en estos bosques. ¿Podría pedirte un favor?\
\
'Me llamo Hal Doblehoja. Una hermosa elfa me encargó recoger hierbas para preparar varios remedios medicinales, pero me cuesta recordar nada que no sean sus delicados rasgos o su preciosa melena...'\
\
Hal se queda absorto en sus fantasías hasta que, al fin, se acuerda de que sigues ahí.\
\
'Había algo más: dijo que por aquí crecía una clase de seta muy extraña, ¡pero no he visto ni el tallo! Quiero volver con ella cuanto antes y aún no he dado con ninguna. Entre los dos cubriremos más terreno. ¡Dime que me echarás una mano, por favor!'","Setas extrañas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, gra... gracias... estas deben de ser las hierbas... solo tengo que...'\
\
Las machaca con las manos antes de comérselas. Al poco rato, se yergue.\
\
'Ah, eso servirá, al menos por ahora. Supongo que no presté mucha atención cuando aquella preciosa elfa me hablaba de las plantas del bosque...\
\
'¡Aun así! Has cumplido con todo y me has librado de un dolor de estómago por imprudente. ¡Te estoy muy agradecido! Me esforzaré por recordar lo que dijo la sanadora y buscaré yo mismo algunas hierbas antes de marcharme. ¡Gracias por todo!'","Recolecta setas extrañas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolecta hierbas curativas y mantente lejos de las setas extrañas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Vuelve con Hal para entregarle las hierbas curativas.","'¿Ya estás de vuelta? ¿Hubo suerte?'\
\
Le entregas las setas a Hal, que arruga la nariz por el hedor que desprenden.\
\
'¡Son fantásticas! Clavaditas a lo que me describió la sanadora... creo.\
\
'¡Dijo que se podían comer crudas y que tenían un gran poder curativo! Voy a darles un buen bocado para asegurarme...'\
\
Enseguida se le pone la cara verde y pálida.\
\
'P-pensándolo bien... ¿no me diría que me MANTUVIERA LEJOS de estas setas? Estaba un poco distraído y puede que no escuchara bien... Madre mía...\
\
'¿Podrías hacerme un último favor? ¡Las hierbas que debía recoger son mi única esperanza! ¿Puedes ir a buscarlas? ¡Y ni se te ocurra tocar esas setas!'","Hal necesita hierbas curativas: las mismas que le encargaron encontrar.","Entrégale las setas extrañas a Hal Doblehoja","Llévale las hierbas curativas a Hal Doblehoja","Hal te ha encargado recoger unas setas extrañas por los bosques del Ángulo.","Dicen que el amor nos vuelve idiotas a todos... pero a unos más que a otros.","Hal Doblehoja está junto al camino al norte de Glynafon, en el Ángulo."},
[13664]={"Grimbold is at his camp in the hills at the western edge of the Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Grimbold.","'You have come to offer me your sword at this late hour? Good, I am glad.\
\
'We can use the might of a ${CLASS}, now more than ever. Are you ready for a war, ${PLAYER}, the likes of which you have never seen?'","'Go well, friend ${CLASS}. If I had my horse I would ride with you now, but it is not to be. I hope to fight at your side one day, ${PLAYER}. You were valiant to rally Grimbold from his despair -- a true friend to Rohan!'","Gamling is at Helm's Dike in the south-western Westfold.\
\
You should hasten to Gamling before the battle begins.","Speak with Erkenbrand before you leave","'Nothing you say to me can save Rohan, ${PLAYER}....'","Apresúrate a llegar con Gamling en la Puerta de Helm","'It felt good to grasp a sword again, ${PLAYER}. Very good. I have you to thank for my reunion with my allies -- with Erkenbrand at our helm, we will crash upon our foes as they fall on Helm's Deep.\
\
'Now I march! And I hope that I will fight alongside you again, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Good luck to you, my friend. Your deeds will be worthy of song this night, I know it.'","King Théoden stands upon the walls of the Hornburg.\
\
You should offer your sword to King Théoden as the Hornburg steels itself for battle.","Gandalf believes that the siege at Helm's Deep will begin soon, and that you can make it there with more haste than he with so many foot soldiers in tow.","Say good-bye to Grimbold","'Let us all make for Helm's Deep at once. ${PLAYER}, you must ride at once to the aid of King Théoden. Shadowfax and I will go with Erkenbrand, Grimbold, and Dúnhere -- at whatever pace this army of foot-soldiers can move.\
\
'Hurry, ${PLAYER}! Do not miss the closing of Helm's Gate against the enemy, or you will be on the wrong side, and you will not survive the approach of the horde.'","Erkenbrand is at his camp in the hills at the western edge of the Westfold.\
\
You should speak with Erkenbrand.","To Helm's Deep","'${PLAYER}! I had not thought to see you again. Hurry, friend, hurry! I must lock the gate at once, for our last scout says that the enemy is hot on your heels.\
\
'From whence did you come? Nay -- never mind. It must be a story for another time. Ride, ride! Ride to the Hornburg.'","Offer your sword to Théoden"},
[13665]={"'That is a nice thing for that man to do, but I am here from the Lower Ward. Even if I wanted to help, I could not make the journey every day.'","Talk to Nadiph by the memorial","Podría ser suciedad. Podrían ser excrementos. ¡Podrían ser ambos!","Talk to the man running errands","Talk to the energetic youth","'I see good Nadiph working so hard every day. I would help him, but I must care for my shop and cannot take the time away.'","Nadiph expressed a desire for help in cleaning the memorial. Perhaps you could secure pledges of assistance from people around the plaza.\
\
Talk to passersby around the plaza in the Upper Ward.","'I cannot so easily abandon my post, but I will do what I can when I can.\
\
'Whenever that may be. I promise nothing to you, you understand.'","'I do not think so. Sorry.\
\
'Perhaps someone else will do it? I cannot be your only choice for this chore, surely?'","To Honour the Dead","Clean the second dirty spot","A young man stands in front of a memorial to those murdered by the Church of the All-Seeing. He seems to be cleaning it. Perhaps you should join him in his work.","Clean the third dirty spot","Talk to the idle guardsman","You were unable to secure regular assistance from anyone nearby, but perhaps it would cheer up Nadiph to know you tried.\
\
Return to Nadiph in the Upper Ward.","Look for Nadiph","A memorial to the victims of the Church of the All-Seeing could use a cleaning.","Looks to be dirt","Clean the first dirty spot","When you return, Nadiph is nowhere to be found, but there is a fresh stain atop the memorial. You wipe it clean with a scrap of cloth left behind for that purpose.\
\
You could not fix Nadiph's problem, but you tried to help. That will have to be enough this time.","Talk to the shopkeep in the Grand Market","A young man is cleaning a memorial by himself. Help him.\
\
The memorial can be found in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","'I appreciate your help, stranger. This memorial is meant to honour those murdered by the Church of the All-Seeing, but as you can see, most of the folk here pretend it does not exist. I do not fault them for that! The memory of what happened here can be unbearably painful. I wish only that I had some help in keeping it clean on days when you are not nearby and offer your help.'","You have helped a young man clean the memorial. He seems ready to speak to you.\
\
Speak to Nadiph in the Upper Ward.","There was a stain of some kind here... but it is gone now"},
[13666]={"'You have done much to aid us, and I am thankful for that. The battle for Rohan is just beginning, however. Not long ago, a company of Orcs came through the hills of the East Wall and burned a town called Hytbold to the ground. This was an important part of our eastern defence against the Enemy, and I fear that without it Walstow will not hold for long.\
\
'I wish for you to go to Hytbold and lead the rebuilding effort. The work will be great, as the people of Rohan are already suffering much and do not have a great deal to give, but if you can defend them, serve them, and inspire them, they will answer your call and come to your aid.\
\
'I have dispatched Edgal to Hytbold. Find him there, and he will guide you through repairing and restoring this town so it may once more serve for the glory of the Rohirrim.'","To Hytbold","Hytbold is to the north-east of Snowbourn, along the hills of the East Wall.\
\
Edgal is awaiting your arrival in Hytbold.","Fastred has asked you to meet with Edgal in Hytbold, a burned-out town to the east of Snowbourn.","Talk to Edgal","'I am glad you have come. There is a great deal to do, and we must get started immediately.'"},
[13667]={"Derrota a Colmillosombrío","A Hîgropor","Encuentra Hîgropor","Derrota al Maestro de la manada Tarkrîp","Has peinado una gran parte de Nan Wathren, pero todavía hay un rincón sin explorar. Tu corazón te advierte de que esta última aventura a lo profundo del paso será peligrosa.","Colmillosombrío derrotado","El Capitán Pasolargo está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Debes volver con el Capitán Pasolargo y contarle que has tenido éxito mermando a las tropas que se están preparando para la guerra en Nan Wathren.","Destruye altares corruptos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Yo... no puedo creerlo. Verdaderamente, ${PLAYER}... ¿fuiste capaz de adentrarte en el paso y salir con vida? Es increíble. Has detenido lo que hubiera sido una guerra segura para nuestra gente. Has salvado a la buena gente de Puente de Caballetes, junto con sus hogares y posesiones.\
\
'¡No te puedo agradecer lo suficiente!'","Has peinado una gran parte de Nan Wathren, pero todavía hay un rincón sin explorar. Tu corazón te advierte de que esta última aventura a lo profundo del paso será peligrosa.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Comunidad.</rgb>","Altares corruptos destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El gran huargo Colmillosombrío y su maestro de jauría se encuentran en Hîgropor, oculto en los niveles superiores en la esquina sureste del paso de Nan Wathren.\
\
Debes derrotar a los brutales terrores de Hîgropor, y destruir los ídolos que conducen hasta allí.","Informa al Capitán Pasolargo de tu éxito en Nan Wathren"},
[13668]={"Imlad Gelair se encuentra al sureste de la Última morada, bajo las Cataratas de Imladris.\
\
Se te ha indicado que hables con Atharbain en Imlad Gelair.","'Nos alegra tenerte entre nosotros, ${PLAYER}. Puedes hacer uso de cualquier servicio que podamos ofrecerte.'","Hacia Imlad Gelair","'Te has ganado el favor de mi pueblo y deberías ir de inmediato a Imlad Gelair.'","Tras pasar un tiempo contigo, los Elfos de Rivendel están preparados para darte la bienvenida en las salas interiores de Imlad Gelair.","'${PLAYER}, ha quedado claro que tu lealtad está firmemente con nuestra Casa. Los Elfos de Rivendel agradecen tus servicios, y ya algunos de nuestros bardos han tomado la pluma, dispuestos a difundir el conocimiento de tus hazañas en melodías armoniosas.\
\
'Tras cierta deliberación, se instruyó a los Defensores de Imlad Gelair para que te den la bienvenida en nuestro santuario, alto en las colinas, con vista a la Última morada.\
\
'Hallarás Imlad Gelair al sur, más allá de las Cataratas de Imladris, al final de un camino menor que se dirige hacia el oeste. Cuando llegues, habla con Atharbain. Ella te estará esperando.'"},
[13669]={"'You have done so much to aid us, ${PLAYER}. Although you weren't able to defeat this self-styled... heir, you have pushed him from the vale, and for that, we cannot thank you enough.\
\
'To the south-east, you will find Tarlang's Neck, a narrow, rocky trail through the hills leading deeper into Gondor. If such problems plague us this far north, I worry greatly for the people of Lamedon.\
\
'On my last journey home from visiting Calembel, I met a man named Gladion near Tarlang's Neck. You should speak to him for he may know more of what troubles our lands.'","Inspired by your efforts in Blackroot Vale, Lady Rosfin of Morlad hopes you can aid the people of Lamedon.","Travel into Lamedon and speak to Gladion","'Ah, I do not believe I have seen you before, traveller, but... Lady Rosfin, that is a name I know!\
\
'You say you wish to aid the people of this land? I do not claim to speak for them all, but if you aid my family and me, I know we would be grateful!'","DNT -- will not be seen","Gladion can be found in the village of Dínadab in Lamedon, across Tarlang's Neck.\
\
Lady Rosfin has asked you to seek out a man named Gladion. She hopes you can bring aid to the people of Lamedon as well.","To Lamedon!"},
[13671]={"Talfryn está en Lhan Garan, en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\
\
Habla con Talfryn.","Los dunlendinos de Lhan Garan necesitan ayuda para prepararse para el invierno que se acerca.\
\
Un dunlendino que encontraste en Musgovilla te habló de su asentamiento en Lhan Garan. Ve allí y conoce a su líder, Talfryn.","Hacia Lhan Garan","'Lhan Garan es nuestro hogar a la vera del Aguaestancada, justo al noroeste de aquí. Junto con la gente de Musgovilla construimos un simple camino de tierra entre nuestras comunidades.'","'¿Nuestro emisario en Musgovilla te envió hacia aquí? ¡Bien! Bien. Si estás buscando trabajo, has venido al lugar indicado. Nuestra comunidad es nueva y hay demasiado por hacer.'","'Bien hallado a ti. En nombre del pueblo de Lhan Garan, te agradezco todo lo que has hecho por nuestros nuevos vecinos en Musgovilla. Ojalá hubiéramos podido luchar a su lado, pero no supimos del ataque hasta que ya había sido repelido. Aun así, nos aseguraremos de ayudarlos a reconstruir.\
\
'¿Nunca oíste hablar de Lhan Garan, dices? No lo esperaría, ya que lo construimos recientemente. Como tal, si ya has resuelto tus asuntos en Musgovilla, te invitaría a visitarnos al norte de aquí a lo largo del Aguaestancada. Tuvimos que dejar mucho atrás cuando salimos de las Tierras Brunas, y el invierno se acerca rápidamente. Habla con nuestro líder Talfryn. Estoy seguro de que tendrá mucho trabajo para alguien como tú.'","Habla con Talfryn en Lhan Garan"},
[13672]={"To Lhan Rhos","'You have done all that we have asked of you and even dealt with Nye's rudeness without complaint. I am impressed. Perhaps you can do the Dunbog some good, unlike the other duvodiad that have passed through here... and I am now one step closer to returning to my wife.\
\
'There will be few who will venture out of doors with you around. Speak with Bain, and perhaps he can help you gain some trust among the People of the Avanc.\
\
'Lhan Rhos lies to the south-west of here. You cannot miss it, for there is not much else to see in that direction.'","Talk to Bain in Lhan Rhos","Bain is at Lhan Rhos, south-west of the scouts' camp.\
\
Alun has asked you to talk to Bain, but warned you that most of the inhabitants of his village will not trust you or speak with you.","'You should speak with the Elders at Lhan Rhos.'","Alun has become impressed with you and your performance and recommends you to the Elders of Lhan Rhos.","'What are you doing here? Alun sent you? He is too trusting these days. Strangers dance their way through our lands with no regard to the plights of my people. Nevertheless, I will trust him this once.\
\
'If you wish to help us, you must help our village. War has not touched these lands, but that does not mean the weather and hardships of life avoid us. Why do we live here, you ask? That answer is not yours to have quite yet.\
\
'For now, help us further, and we will make sure your questions are answered in time.'"},
[13673]={"Lleva la cesta de hierba de pipa al Mercado de los Granjeros","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","'¡Hurra, ${PLAYER}! ¡Has salvado la Feria de los Granjeros!'","'¡Apúrate, ${PLAYER}! ¡No es momento de perder el tiempo!'","Cesta de hierba de pipa recogida","¡El puesto de hierba de pipa está a punto de quedarse sin hierba! Longo Madriguerales es el proveedor principal de la Feria de los Granjeros, y ya es hora de ir a reponer suministros.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","'¡Esto es terrible, terrible! Nos hemos quedado sin hierba de pipa. Ve a la granja de Longo Madriguerales a buscar otra cesta para el mercado y tráela lo antes posible.\
\
'Toma, aquí tienes este pastel. Está hecho con la receta secreta de mi bisabuela, y se dice que te otorga una velocidad increíble cuando le das un bocado. Date prisa. ¡No te demores!'","Recoge la cesta de hierba de pipa (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","A la granja de Longo Madriguerales: Reponiendo la hierba de pipa","La granja de Longo Madriguerales está en las Tierras de los Tuk, justo al sur de Delagua en la Comarca.\
\
Corre a la granja de Longo Madriguerales y regresa con una cesta de hierba de pipa antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Dejaste caer la cesta","Se ha acabado el tiempo"},
[13674]={"Ride along the road south toward Eastfold","The road to Aldburg can be reached by taking the southern fork on the road to the west of Entwade.\
\
You have found no sign of the people of Entwade, and should continue riding south.","Léoflad and the people of Entwade can be found along the road south into Aldburg.\
\
Léoflad and her people passed very recently. You should ride swiftly to reunite Agelman with them.","'Ah, I mean not to be curt, but many things must be set in order before my fellows and I ride to Edoras at Éowyn's request.\
\
'To answer you, aye. I saw them pass in the last hour at a fairly slow pace. Should you ride swiftly, you will no doubt find them along the road.'","'Ah, you have made it, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Edric is not well, my friend. He may seem lost in thought, but I see a blind hate building within him.'","The road to Aldburg can be reached by taking the southern fork on the road to the west of Entwade.\
\
You have readied Agelman for the journey, and should now ride south.","The three farmhands can be found at Pendlac's Farm in south-eastern Kingstead.\
\
Having seen no sign of Léoflad, you should speak to the three farmhands and ask if the people of Entwade have already passed through.","The river Snowbourn can found flowing through southern Kingstead.","Talk to Smála","'Why have you come here?'","Talk to Gyrth","Agelman can be found near the horse at Pendlac's Farm.\
\
You have aided Agelman in preparing to return to Entwade, and should now speak with him.","Aided Agelman in returning to Entwade","Argue with Thane Edric on Agelman's behalf","Talk to Agelman in the Mead Hall of Entwade","Aid Agelman in returning to Entwade","Find Léoflad and the people of Entwade","Aid Agelman in burying the people of Entwade","You have seen no sign of Léoflad or her people and should continue riding south","Rally Agelman to your side","Agelman would like to speak with you about what he can offer the defences of Entwade.\
\
You have been ordered to bring Agelman south to Aldburg.","'You have done much to aid me and the people of Entwade, ${PLAYER}. My men and I will continue to ready the town for the White Hand's return, but there remains little left to do.\
\
'Now, as for the man you found hiding in town... while he cleverly evaded my men, he will still need to rejoin with the others in Aldburg. The roads can be travelled in numbers, but I would not send him south alone - not in these times.\
\
'If you would, travel south with Agelman, and bring him to rejoin with Léoflad and the others.'","'What word have you from the fields?'","'Are you ready to return to Entwade?'","To Léoflad's Side","The time has come to journey south","'These are the grimmest of times that I have known, ${PLAYER}. While I thank you for your aid, I wish our task could have been one less tragic.\
\
'Edric must be told of what has happened, even if it wounds him greatly. All who we lost today must be mourned, and the Wade must hold in their honour!\
\
'Meet me at Entwade, ${PLAYER}, and it is there we shall talk more.'","Rally Agelman to your side by using the horn given to you by Thane Edric.\
\
Thane Edric has asked you to bring Agelman to rejoin with his people along the road south to Aldburg.","Ford the river Snowbourn","Poised to repel a White Hand assault, Thane Edric demands that Agelman be taken to safety in the south with Léoflad and the people of Entwade.","You have discovered a grim scene as the people of Entwade lay slain before you","Agelman can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
Agelman prepares to ride back to Thane Edric with Léoflad's body. You should ride to Entwade and meet him in the Mead Hall.","'Can you not see that I am busy?'","The farmhouse can be found directly south of the river Snowbourn near the border of Eastfold and Kingstead.","'Of course I heard them pass... how could one not?\
\
'You have a steed, aye? Well then, ride after them!'\
\
Smála looks around, trying to catch the eye of the other farmhands.\
\
'Brothers, we have not the time for this!'","As you cross, you spy a farmhouse in the distance","You have encountered a wrecked cart, clearly here before Léoflad set off","'¿Qué puedo hacer por ti?'","Talk to Pendlac","Aided Agelman in burying the people of Entwade","Agelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn.\
\
You have aided Agelman as best you could, and he is now ready to set off. You should speak to Agelman before he departs.","You discover three farmhands working amidst the fields","Agelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn.\
\
Agelman has asked you to aid him in recovering Léoflad's body and preparing for his return to Entwade.","Talk to Agelman at Pendlac's Farm","'I have little time to chat, and nay, I have seen not the people you speak of.\
\
'Why flee to Aldburg? I would think Edoras more secure. And what is to become of the Wade?\
\
'I must make ready, excuse me.'","Agelman rushes to your side","Follow the road south toward Eastfold","Investigate the farmhouse along the road"},
[13675]={"'Yes, I know who you are, ${PLAYER}. I have heard about you from Lord Gwaihir! With what knowledge of you I have, I know your assistance will be a boon to us in ousting this Gúrbarash. No good can come from a Gundabad chieftain in these lands.'","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist","Fanglind can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Fanglind.","Fanglind can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should greet Fanglind.","Fanglind accepts your greeting","Talk to Fanglind at Thokvist","Skarding Wargsbane can be found at Thokvist.\
\
You should talk to Skarding.","'Runerik has sent you? These must be trying times. Do not speak to me of Ujâk-fulug. I am even less pleased than you about the Wargs who escaped my wrath and made for the Floodfells. It would have not been so, if not for Gúrbarash and those cursed trolls who blockade half the valley!'\
\
The Eagle perched at Thokvist eyes you closely.\
\
'It seems you have something to add, Fanglind?'","Runerik Knotbeard, thane of Limlók, seeks to hear from Skarding Wargsbane and learn of the difficulties the lone Beorning may face in Misthallow.","The small Beorning encampment is occupied by a lone Beorning and an Eagle","Greet Fanglind with a <rgb=#FF0000>bow</rgb>","'Hmm, I can not allow any more of my kin to leave Limlók, but I must know what troubles Skarding in Misthallow. ${PLAYER}, you have proven yourself resilient and defended my home. Is it too much to ask one more task of you? Will you travel to Misthallow and seek out Skarding Wargsbane? You may find him at Thokvist where he often resides.\
\
'${PLAYER}, I can see now why Grimbeorn trusts you.'","To Misthallow","Misthallow can be found north of the Floodfells.\
\
You should travel to Thokvist in the southern end of Misthallow.","Travel to Thokvist in Misthallow"},
[13676]={"'Esto no es bueno, ${PLAYER}, estamos a punto de quedarnos sin vino. A los invitados no les va a gustar nada. Ve a la Granja de Cotonorte a buscar otro barril para el mercado y tráelo lo antes posible.\
\
'Toma, aquí tienes este pastel. Está hecho con la receta secreta de mi bisabuela, y se dice que te otorga una velocidad increíble cuando le das un bocado. Date prisa. ¡No te demores!'","Dejaste caer el vino","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","'¡Hurra, ${PLAYER}! ¡Has salvado la Feria de los Granjeros!'","'¡Apúrate, ${PLAYER}! ¡No es momento de perder el tiempo!'","A la Granja de Cotonorte: Reponiendo el vino","Barril de vino recogido","La Granja de Cotonorte está en Avenal, al norte de Tejonera, en el extremo más septentrional de la Comarca, cerca de Evendim.\
\
Corre hasta la granja y regresa con un barril de vino antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","¡Los barriles de vino están casi vacíos! La Granja de Cotonorte es el proveedor principal de la Feria de los Granjeros, y ya es hora de ir a reponer suministros.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Lleva el barril de vino al Mercado de los Granjeros","Recoge un barril de vino (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","Se te ha acabado el tiempo"},
[13677]={"'The roads are safe enough for us to return to them and ship these much needed provisions to Dol Amroth. I shall tell your deeds to my husband upon his return to the Havens. Rossaran will surely want to meet you one day.\
\
'You must make haste to Ost Lontir where the caretakers of Amon Lontir reside. I am sure they are already aware of the situation at Edhellond.\
\
'You could be of much needed assistance to the people of Ost Lontir in dealing with this greater corsair threat. May your journeys be prosperous, ${PLAYER}.'","Now that Tadrent is safe, Bruidis has asked you to go to Ost Lontir and learn more about the corsair threat in Edhellond.","'I have grown wary of accepting help from those I do not know, traveller. Yet, I fear the time has passed to be so discriminative....\
\
'If you would aid us here in Ost Lontir, I will see you rewarded.'","To Ost Lontir","Travel to Ost Lontir and speak with Gilanor","Ost Lontir is located in Belfalas, in the foothills of Emyn Ernil.\
\
You should speak with Ost Lontir's leader, Gilanor."},
[13678]={"'¡Ay, ay, ay! ¿Ya no quedan huevos? ¿Cómo es posible? Deprisa, ${PLAYER}, ve a la Granja de Arenilla a buscar otra cesta para el mercado y tráela lo antes posible.\
\
'Toma, aquí tienes este pastel. Está hecho con la receta secreta de mi bisabuela, y se dice que te otorga una velocidad increíble cuando le das un bocado. Date prisa. ¡No te demores!'","Lleva la cesta de huevos al Mercado de los Granjeros","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","'¡Hurra, ${PLAYER}! ¡Has salvado la Feria de los Granjeros!'","'¡Apúrate, ${PLAYER}! ¡No es momento de perder el tiempo!'","A la Granja de Arenilla: Reponiendo los huevos","Cesta de huevos recogida","Recoge la cesta de huevos (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","¡La Feria está a punto de quedarse sin huevos! La Granja de Arenilla es el proveedor principal de la Feria de los Granjeros, y ya es hora de ir a reponer suministros.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Dejaste caer la cesta","La Granja de Arenilla está justo al este de Cavada Pequeña.\
\
Corre a la granja de pollos y regresa con una cesta de huevos antes de que se acabe el tiempo."},
[13679]={"'Here you are, the retinue of Shâra Mizâdi, who my people say saved them from Ordâkhai slavers.\
\
'It seems we have mutual enemies. That does not yet make us friends.'","Mizâdi has decided to first visit Ahâba, the oasis settlement of the Beltáni people, to offer aid and try to form an alliance with their leader.","Defeated the Ordâkhai ambush","'There you are. The main path into Ahâba should be this way. I would rather we not accidentally sneak up on them, if they are as timid as Numûru says.\
\
'Wait. I hear something. Someone approaches.'","To Shield the Shepherds","'We will meet you outside Ahâba. I will go ahead with Sorkamâl and Numûru, because he will insist I not go without any of my Subuzûri, but leave the rest of my guards behind for now. I do not want to startle these 'meek shepherds'.\
\
'We will continue along this road toward the main path into the Oasis, to the North. We will not go ahead without you.'","The Beltáni shepherds you rescued asked you to enter Ahâba and speak to their chieftain.\
\
You should enter Ahâba and speak to Unusâli.","Mizâdi is going ahead with Numûru and Sorkamâl.\
\
You should meet her outside of Ahâba, north-west of her small camp.","Find Unusâli in Ahâba","Meet Mizâdi on the road to Ahâba","Someone is shouting and running toward you!","Someone is chasing the Beltáni shepherds in your direction!\
\
You should aid the shepherds.","Defeat the Ordâkhai ambush"},
[13680]={"'What have we here? A ${RACE} calling at our gates during these strange times?'","You have helped in Thinglad as much as was needed, and now it is time to offer your aid to the folk of Stangard.","To Stangard","'I cannot help Wynmar now, but I wish to send help to his people. Please go to Stangard and do all that you can for them, my friend.\
\
'The Elves will hold this border for them and ensure that they receive gifts from the forest when they find themselves hungry or ill-equipped.\
\
'As for me, I will remain here and contemplate this unlooked-for loss. Perhaps in the future, I would not act as I did to someone like Wynmar on principle only and instead listen to my heart before precious time is wasted....'","'I will remain here and think for a while on what has passed. My heart is heavy.'","Call at the northern gate of Stangard","Stangard is the city to the south of Thinglad, in Eorlsmead.\
\
You should attempt to gain entry to the city of Stangard."},
[13681]={"'Cooked' cold-whelpling remains in fire-pits at Bagûd-mekhem (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Mézto at Drenghól","Eager to erode the alliance between the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless and Hrímil Frost-heart, Mézto has devised a plan to turn Orc against Orc.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'You and I both know there is no love lost between the Orcs of Gundabad and those wild Orcs of the Frost-horde. Why should we not turn their mutual distrust to our advantage?\
\
'I have heard that several cold-whelplings have begun to roost with their Orkish allies in Bagûd-mekhem. I do not know the appetites of Orcs, but perhaps if a few of these whelplings were \\qcooked\\q by Gorgar's Orcs... things might not seem so friendly between them and the Frost-horde.\
\
'Do you understand? Slay as many cold-whelplings as you can and toss them in the fire-pits tended by Gorgar's Orcs!'","To Stoke A Cold Fire","Mézto can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have done as Mézto asked and sown division between the forces at Bagûd-mekhem. You should report your success to Mézto.","Cold-whelplings can be found at Bagûd-mekhem.\
\
Mézto has asked you to slay cold-whelplings in Bagûd-mekhem and set their remains upon fires tended by the Orcs of Gundabad.","Fire-pits can be found at Bagûd-mekhem.\
\
Mézto has asked to slay cold-whelplings in Bagûd-mekhem and set their remains upon fires tended by the Orcs of Gundabad.","'Hah! It would be quite a joy to see the face of the first Orc who discovers what we've done!\
\
'Alas, my imagination will have to suffice....\
\
'You've done well. That is all, ${PLAYER}.'","Collected the remains of cold-whelplings at Bagûd-mekhem (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect the remains of cold-whelplings at Bagûd-mekhem (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Cook' cold-whelpling remains in fire-pits at Bagûd-mekhem (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13683]={"'Thank you for passing along Haelam's message. A shame that I've had to hear from him so soon since our last correspondence, but I do hope that he is trying to be less... unpleasant.\
\
'At the very least, I will continue to ensure anyone working for him is well-compensated.'","The merchant Haelam has a message for you to deliver.","To Tadrent","'Hey! You there! -- I mean, excuse me, brave ${CLASS}. Will you be heading into Belfalas?\
\
'Due to the lumber camp situation in Ringló Vale, multiple shipments have been delayed. Bruidis in Tadrent needs to be notified. Send this list to her... please.' \
\
The last word barely makes it past the man's gritted teeth.","Talk to Bruidis in Tadrent","Haelam has asked you to bring a list of delayed lumber orders to Bruidis.\
\
She can be found in Tadrent, south-west from Calembel."},
[13685]={"To The Pit of Stonejaws","Talk to Scout-master Ausma in The Pit of Stonejaws","The Pit of Stonejaws is above Máttugard, in Gundabad.","'If you are seeking the Pit of Stonejaws, it is not far from here. You can find it by travelling north. Tread carefully, for very few dwarves have yet to venture within the deep shaft.\
\
'If you do venture into the Pit of Stonejaws, you should first seek out Scout-master Ausma. She has led a group of dwarves there just recently.'","'${PLAYER}, have you joined us to investigate the hobgoblins that dwell with the Pit of Stonejaws?'","Scout-master Ausma can be found at the encampment of Bárgstad in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in The Pit of Stonejaws."},
[13686]={"'Ah, ${PLAYER}, qué bueno que has venido. Las sombras se alzan rápidamente en el Este, mientras el Enemigo se prepara para desatar su mal sobre la Tierra Media una vez más.\
\
'Tenemos mucho que discutir, tú y yo, antes de que nos movamos contra la Sombra en el Este.'","Gandalf te ha convocado para que te reúnas con él en el Poney Pisador en Bree","Gandalf el Gris te ha convocado para que te reúnas con él en el Poney Pisador en Bree para discutir asuntos que le conciernen.","Gandalf el Gris está en la Posada del Poney Pisador en Bree.\
\
Deberías darte prisa en reunirte con Gandalf el Gris.","Reúnete con Gandalf en el Poney Pisador en Bree","Habla con Gandalf el Gris en el Poney Pisador en Bree","Al Poney Pisador"},
[13687]={"Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells, south of Echad Dagoras.\
\
Braigiar instructed you to find Saeradan and lend him your aid.","'Braigiar sent you, has he? I hope Dagoras and his party are finally on the move, for we have much ground to cover and little time before us.'","'We have sent many scouts ahead to determine the safest and most secret path through Enedwaith. There is rumour of a large ruined watchtower where Saruman's Dunlending minions have established a vigil.\
\
'One band of scouts is led by Saeradan, who went south to determine the strength of the enemy there. By now they should be in the midst of the Windfells. When you are done here, seek him out and offer him what aid you can, for we must ensure that as many of the Grey Company arrive safely in Rohan as possible if we are to be of aid to Aragorn when the time for battle comes.'","'By now, Saeradan has likely made camp in the Windfells to the south.'","Talk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan","To The Windfells: Saeradan's Encampment","Braigiar has asked you to forge ahead to find Saeradan's encampment in the Windfells to the south. The southern Dunlendings are reported to have a large watchtower and encampment in this region, watching the Great North Road for unwanted intrusion from the direction of Bree or the Shire."},
[13688]={"Exploradores élficos están acampados en Thorenhad, encargados de patrullar el Bosque de los Trolls en busca de señales del mal.","'No creo que aún te hayan hablado de Thorenhad. Elrond ha enviado exploradores allí para patrullar las tierras salvajes del Bosque de los Trolls y para buscar el mal que acecha en aquellas viejas colinas.\
\
'Estoy seguro de que serás bien recibido, pues el Bosque de los Trolls es extenso y nuestra gente demasiado escasa. Busca al hijo de Elrond, Elrohir, y dile que yo te envío en su apoyo.\
\
'Thorenhad es una ruina en lo alto de una colina, al norte de las guaridas de los osos en las Gargantas del Bruinen. Se encuentra al este del campamento de Barachen y a cierta distancia al oeste de aquí.'","'Eres bienvenido en nuestra compañía, ${PLAYER}. Mi hermano y yo hemos hecho cuanto hemos podido, pero aún queda mucho por hacer si queremos mantener estas tierras a salvo de los siervos del Enemigo.'","Thorenhad es una ruina en lo alto de una colina, al norte de las guaridas de los osos en las Gargantas del Bruinen. Se halla al este del campamento de Barachen y a cierta distancia al oeste de Rivendel.\
\
Anhebir te ha enviado a Thorenhad para presentarte ante Elrohir, hijo de Elrond.","A Thorenhad","'Por favor, busca a Elrohir en Thorenhad.'"},
[13691]={"Náin has asked you to help him apologize to Shúkurz.\
\
Shúkurz is preparing for the upcoming journey in an old home at the base of Buzra-salân, north of Aslíf.","You have delivered Náin's apology to Shúkurz.","Talk to Shúkurz","Náin has never been one for inaction, and Shúkurz deserves an apology.","To Tomorrow","You have delivered Náin's apology to Shúkurz. An uncertain future stands in the way of Shúkurz and his people, but they may yet find peace.","'There is one last thing I would ask of you. Years of bloodshed and bitterness may exist between our people, but I did not judge Shúkurz's character correctly. I would like to apologize, though I know my presence causes him undue stress. I would not approach him myself if he did not wish it.\
\
'Would you mind sending my apologies to him? Féli told me that Shúkurz and his party are hiding in an old home at the base of Buzra-salân in the north. I will not pretend such a small gesture will make things better, but it's a start.\
\
'You do not have to tell me his response; I trust that you'll honour my request.'","Completado","'That Náin fellow apologized? To me? Strange times we're living in. It's not like I had much of a choice, agreeing to help you folks. But if he could find it in him to apologize, maybe there's something for us Orcs in the future other than war.\
\
'We'll be on our way soon enough. I wonder what's out there....'"},
[13693]={"'Si te diriges hacia el oeste, quizá quieras descansar un poco en la Comarca Allende. Los Fronteros patrullan el límite occidental de la Comarca propiamente dicha. Habla con Salga Pastoverde en el pueblo de Nobotella y Frothard Tuk en la aldea de Campotieso. ¡Esos Fronteros te darán una bienvenida digna de la Comarca Allende!'","Salga Pastoverde se encuentra en el pueblo de Nobotella en el este de la Comarca Allende. Frothard Tuk se encuentra en la aldea de Campotieso en el centro de la Comarca Allende.\
\
Habla con Salga Pastoverde en Nobotella y Frothard Tuk en Campotieso.","Habla con Frothard Tuk en Campotieso","A la Comarca Allende","'¡Bienvenido a la Comarca Allende! ¿Qué te trae a la aldea de Campotieso, amigo?'","Mientras muchos consideran la Comarca Allende como un rincón perdido de la Comarca propiamente dicha, los pueblos que hay allí siempre dan la bienvenida a los viajeros cansados.","Habla con Salga Pastoverde en Nobotella","'Aquí estamos justo más alá de las fronteras de la Comarca. Si estás buscando la Comarca propiamente dicha, debes viajar un poco más hacia el este. Te recomendaría parar en la Comarca Allende para descansar antes de continuar. ¡La patrullan lo mejor de los Fronteros! Habla con Salga Pastoverde en el pueblo de Nobotella y Frothard Tuk en la aldea de Campotieso. Seguro que te dan la bienvenida.'","'Bienvenido a la Comarca Allende y a Nobotella, amigo.'"},
[13694]={"Bring the crate to Irzeben","Tinído has asked you to bring a crate of chisel tips north to the dwarf-outpost of Zarsatrâd.","'Well met! I am Tinído, Master of Procurements. You seem like a capable and curious sort. Have you been up to Zarsatrâd? 'Tis a small outpost south of Furukzahar which serves as a waypoint between the 'Aban-bazan quarry and Pelargir.\
\
'If you are heading in that direction, I would ask you to bring along this crate of chisel tips. I would do it myself, but I am already running behind due to this swindling merchant wanting to haggle over every minuscule detail. Bring the crate north to my supervisor, Irzeben, and he will reward you for your efforts.'","To Zarsatrâd","Pick up the crate of chisel tips","You should bring the crate of chisel tips to Irzeben.\
\
Irzeben is in northern Lebennin, at Zarsatrâd.","'Hail and well met! You say you come from Pelargir with the crate Tinído was supposed to be procuring? Aye, supposed to procure and thence return with straightaway. His love for the Pelargir mead bogs him down once more.\
\
'I thank you for your trouble. Here is the compensation he mentioned.'","Nestled within the forest of northern Lower Lebennin, is the dwarf-outpost, Zarsatrâd. The outpost serves as a waypoint for the Dwarves of Furukzahar as they move supplies of heavy stone from the Aban-bazan quarry."},
[13695]={"Journey to Zudramdân","Defeated Orkish forces (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Gabil'akkâ has secured Zudramdân in Elderslade.","Defeat Orkish forces in Elderslade (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Planted banners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The taking of Zudramdân was barely a battle, ${PLAYER}. Most of the Orcs just fled, instead of fighting. If you ask me, I found it quite odd. I would be grateful if you were to defeat some Orcs in Elderslade. Those who fled Zudramdân could not have gotten far.'","To Zudramdân","The dwarves here have just only recently secured Zudramdân","Zudramdân can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should journey to Zudramdân.","'Good work, ${PLAYER}. We will hold onto Zudramdân for as long as we can. I am weary of the growing numbers of Orcs by the walls of Gundabad. I see more with each passing hour.'","Talk to Náth at Zudramdân","Zudramdân can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Náth at Zudramdân.","Orkish forces can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should assist the dwarves at Zudramdân.","Plant banners along the road leading to Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Agátur the Boastful has asked you to plant banners along the road leading to Zudramdân.\
\
You should plant banners along the road leading to Zudramdân.","'I have just received word that the Gabil'akkâ have secured Zudramdân, to the north! This is indeed a victory, as Zudramdân is a strategic point for staging an assault against Gundabad. You must travel to Zudramdân immediately, as we will need as many warriors there as is possible. On your way there, place some banners along the road to bring strength to all in the Gabil'akkâ!\
\
'I believe that our friend, Náth, was one of the group that took Zudramdân. If you see him, give him my thanks!'"},
[13696]={"Dejaste caer la cesta","'¡Vaya! ¡Nos estamos quedando sin manzanas! Ve a Manzanal a buscar otra cesta para el mercado y tráela lo antes posible.\
\
'Toma, aquí tienes este pastel. Está hecho con la receta secreta de mi bisabuela, y se dice que te otorga una velocidad increíble cuando le das un bocado. Date prisa. ¡No te demores!'","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","'¡Hurra, ${PLAYER}! ¡Has salvado la Feria de los Granjeros!'","'¡Apúrate, ${PLAYER}! ¡No es momento de perder el tiempo!'","Recoge la cesta de manzanas (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","A Manzanal: Reabasteciendo el puesto de manzanas","¡El puesto de manzanas está a punto de quedarse sin manzanas! El huerto de Manzanal es el proveedor principal de la Feria de los Granjeros, y ya es hora de ir a reponer suministros.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","Lleva la cesta de manzanas al Mercado de los Granjeros","El huerto de Manzanal está en Hobbiton, al oeste de la Colina y Bolsón Cerrado.\
\
Corre al célebre huerto de manzanas y regresa con una cesta antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Cesta de manzanas recogida"},
[13697]={"A las colmenas: Reponiendo la miel","Sperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua.\
\
Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.","'¡Hurra, ${PLAYER}! ¡Has salvado la Feria de los Granjeros!'","Recoge un tarro de miel (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)","Lleva el tarro de miel al Mercado de los Granjeros","¡La Feria de los Granjeros está a punto de quedarse sin miel! Las colmenas de Alforzaburgo son el proveedor principal de la Feria de los Granjeros, y ya es hora de ir a reponer suministros.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","'¡Apúrate, ${PLAYER}! ¡No es momento de perder el tiempo!'","Las colmenas de Alforzaburgo están al sur de Delagua.\
\
Corre hasta las colmenas que hay junto al camino hacia el sur y regresa con un tarro de miel antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Dejaste caer la miel","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Tarro de miel recogido","'¡No! ¡Nooooo! ¡Se acabó la miel! Y yo que estaba a punto de tomar mi té. Esto me pone muy triste. Ve a las colmenas de las Tierras de los Tuk a buscar otro tarro para el mercado y tráelo lo antes posible.\
\
'Toma, aquí tienes este pastel. Está hecho con la receta secreta de mi bisabuela, y se dice que te otorga una velocidad increíble cuando le das un bocado. Date prisa. ¡No te demores!'"},
[13699]={"'Well met, friend. We have need for a ${CLASS} such as you....'","Gandalf can be found near the main gate of Edoras.\
\
You were informed that Gandalf wishes to speak with you. You should go to him at once.","To the Broadacres","A scout has encountered Gandalf while riding in the Westemnet, and the wizard mentioned that he wishes to speak with you.","'You...you are ${PLAYER}, are you not? The famous ${CLASS}. I ran into Gandalf the Grey upon the plains not long ago, and he asked me to convey a message to you if I should see you.\
\
'He said he would be in Edoras shortly to check on things there. Perhaps you will catch him if you make haste!'","Speak with Gandalf in Edoras","Húlac can be found in the town of Stoke in the Broadacres.\
\
You should ride to Stoke and search for Húlac.","'Well met again, ${PLAYER}! I have heard of trouble in the Broadacres, but I must continue my search for Erkenbrand, Grimbold, and Elfhelm, for I can find no trace of them since the Fords.\
\
'Will you go to the Broadacres in my stead, and lend what aid you can? Search for Húlac in the town of Stoke -- that will be a good start.'","Find Húlac in the Broadacres"},
[13700]={"Habla con Líkmund","'¿Thettmárr te envió a ver cómo estamos, eh? Más bien te envió a ver cómo estoy YO.\
\
'Aún le debo una gran deuda de juego de nuestra última salida juntos, y apuesto a que quiere asegurarse de que viva lo suficiente para saldarla.\
\
'Bueno, de todos modos podríamos usar manos extra, así que eres ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} si tienes un par para prestar a nuestros esfuerzos!'","Thettmárr te ha pedido que verifiques el progreso de la expedición de enanos en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, en el Camino de Durin. Una vez allí, deberías hablar con Líkmund.","'Has hecho más de lo que podríamos haber esperado en las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, así que es hora de enviarte de vuelta a los niveles superiores para ayudar en el Camino de Durin. Deberías dirigirte a la Cámara de la Encrucijada, que se encuentra al norte de la Gran Excavación.\
\
'Saluda a Líkmund de mi parte cuando llegues allí, si es que sigue respirando.'","A la Cámara de la Encrucijada","'Líkmund está con la expedición en la Sala de la Encrucijada, en el Camino de Durin. Deberías hablar con él lo antes posible.'","Para llegar a la Cámara de la Encrucijada, dirígete al norte desde el Descenso Profundo hasta el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación. Desde el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, sigue tu mapa y la carretera principal iluminada hacia la Cámara de la Encrucijada."},
[13701]={"El Descenso Profundo se encuentra siguiendo el sendero sur desde el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en el extremo norte de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Debes tomar el sendero hacia el sur para descubrir el asentamiento enano del Descenso Profundo.","Deberías hablar con Thettmárr en el campamento de Descento Profundo en cuanto quieras para partir","A los Barbiluengos les queda mucho trabajo por delante para recuperar su antiguo hogar, Moria.","'¡Te doy la bienvenida al Descenso Profundo, ${PLAYER}! Los mineros tenemos grandes esperanzas puestas en las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
'¿Has venido a ver cómo puedes echarnos una mano? No te preocupes... ¡aquí hay más trabajo del que podemos abarcar!'","'¿Te interesa echar un vistazo a las auténticas Minas de Moria ahora, verdad? No te culpo, ¡pues las leyendas hablan de su maravilla y belleza!\
\
'¡Qué no daría yo por haber ido con los enanos que se dirigieron a las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata... pero tengo un trabajo que hacer aquí, ¡y pienso hacerlo!\
\
'Toma el camino del sur desde el Mirador de la Gran Excavación y llegarás al Descenso Profundo en un santiamén; está realmente muy cerca. ¡Quizá puedas ayudar a los enanos de allí tanto como nos has ayudado a nosotros!'","Hacia el Descenso Profundo","Habla con Thettmárr en el Descenso Profundo"},
[13702]={"El campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación se encuentra al este de Lamab-dûm, en un cruce de caminos algo central en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes seguir la carretera iluminada lo mejor que puedas hasta el Mirador de la Gran Excavación.","'¿No tienes ganas de adentrarte más en Moria? Nosotros sí que las tenemos.'","Habla con Slagvi en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Hacia el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","'Saludos, mi ${PLAYERNAME:buen[m]|buena[f]} , y ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} al Mirador de la Gran Excavación. Es una vista maravillosa, aunque estaría mejor si no estuviera tan llena de los fuegos de cocina de una horda de trasgos debajo de nosotros...\
\
'No importa. Defenderemos el Mirador de la Gran Excavación a toda costa, y encontraremos la manera de expulsar a esta plaga de nuestros hogares ancestrales. Marquen mis palabras, , esto volverá a ser una ciudad maravillosa y hermosa de contemplar, aunque tengamos que dar nuestras vidas para lograrlo.'","Thórhall te ha animado a dirigirte al este, hacia el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, el centro de operaciones de los enanos en la Gran Excavación.","'Has hecho todo lo necesario por nuestro pequeño campamento, ${PLAYER}, ¡y te lo agradecemos! Pero supongo que estás emocionado por adentrarte más en Moria, como nosotros.\
\
'El campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación es el campamento central de los enanos en la Gran Excavación. Espero que varios enanos se hayan establecido allí y hayan establecido muchos servicios útiles para la ciudad.'"},
[13703]={"Meet Mizâdi at her forward camp in Idagâl","To the Dry-whelm","Mizâdi is preparing to launch a campaign in Idagâl and asked for your aid.\
\
You should speak to Mizâdi at her camp near the border of An Shêru.","'${PLAYER}! I am glad you could join us! Come, we have much to discuss.'","Mizâdi Shâra-ingari has asked for your aid in her campaign in Idagâl.","'Hail, ${PLAYER}! I bring word from Mizâdi Shâra-ingari!\
\
'She has personally requested your aid with her campaign in Idagâl. She brings the fight to the Ordâkhai in their fortress! Should your accept her request, seek her out at her forward camp, just past the border of An Shêru.'"},
[13704]={"To the Eastfold","'Oh! Are you that ${PLAYER} I've been hearing about? Gandalf Greyhame wishes to speak with you. I believe he said he would be stopping over briefly in Edoras.\
\
'Perhaps you will find him there, if you ride hard! I believe he was hoping you would help the folk of the Eastfold.'","A scout has encountered Gandalf while riding in the Westemnet, and the wizard mentioned that he wishes to speak with you.","'${PLAYER}! Good -- you are here. The Eastfold has need of you, my friend.'","Speak with Gandalf in Edoras","Gandalf can be found near the main gate of Edoras.\
\
You should hasten to Edoras to begin helping the people of the Eastfold."},
[13705]={"To the Eastfold","A scout has encountered Gandalf while riding in the Westemnet, and the wizard mentioned that he wishes to speak with you.","'${PLAYER}! Good -- you are here. The Eastfold has need of you, my friend.'","Speak with Gandalf in Edoras","Gandalf can be found near the main gate of Edoras.\
\
You should hasten to Edoras to begin helping the people of the Eastfold.","'A scout has spotted Gandalf on the plains; he wishes to speak with you. I believe he said he would be stopping over briefly in Edoras.\
\
'Perhaps you will find him there, if you ride hard! I believe he was hoping you would help the folk of the Eastfold.'"},
[13706]={"'¡Hola, hola! ¿Has venido a pescar? Siempre digo que no hay nada mejor que pescar en un día de verano. Habla conmigo un momento y te daré algo que hacer.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Necesitarás aprender a pescar para participar en esta cadena de misiones. Hay un instructor de pesca en Delagua, junto a Neddie Cavada.</rgb>","'Si no me equivoco, el evento de pesca comenzará en la Comarca, en Delagua.'","'Si deseas pescar, dirígete a Delagua, en la Comarca.'","'El estanque que buscas está en la Comarca, en un pequeño pueblo llamado Delagua.'","'¿Has estado ya en Delagua este año? Allí se está celebrando un evento de pesca y he oído que resulta bastante relajante y agradable para los numerosos pescadores que acuden al pueblo en esta época del año.\
\
'Si te interesan estas cosas, deberías hablar con Neddie Cavada. He visto a algunos presumir de las buenas recompensas obtenidas gracias a su suerte en el estanque.\
\
'Delagua está aquí, en la Comarca, a un pueblo al este de Hobbiton. Allí encontrarás a Neddie Cavada y su encantador estanque.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Necesitarás aprender a pescar para participar en esta cadena de misiones. Hay un instructor de pesca en Delagua, junto a Neddie Cavada.</rgb>","'¿Has estado ya en Delagua este año? Allí se está celebrando un evento de pesca, y he oído que resulta bastante relajante y agradable para los numerosos pescadores que acuden al pueblo en esta época del año.\
\
'Si te interesan estas cosas, deberías hablar con Neddie Cavada. He visto a algunos presumir de las buenas recompensas obtenidas por su suerte en el estanque.\
\
'Delagua está en la Comarca, a un pueblo al este de Hobbiton. Allí encontrarás a Neddie Cavada y su encantador estanque.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Necesitarás aprender a pescar para participar en esta cadena de misiones. Hay un instructor de pesca en Delagua, junto a Neddie Cavada.</rgb>","Hay un evento de pesca en marcha en Delagua. Se te ha animado a participar antes de que finalice el festival.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","'¿Has estado ya en Delagua este año? Allí se está celebrando un evento de pesca y he oído que resulta bastante relajante y agradable para los numerosos pescadores que acuden al pueblo en esta época del año.\
\
'Si te interesa, deberías hablar con Neddie Cavada. He visto a algunos alardear de las magníficas recompensas que han obtenido gracias a su suerte en el estanque.\
\
'Delagua está en la Comarca, a un pueblo al este de Hobbiton. Allí encontrarás a Neddie Cavada y su encantador estanque.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Necesitarás aprender a pescar para participar en esta cadena de misiones. Hay un instructor de pesca en Delagua, junto a Neddie Cavada.</rgb>","Habla con Neddie Cavada en Delagua","'Seguro que puedes encontrar el camino a Delagua desde aquí...'","Hacia el lugar de pesca","'¿Has estado ya en Delagua este año? Allí se está celebrando un evento de pesca y he oído que resulta bastante relajante y agradable para los numerosos pescadores que acuden al pueblo en esta época del año.\
\
'Si te interesan estas cosas, deberías hablar con Neddie Cavada. He visto a algunos presumir de las buenas recompensas obtenidas gracias a su suerte en el estanque.\
\
'Delagua está en la Comarca, a un pueblo al este de Hobbiton. Allí encontrarás a Neddie Cavada y su encantador estanque.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Necesitarás aprender a pescar para participar en esta cadena de misiones. Hay un instructor de pesca en Delagua, junto a Neddie Cavada.</rgb>","Neddie Cavada se encuentra cerca del gran estanque de Delagua, justo al este de Hobbiton.\
\
Deberías hablar con Neddie Cavada, quien te introducirá en los eventos de pesca del Festival del Lithe (y te enseñará a pescar, si aún no lo has hecho)."},
[13707]={"To the Floodfells","Talk to Léothred at the Beorninghús before you depart","Limlók can be found in the Floodfells.\
\
You should travel to Limlók.","'Ba! I can not believe Grimbeorn sent you alone. Hmm, if you do not get in the way and do as you are told, perhaps you might be useful.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Mourn</rgb> the passing of Hunulf","Grimbeorn should hear Hunulf's final words","Light a candle for Hunulf at the Carrock","Hunulf can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should mourn Hunulf's passing.","'Hunulf, my kin! I did not recognize him at the gate and now this news you bring pains me. Hunulf was an outsider, but kin all the same. We must see that his death was not in vain. You are willing to help, ${CLASS}? I will gladly accept this kindness. Here, take this candle. Light it for Hunulf at the Carrock. If you take the scholar with you, that is your decision. Just see to it that he does not die. I wish for no more deaths of those in my lands who I have sworn to protect. Those in Limlók seek aid. You must go north.'","Grimbeorn knows the threat in the north moves ever closer to the lands and people he has sworn to protect.","The small village looks tattered and worn","Hunulf can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Hunulf.","Hunulf's death can not be in vain","Hunulf has passed","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","Travel to Limlók in the Floodfells","The Carrock can be found in the Beorninglands.\
\
You should light a candle for Hunulf at the Carrock.","Runerik Knotbeard is the Thane of Limlók, in the Floodfells.\
\
You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.","Hunulf is far from his dwelling in the Thornholt. He looks badly injured.\
\
'${PLAYER}, is that you? Please listen.... I travelled from the Thornholt with Vaskorn, Threkmóth, and three dwarves. We came to warn of the growing threat. The warbands in the mountains grow more fearsome by day.... We made it to Limlók.... The village is not safe. They need help.'\
\
Hunulf coughs and looks too weak to move.\
\
'I was ambushed on my journey here. I narrowly escaped those wargs....'\
\
Hunulf falls silent.","Léothred can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","Talk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók","Deliver Hunulf's last words to Grimbeorn","'This is horrible. I did not think I would be imposing myself upon the Vales in such a trying time. If Grimbeorn allows me to continue, then continue I shall. Do not worry, ${PLAYER}. I will not get in your way!'","Talk to Hunulf at the front gate of the Beorninghús","Grimbeorn peers toward the front gate of the Beorninghús.\
\
'Now what?! Another guest?! We have not the time for this. ${PLAYER}, see what they want, then send them on their way.'"},
[13708]={"The Pristine Glade lies to the west of Lhan Rhos, beyond a cave.\
\
Elder Déin has asked you to quickly go and help protect the last remaining secret of the Dunbog: the Pristine Glade.","'You have made it in time, I hope. The Elders sent word that you were coming to defend the Glade. We have been protecting this Sacred Tree for generations. There is no duty with higher honour. \
\
'We must protect the Glade from Saruman's destructive ways. This is one of the last remaining Old Trees. We have heard that he has destroyed all others in Dunland. We cannot allow this to happen here.'","To the Glade","Saruman is attempting to attack the sacred ground of the Dunbog, and the Avanc-lûth need your help.","'Quickly! There is no time to lose. The Pristine Glade is being threatened. We protect one of the last of the sacred Old Trees. It helps us survive in this otherwise impossible land. As protectors of the Tree, we can not allow anything to happen to the Glade. \
\
'Go quickly. Do not waste time. Protect the Glade to the west from Saruman's prying eyes and soldiers.'","Talk to Maugan at the Pristine Glade"},
[13709]={"Fimlothel has asked you to aid the new recruits by repelling the Corsair advance from Khatsûr.\
\
Khatsûr can be found at the western edge of Anfalas.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, I am glad to see you well.\
\
'Lond Cirion is grateful for your aid in driving back the Corsairs of Umbar for they have long troubled our shores.\
\
'With the war ended, and many lost, we can only depend on those left behind to be up to the task. I too am personally grateful that you were able to help our new recruits. Your wisdom and martial discipline is appreciated.\
\
'Now, if there is nothing else?'","'Ever since the war, the lands have been emptied of our most seasoned and hearty folk.\
\
'Guard duties have been delegated to garrisons mostly made up of new recruits with barely any field experience.\
\
'Lond Cirion to the west of here remains harried by straggler Corsairs in Khatsûr.\
\
'They grow bold and encroach further towards Lagorduin. Would you help them by repelling the Corsairs?'","You have helped quell the numbers of Corsairs in Khatsûr. You should report to Marra.\
\
Marra can be found in Lond Cirion.","Defeat Corsairs in Khatsûr (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Marra in Lond Cirion","Corsarios derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","To the Haven of Sailors","Fimlothel expresses concern that new recruits in Lond Cirion may need help by fending off the Corsair incursion along the coast of Hathollant."},
[13710]={"'¡Hola, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} ! ¿Estás aquí para correr? Tengo un buen desafío para ti, si te ves con fuerzas.'","A las carreras de caballos","Carl Ganapié se encuentra en los Campos de Cavada de la Comarca, cerca de Gran Cavada. Sally Trilla está en las Campos de los Caballos de Bree, en el recinto del festival.\
\
Deberías hablar con Sally Trilla y Carl Ganapié para familiarizarte con las carreras del festival de esta temporada.","Habla con Carl Ganapié en los Campos de Cavada de la Comarca","'¿Yo? Yo no voy a correr. ¿Y si me cayera, o me tiraran al suelo y me pisotearan? No, gracias.'","'¿Carreras de caballos? ¡No, gracias! No son para mí, ¡y me parecería raro que alguien quisiera intentar algo tan peligroso! Puedes imaginar mi disgusto cuando construyeron una pista de carreras aquí mismo, en nuestra propia Comarca.\
\
'Sea como fuere, si deseas conseguir un poney o un caballo de temporada, puedes hablar con Carl Ganapié al sur, en los Campos de Cavada, cerca de Cavada Grande. Esa es una de las pistas; la otra está en los Campos de los Caballos de Bree, y allí Sally Trilla es la encargada de las carreras.\
\
'Puedes ir si quieres, ¡pero no vuelvas cojeando a pedirme compasión si tu bestia te tira y te lesionas! Yo digo que lo más seguro es mantenerse alejado.'","'¿Te has pasado ya por las carreras de caballos, randir? A los elfos no nos importan las pistas de obstáculos, pues se nos dan bien los corceles. Un susurro suele bastar, y las patas del caballo nunca se desvían.\
\
'Sea como fuere, esta carrera está diseñada para ser todo un reto. Si quieres probar por tu cuenta, deberías visitar a Sally Trilla en los Campos de los Caballos del recinto del festival de Bree y hablar con Carl Ganapié en los Campos del Sur de Cavada Grande. Ellos son los encargados de las carreras y estarán encantados de ofrecerte la oportunidad de demostrar tu habilidad contra el cronómetro.'","'¿Vas a intentar ganar un corcel? He oído que la carrera es terriblemente difícil, incluso para jinetes experimentados.'","Habla con Sally Trilla en las Tierras de los Caballos de Bree","'¿A qué carrera asistirás, ${PLAYER}? Si yo fuera tú, visitaría ambas.'","'¿Estás disfrutando de todo lo que ofrece el festival este año, ${PLAYER}? He oído que hay carreras de caballos en la Tierra Media para quienes disfrutan de ese deporte. Los enanos no somos muy amigos de la idea de sentarnos sobre un corcel cuando nuestras propias piernas bastan y sobran, pero cada cual a lo suyo.\
\
'Si tienes ganas de conseguir una montura especial, deberías aventurarte en las Tierras de los Caballos en Bree o en los Campos de Cavada cerca de Cavada Grande. Hay pistas de carreras complicadas, y cualquiera que desafíe el estricto cronómetro debe esforzarse para no quedar atrapado en el cieno.\
\
'Deberías buscar a Carl Ganapié y a Sally Trilla si deseas probar suerte. Yo me quedaré muy tranquilamente donde estoy, disfrutando de las festividades de Mansión de Thorin.'","Las carreras de caballos se encuentran tanto en los Campos de Cavada, cerca de Gran Cavada, como en los Campos de los Caballos de Bree. ¿Probarás suerte a ver si ganas un corcel esta temporada?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","'Hola. ¿Vas a intentar ganar un corcel? He oído que son excelentes en la granja de Hengstacer.'"},
[13711]={"'You should find the hunters at their camp to the south-east.'","To the Hunt","You continue to earn the trust of the people of the Dunbog. The Avanc-lûth must constantly hunt and scavenge, or they will go hungry quickly.","Talk to Harri at the hunters' camp","'So you believe you can hunt, Duvodiad? We shall see. The beasts of the Dunbog are stronger, faster -- and probably stranger -- than anything you have seen before. \
\
'We do not lay traps. We hunt...with our bare hands, if necessary. Come fight with us. We shall see if you live to tell the tale.'","'You have helped us greatly already, but any one person can perform a handful of tasks. Perhaps you can assist our hunters if you truly wish to prove your courage and strength. They oft gather to the south-east. \
\
'The hunters will have much for you to do, I am certain. Hurry there, and if you return successful, then I am certain that the Elders will speak with you.'","The hunters' camp lies to the south-east of Lhan Rhos.\
\
Bain has asked you to talk to the hunters and aid them, with the hope that your success will convince the Elders of Lhan Rhos to speak with you."},
[13712]={"Las carreras de Barriles pueden encontrarse visitando al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin para que te lleve hasta la zona de la carrera.\
\
Deberías dirigirte al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin, quien te indicará cómo llegar a las carreras de barriles.","'La Mansión de Thorin promete un gran espectáculo este verano. Dicen que los enanos correrán de tonel en tonel sin dejar de beber. ¡Seguro que será entretenido, no crees?\
\
'Si quieres comprobarlo, visita al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin y toma un caballo hasta la carrera de barriles mientras el Festival de Verano esté en marcha.'","'¡Eh, tú! ¿Has venido a intentar adivinar quién será el concursante más rápido? ¡Te deseo la mejor de las suertes!'","'La Mansión de Thorin ofrecerá un gran espectáculo este verano. He oído que los enanos correrán de tonel en tonel mientras beben sin parar. ¡Eso sí que debería ser entretenido, no crees?\
\
'Si quieres verlo con tus propios ojos, dirígete al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin y toma un caballo hasta la carrera de barriles mientras dure el Festival de Verano.'","'Encontrarás la carrera que buscas visitando al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin mientras dure el Festival de Verano, y luego tomando un caballo hasta la carrera de barriles.'","Habla con Jorfi (toma un caballo desde el maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin para visitar la carrera)","'Durante este verano, la Mansión de Thorin será escenario de un gran espectáculo. Los enanos correrán de tonel en tonel mientras beben sin parar. ¡Seguro que será divertido!\
\
'Si deseas presenciarlo, dirígete al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin y toma un caballo hasta la carrera de barriles mientras dure el Festival de Verano.'","'Este verano habrá un gran espectáculo en la Mansión de Thorin. He oído que los enanos competirán de tonel en tonel, bebiendo todo el tiempo. ¡Eso promete ser divertido, sin duda!\
\
'Si quieres verlo, ve al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin y toma un caballo hasta la carrera de barriles mientras dure el Festival de Verano.'","Hacia las carreras de barriles","¡La carrera de Barriles de los enanos está en marcha!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","'La carrera que buscas se encuentra hablando con el maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin durante el Festival de Verano, y tomando desde allí un caballo hasta la carrera de barriles.'","'Encontrarás la carrera que buscas visitando al maestro de cuadra de la Mansión de Thorin durante el Festival de Verano, y tomando después un caballo hasta la carrera de barriles.'"},
[13713]={"Alphlanc acampa en el extremo del Último Puente entre las Tierras Solitarias y el Bosque de los Trolls, muy al oeste de Rivendel.\
\
Anhebir te ha enviado para brindar toda la ayuda que puedas a la Elfa Alphlanc en el Bosque de los Trolls occidental.","'Saludos y bienvenido a Imladris. ¿Vienes por petición de los Montaraces? Quizás puedas ayudarnos a patrullar estas tierras.\
\
'Una de nuestras exploradoras, Alphlanc, vigila el Último Puente entre las Tierras Solitarias y el Bosque de los Trolls. Deberías hablar con ella y averiguar cómo podrías ayudarla.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Viajarás al Último Puente inmediatamente al aceptar esta misión.</rgb>","'¿Fuiste enviado por Anhebir? Si es así, eres muy bienvenido. Hay mucho por hacer.'","Anhebir te ha enviado al Último Puente con la esperanza de que puedas ayudar a la exploradora Alphlanc.","Habla con Alphlanc","Al Último Puente"},
[13714]={"The wedding planner Merilien is on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should bring the cask to Merilien.","It's probably not possible to add more water to this 'wine'","To the Last Drop","A wine so sweet as to almost be syrupy. Good for dessert?","'Vinters from across the land have sent in shipments of wine to Meldis for the feasts I’m planning. We cannot serve anything less than the finest, and each event has their own preferences, based on the menu.\
\
'Meldis' inn, The Wheel and Cask, was destroyed in the war, but she's moved up to the Splintered Shield. It's a much rougher place than her last establishment, but you look like you can handle yourself.\
\
'Meldis has the various casks of wine stored in the kitchen. Go sample each vintage until you find the one I require, then bring a barrel of it back here.'","The Splintered Shield is located on the Second Tier of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should go to The Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith and sample wines.","Deliver the cask to Merilien","Find the correct wine for the wedding planner","A robust, heady taste... of wet dog","This sweet white tastes of smoke and apricot","This light-bodied, tart red tastes of strawberries, violets, and black pepper","Pick up the proper wine cask","Picked up the proper wine cask","So tart it makes your lips pucker and your eyes water","A fizzling effervescence on your tongue. This wine is not supposed to have bubbles...","This wine tastes like your great-aunt's mouldy cellar","'Ah, excellent! This is going to be perfect, and my customers will be so happy. Good work!'","This dry white has a crisp taste with a hint of flint","You have found the wine the wedding planner requested.\
\
You should pick up the wine cask and bring it to the wedding planner in Minas Tirith.","The wedding planner in Minas Tirith requests aid in picking the perfect vintage.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","'Why are you here when my wine isn't? Get on about it, now. We haven't got all day. Or night.'","This is probably just vinegar","This wine has sapped all joy from your life","This dark red tastes of blackcurrant, leather, and anise"},
[13715]={"A la frontera solitaria","Habla con el Capitán Pasolargo en Puente de Caballetes para solicitarle un caballo rápido a la Posada Abandonada en las Tierras Solitarias.","'¿Así que has decidido ir a echar una mano al Condestable Hojafresno?\
\
'Esto está muy bien... las cosas se están poniendo peliagudas por aquí y no querría ver a alguien de tanta valía como tú caiga en combate antes de estar listo para enfrentar a la oscuridad que se cierne sobre Puente de Caballetes.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Completar esta misión te enviará inmediatamente a la Posada Abandonada en las Tierras Solitarias. Volver es otra historia...</rgb>","'Saludos ${PLAYER}. Me alegra saber que voy a disponer de más ayuda por aquí. Dado cómo están las cosas necesitamos más guerreros experimentados, y no permitiría que murieras en vano por nuestra culp.a\
\
'Sin embargo, he recibido una misiva de un viejo amigo mío, el Condestable Bram Hojafresno, que se encuentra en las Tierras Solitarias. Parece que el usual desorden de por allí se ha vuelto inmanejable, y está buscando almas valientes para ayudarle a volver a poner todo bajo control. Puedo proveerte al menos de una montura rápida para el viaje si desearas probar suerte en la Posada Abandonada, donde se hospeda.","El Capitán Pasolargo de Puente de Caballetes ha recibido un mensaje de un viejo compañero suyo... el Condestable Bram Hojafresno, quien está en las Tierras Solitarias intentando contener una ola de anarquía y cosas peores.\
\
Habla con el Condestable Hojafresno en su nombre para ver qué ayuda puedes ofrecerle."},
[13716]={"Arrived at Sâr Marsag","You arrived in Sâr Marsag and see a scout named Tábai. Bring the supplies of the serum to him and let him know to distribute them.","Dáthlil has given you supplies of the serum that the Rangers concocted to resist the blight. Bring them to the scouts in Sâr Marsag to the south.","'Our scouts in the south continue to search for the source.'\
\
Dáthlil hands you bottles of the serum.\
\
'I ask that you bring some of the serum you and the Rangers have concocted to them in Sâr Marsag. It will help to keep them safe.\
\
'They will also be relieved to learn we are making progress here in Sul Madásh.'","'Take a rest, traveller. You will be safe within this camp.'\
\
You give Tábai the supply of blight serum and explain it is from Dáthlil in Sul Madásh.\
\
'A serum you say? To protect us from this blight? That is wondrous news! I will distribute this to the other scouts immediately. I am relieved to hear that the scholars of Sul Madásh are making progress to stop the spread of the rot.\
\
'While you are here, there may be others who could use your help. Be sure to speak with Baráil as well.\
\
'Thank you for this delivery my friend. It will save many lives.'","Travel to Sâr Marsag","To the Next Camp-fire","Speak with Tábai"},
[13717]={"Ayudaste a Mögr en Zelem-melek, y él se ha enterado de que la Guardia Orca en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo también necesita ayuda.","A la Guardia Orca","'Ah, saludos, . ${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} a la Guardia Orca. Desde luego que necesitamos ayuda, si es que estás aquí por eso.'","'Ya te hartaste de Zelem-melek, ¿eh? Pues siempre serás ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, , por los servicios que nos prestaste.\
\
'Hay una cabra esperándote en el establo que ya conoce la ruta hasta allí, si no quieres arriesgarte en el camino. El viaje hasta la Guardia Orca es difícil...'","Habla con Avar en la Guardia Orca (hay una cabra disponible para el viaje, ya que el trayecto es difícil)","Avar se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, a una gran distancia de la Sala Vigesimoprimera a través de los numerosos y sinuosos pasadizos de Zelem-melek.\
\
Mögr te ha invitado a ir a las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo montando una cabra si el viaje resulta demasiado difícil a pie."},
[13718]={"To the Pit of Stonejaws DNT NOT USED","'${PLAYER}! I have new orders for you! Scout-master Ausma requests your aid in the Pit of Stonejaws, the hobgoblin seat of power! Please proceed to Bárgstad as soon as you are able!'","Ausma has requested your aid in her mission in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You will find Scout-master Ausma at the dwarf-camp Bárgstad.","'Good to see you, ${PLAYER}! I'm glad my runner was able to find you. I have my hands full here, and welcome your competency!'","A runner from Scout-master Ausma has found you. Your orders are to assist her and her scouts in the Pit of Stonejaws.","Talk to Ausma in Bárgstad"},
[13719]={"The Starkmoor is a land to the south of Pren Gwydh.","'You have done a great deal for us here in Galtrev, ${PLAYER}. I am sure you will be back, for our city is great. Yet if you wish to continue your travels through Dunland, you should head south to the Starkmoor.\
\
'I am sure there are folk in need of aid there, as well. Perhaps they too feel the oppression of Isengard. Saruman has stretched his White Hand perilously far into our lands.\
\
'A fellow named Andras just led his caravan in that direction...perhaps you can overtake him on the road, and he can show you around.'","The Starkmoor is to the south-west of Pren Gwydh.\
\
You should search for Andras, the leader of a caravan, on the road from Pren Gwydh to the Starkmoor.","Find Andras in the Starkmoor","'A thief on the road! Help! Help! Oh, why will no one help me?\
\
'You...you are not here to steal my wares? Ah! Perhaps you can help me, then. As you see, I am in a bit of trouble.'","To the Starkmoor"},
[13720]={"A scout has just come from the Stonedeans, and it would seem that the people of that land are in need of aid.","Find Oter in the Stonedeans","To the Stonedeans","'I have just come from the Stonedeans. A fellow I met on the road there, Oter, told me of the many problems afflicting those folk.\
\
'It would seem that people are beginning to flee the land. Who will help them, when everyone is looking west to the Fords and to Helm's Deep?'","'Beware, traveller! We are trying to flee this land, and I hate to see unwary folk risk their lives by going in.\
\
'You are here to help, are you? Well! That is a surprise unlooked-for!'","Oter can be found on the road in the Stonedeans, near Woodhurst.\
\
You should hasten to the Stonedeans and find out more from Oter."},
[13721]={"'Buscas a Dore Dospiés, en El Sabor de Hobbiton. Puedes llegar hasta él tomando un caballo desde las caballerizas de Cavada Grande hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta, y desde allí otro caballo te llevará a El Sabor de Hobbiton.'","¡El Sabor de Hobbiton ya está aquí! Puedes acceder tomando el caballo desde el establo de Cavada Grande hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta, y desde allí otro caballo te llevará a El Sabor de Hobbiton. Los caballos solo están disponibles durante el evento.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Habla con Dore Dospiés (toma un caballo desde las caballerizas de Cavada Grande hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta y, desde allí, otro caballo hasta El Sabor de Hobbiton).","Hacia El Sabor de Hobbiton","Se puede acceder a El Sabor de Hobbiton tomando un caballo en las caballerizas de Cavada Grande hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta, y desde allí otro caballo te llevará a El Sabor de Hobbiton. Los caballos solo están disponibles durante el evento.\
\
Debes dirigirte a las caballerizas de Cavada Grande, donde un caballo te llevará hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta.","'¡Hola! ¿Has venido a intentar adivinar quién será el participante más rápido?'","'¿Aún no has visto El Sabor de Hobbiton? Bien podría ser lo más extraño que he presenciado jamás. Sin duda merece una visita, si todavía no te has acercado a la Comarca.\
\
'Si necesitas indicaciones, dirígete a las caballerizas de Cavada Grande. Allí un caballo te llevará a donde tengas que ir mientras el festival esté en marcha.'","'¿Ya has visto El Sabor de Hobbiton? Diría que es una de las cosas más extrañas que he visto jamás. Desde luego merece la visita, si aún no has llegado a la Comarca.\
\
'Si necesitas indicaciones, dirígete a las caballerizas de Cavada Grande. Allí un caballo te llevará a donde debas ir mientras dure el festival.'","'Buscas a Dore Dospiés, en El Sabor de Hobbiton. Puedes alcanzarlo tomando un caballo desde las caballerizas de Cavada Grande hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta, y desde allí otro caballo te llevará a El Sabor de Hobbiton.'","'Buscas a Dore Dospiés, en El Sabor de Hobbiton. Para llegar hasta él, toma un caballo desde las caballerizas de Cavada Grande hasta el Árbol de la Fiesta, y desde allí otro caballo te llevará a El Sabor de Hobbiton.'","'¿Ya has visto El Sabor de Hobbiton? Diría que es una de las cosas más extrañas que he visto jamás. Sin duda merece la visita, si aún no has pasado por la Comarca.\
\
'Si necesitas indicaciones, dirígete a las caballerizas de Cavada Grande. Allí encontrarás un caballo que te llevará a donde debes ir mientras dure el festival.'","'¿Ya has visto El Sabor de Hobbiton? Diría que es lo más extraño que he visto en mi vida. Merece sin duda la visita, si aún no te has acercado a la Comarca.\
\
'Si necesitas indicaciones, ve a las caballerizas de Cavada Grande. Allí un caballo te llevará a tu destino mientras dure el festival.'"},
[13722]={"A runner from Scout-master Ausma has found you. Your orders are to assist Hórin in the peaks of the Welkin-lofts!","Ausma has sent word that the hobgoblins are moving into the Welkin-lofts.\
\
Your orders are to assist Hórin with tracking them down. You will find Hórin at a camp in the northern reaches of the Welkin-lofts called Fellgát.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! Ausma's runner must have found you. Welcome to the top of the world!'","Talk to Hórin in Fellgát, a camp in the northern reaches of the Welkin-lofts","To the Welkin-lofts","'${PLAYER}! I have new orders from Scout-master Ausma for you! She says that Warlord Dushtalbúk and Loknashra have left Shakhajât with a host of hobgoblins, and are moving toward the Welkin-lofts. You are to meet Hórin and assist him as soon as you are able!\
\
'Look for him in the northern reaches of the Welkin-lofts, at a camp called Fellgát.'"},
[13724]={"Gandalf can be found upon the road in the centre of the Westfold.\
\
You should make haste and ride to Gandalf.","A scout has encountered Gandalf while riding in the Westemnet, and the wizard mentioned that he wishes to speak with you.","To the Westfold","'I passed the wizard Gandalf upon the road not long ago, and he mentioned that he wishes to speak with you. The king is in the Westfold, at Helm's Deep -- he braces for war!\
\
'Will you ride to him? Gandalf is apparently searching high and low for Erkenbrand, Elfhelm, Grimbold, and all their company. He needs your help.'","Speak with Gandalf in the Westfold","'We meet again! Good, I am glad. I have great need of you. The more eyes I have out upon the plains, the better.'"},
[13725]={"Langhár se puede encontrar en algún lugar de Vegbár.\
\
Deberías hablar con Langhár.","'${PLAYER}! Good to see you again, friend! What brings you to Vegbár? Not here to pay the toll are you? Ha ha!'\
\
You tell her that Sterkist sent you, and mentioned something about goblin problems.\
\
'Oh, Sterkist, always worried about his sister! Indeed, there are often goblin problems this close to Goblin-town. This time, however, they are not of the usual sort. This time they may be worse.'","Travel to Vegbár","Langhár has been sent to the Wolf-denes to help deal with the goblins there. Sterkist believes she would be happy to accept your help in the matter.","'${PLAYER}! Good to see you again! How go the adventures?'\
\
You tell Sterkist about all of your travels since the last time you saw him.\
\
'Oh my, that all sounds rather harrowing! I think my adventuring days are behind me, friend. One near-death experience is plenty! Grimbeorn keeps me busy enough around here as it is. He is never especially pleased to have guests! I, on the other hand, am happy to meet new friends from far-away lands.'\
\
He chuckles to himself, and then suddenly remembers something.\
\
'Oh! Langhár will want to see you again since you are here! She was sent to the Wolf-denes to help deal with the goblin problem. You should go see her if you have time!'","Has encontrado Vegbár","A las guaridas de los lobos","Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes, can be found south-west of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should travel to Vegbár to find Langhár.","Habla con Langhár"},
[13726]={"'Excelente. Una vez que le añada un par de especias de mis reservas, esto será exactamente lo que necesitamos.'","Baba de sapo","Baba de sapo recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los sapos que viven en las Obras Hidráulicas producen una baba con propiedades desconcertantes.","Gyrgir se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, en el centro de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Deberías llevarle la baba de sapo que has recogido a Gyrgir.","Los sapos se pueden encontrar por todas las Obras Hidráulicas y al este de la Gran Rueda.\
\
Gyrgir cree que con algo de baba de sapo puede crear una solución al problema de los lagartos.","Habla con Gyrgir en Hulwul-nefekh","'Sé que estás ocupado ayudando a Ansurr con la rueda, pero si puedes dedicar un momento, necesito ayuda para mí.\
\
'Hay un poderoso lagarto que sigue matando a nuestros mensajeros. ¡Pero tengo un plan para deshacerme de él! La primera parte implica la baba de sapo.\
\
'La baba de los sapos aquí en las Obras Hidráulicas tiene poderosas cualidades desconcertantes. Si me traes algo, puedo convertirlo en un polvo que podemos usar contra los lagartos.'","'Sin esa baba, no podemos esperar deshacernos de los lagartos.'","Recoge baba de sapo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13727]={"Recoge patas viscosas de sapo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Gracias, gracias, ${PLAYER}! Ahora mezclaré esta pasta con el resto del guiso y... ¡listo!\
\
Indor toma un gran bocado del guiso y mastica con satisfacción durante un momento. Luego una expresión de disgusto cruza su rostro y escupe lo que tenía en la boca.\
\
'¡Esto es asqueroso, ${PLAYER}! ¡No es ni remotamente tan delicioso como dijo ese enano!'","'La piedra de moler está justo ahí, ${PLAYER}. Solo muele esas patas y lenguas de sapo hasta hacerlas puré, y las añadiré al resto del guiso.'","Guiso de Sapo","Hay una piedra de moler junto a la hoguera de Indor en Echad Candelleth.\
\
Indor está esperando que muelas los ingredientes del guiso de sapo hasta hacerlos una pasta.","'¿No has molido aún los pedazos de sapo?'","Encontrarás sapos a lo largo de las orillas de los ríos en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Indor te ha pedido que le ayudes a reunir los ingredientes necesarios para preparar el guiso de sapo, una receta que le dio el enano Wéthorm. Te recordó que solo los sapos verdes del río tienen lenguas y patas de calidad.","'¿No tienes los pedazos de sapo que te pedí? ¿Por qué?'","Lleva los ingredientes del guiso de sapo a Indor","Indor está muy entusiasmado por probar una receta que el enano Wéthorm le dio, pero no tiene los ingredientes necesarios.","Patas viscosas de sapo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lenguas ásperas de sapo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Mueles los pedazos de sapo hasta hacerlos puré","Muele los ingredientes del guiso de sapo en la piedra de moler","Lleva la pasta de sapo a Indor","'¡Muy bien, ${PLAYER}! Veo que has reunido los ingredientes que necesito para hacer el guiso de sapo.\
\
'Ahora, si los mueles en esa piedra de ahí, te lo agradeceré mucho.'","Indor está en Echad Candelleth, el campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has recogido muchos trozos de sapo con los que Indor planea preparar su guiso. Deberías llevárselos.","'Encontrarás sapos en todas las orillas de Tâl Bruinen, ${PLAYER}. Compartiré el guiso contigo cuando esté listo, ¡así que date prisa en recoger los ingredientes! Estos sapos cazan en grupo, pero solo los sapos verdes del río tienen buen sabor.'","'No es ningún secreto que me considero un cocinero habilidoso, ${PLAYER}. La gente siempre me da recetas nuevas para probar, y paso más tiempo cocinando platos deliciosos que cazando. Cada uno debe seguir su propio camino, eso siempre lo digo yo.\
\
'Hace poco hablé con un enano muy amable llamado Wéthorm, que viajaba por Tâl Bruinen hacia el norte. Me contó que tenía una receta deliciosa de guiso de sapo y, después de un poco de insistencia, accedió a compartirla conmigo.\
\
'¿Podrías ayudarme a reunir los ingredientes? Aún necesito lenguas y patas de sapo. Los encontrarás a lo largo de los ríos que recorren Tâl Bruinen, creo yo. Me han dicho que los sapos verdes del río tienen las mejores patas y lenguas. ¡No vuelvas con piezas de los rojos! Wéthorm fue muy claro en eso.'","Recoge lenguas ásperas de sapo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Indor está en la hoguera de Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen.\
\
Has molido los pedazos de sapo hasta hacerlos una pasta y ahora debes entregárselos a Indor para que dé los toques finales al guiso."},
[13729]={"Toil in Tingobel","Collect piles of unrefined iron ore in Tingobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You set the crate down on the waggon, and the task is done!","Collected piles of unrefined iron ore in Tingobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Boradan can be found in Tingobel in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have helped Boradan by carrying a heavy crate of ingots to the waggon in Tingobel. You should return to Boradan.","'Oh no...\
\
'How did I even do that?'\
\
Rhúdon stands beside a toppled cart and iron ore lies strewn about the ground.\
\
'And now he's sent someone to check on me? Master Boradan is going to have my head for this! He tasked me with delivering a supply of unrefined iron ore to the forges, but if I don't get this cart righted, it's going to cause a lot of trouble for the miners. Would you help me deliver this ore to Master Boradan? I was also supposed to help clean up the loose ore strewn about the village from when the Orcs took Tingobel, but now it seems I'll have no time for that.\
\
'Please, I beg you, do not tell him about this. I will sort this out—I swear it!'","With the Orcs of the White Mountains driven out of the Blackroot Vale, the people of Tingobel once again work to supply Gondor with iron.","Deliver the unrefined iron ore to Boradan in Tingobel","Pick up the crate of ingots in Tingobel","Talk to Rhúdon","Talk to Boradan","Rhúdon can be found near the entrance to the mine in Tingobel, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Boradan has asked you to check on his apprentice, Rhúdon, who has been slow to return from his duties in the mine. You should talk to Rhúdon.","'Oh, might I ask one more thing of you?\
\
'My apprentice, Rhúdon, is due to deliver a new supply of iron ore to my forge, but he's been gone a bit longer than I would have expected. He's probably just talking to one of the miners again, but there's a lot of work to be done today, and I could use another pair of hands.\
\
'Would you check on him up by the mine?'","The crate of ingots can be found near Boradan's forge in Tingobel, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Boradan has asked a favour of you: to bear the last, heavy crate of iron ingots to a waggon at the western end of the village. You should carry the crate of ingots to the waggon.","'What is this, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You set the ore down beside Boradan's forge and he nods in thanks.\
\
'As much as I appreciate your assistance, I do not recall taking you on as my apprentice! What has Rhúdon done now?'\
\
You explain that Rhúdon has accidentally toppled a cart outside the mine in Tingobel. Boradan sighs, but you notice a slight smile.\
\
'When I was an apprentice, I did the very same thing... and it was years before I heard the end of it! It will take time and more careful hands, but Rhúdon will make a fine blacksmith. Since he's still preoccupied with that cart, I could use your help moving one last crate of ingots over to the waggon at the western end of the village. Those crates are awfully heavy, and I've already moved more than my fair share of them!\
\
'What do you say, my friend? One last favour?'","'It is done, then? Very good.\
\
'I don't think my back could have withstood another one of those crates! I am not the young man I once was, after all. Rhúdon, on the other hand...'\
\
Boradan chuckles to himself.\
\
'Well, let us just say the path to becoming a journeyman can be a long and winding one!\
\
'You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}. And do offer my regards to King Elessar!'","Piles of unrefined iron ore can be found in Tingobel, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
After accidentally tipping over a mine cart, Rhúdon has asked for your help in collecting unrefined iron ore for Boradan. You should collect unrefined iron ore around Tingobel.","Boradan can be found in Tingobel in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have collected a great deal of unrefined iron ore. You should deliver it to Boradan on Rhúdon's behalf."},
[13730]={"'¿Eres ${PLAYERNAME:el enano[m]|la enana[f]} que Núluzagar me prometió?'\
\
Asientes. Zôreth te examina y una mueca burlona se forma en la comisura de su boca.\
\
'Sí, servirás.'","'¡Oye!'\
\
'¿Por qué permaneces sin hacer nada cuando sabes lo que se te exige? ¿Estás conforme con dejar que el resto de tu deformada estirpe cargue con estas tareas por ti? Si es así, el Señor Oscuro tiene poco uso para ti. No eres inútil, ¿verdad?'\
\
Niegas con la cabeza.\
\
'Eso pensé.\
\
'Cuando tus labores hayan terminado, deberás presentarte ante Zôreth.\
\
'Haz lo que se te ordena.'","En las mazmorras de Barad-dûr, los Hachetón son obligados a trabajar sin descanso para el Señor Oscuro de Mordor.","Se te ha ordenado trabajar en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Zôreth puede encontrarse en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\
\
Has cumplido con todos tus deberes y ahora deberías informar a Zôreth.","Trabajo en la Torre Oscura","Preséntate ante Zôreth.","Trabajo en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[13731]={"The Ranger Prestadír is very perturbed by the atmosphere around Audaghaim and is curious about the history of the town.","'I do not like this feeling of unease that has settled upon my shoulders. Have you spoken to any shades?'","Collected fell-looking coins (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Prestadír en la Posada Embrujada","Prestadír can be found in the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, west of Audaghaim.\
\
You should return to Prestadír with the strange tokens you collected from the shades of Audaghaim.","Confront shades in Audaghaim and search them for clues (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Shades can be found in Audaghaim in the Dourstocks, just east of the Haunted Inn.\
\
You should confront shades and see if you can find anything out about why this ruined town feels so fell.","Tokens of Fealty","'I, too, am interested in what you had to tell of the graveyard. I find I am ill at ease in this place, and my curiosity has been raised by your tale of the stones in the plot below. The Elves care not for the troubles of Men long departed from this world, but they hold a great interest for me.\
\
'East of here, across the bridge, you will find a town that fell long ago. I believe it was called Audaghaim, and there are many shades there. Fell spirits of the Enemy do not trouble me, but I believe there is something more to this place, and I wish to know what it is.\
\
'Will you confront the shades? I do not think they are wholly evil. Perhaps they bear some knowledge that will reveal what befell this place.'","'Now, this is a bewildering find. Let me see those.'\
\
'These coins, as you have surely noticed, are tokens of fealty to the Necromancer in Dol Guldur. They are from nearly six hundred years ago, when this simple town of woodsmen was filled with warm-blooded folk, and not the cold spirits that linger in cursed rage.\
\
'These were gifts, and some pact was exchanged with Dol Guldur. What happened here? What cruel fate has made these people linger to fill the very air with such wicked dread?'"},
[13733]={"A pair of drakes have roosted on the ruins of a small island off the coast of Dol Amroth, terrorizing the Gondorian fishermen.","Place the meat then defeat the drakes","Akalur has fallen!","'Tol Aduial is a small island, just off the coast of Dol Amroth. You can see it from the cliffs near the Great Hall. Long has it been an outpost of the city, where we watched all manner of boats enter the bay. That is where we would intercept our enemies and ensure it was only allies who passed on to the city.\
\
'The Corsairs have taken it as their own, and are choking off our fishermen and supplies. To make it worse, they have brought a pair of drakes with them. Fearsome beasts.\
\
'There is a small boat in the harbour that will take you there. Once there, keep your eyes open. I am sure there is more to deal with than just those drakes. Be warned, you will want friends with you.'","Tol Aduial - A Feast of Drakes","Yaradec has fallen!","They are coming...","The drakes must be vanquished to protect the city.\
\
A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Aduial."},
[13734]={"Before time expires","Placing the bait will cause the avanc to swarm.","Tol Aduial - A Hunter's Prowess","Defeated swarming avanc","The swarm is coming.","Place the bait","The challenge has begun. Dispatch as many avanc as you can before the time expires.","Avanc fill the coastal waters. With the right 'encouragement' they will swarm. True hunters of Gondor are able to dispatch of swaths of the beasts within a few very short, intense, moments.","Defeat swarming avanc (${VALUE}/20)","Time has expired"},
[13738]={"Tol Fennas - Corsair Craftsmen","Glíreth is in Dol Amroth.\
\
Glíreth will be pleased to hear the workforce at Makham Jurrar has been noticeably reduced.","Defeat Corsairs at Makham Jurrar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'On the north side of Tol Fennas the Corsairs have set up a lumber camp, Makham Jurrar. The trees from the island are being brought there and felled. I believe they are using them to build a fleet of smaller vessels, just large enough to cross the channel and land in Belfalas. A fleet for a massive assault.\
\
'Head to the island. You can use a small boat in the harbour. Find this camp and defeat the Corsairs within.'","'It is hard to build ships and fell lumber without men. Good work.'","The Corsairs have set up Makham Jurrar, a lumber and shipyard camp on the north side of Tol Fennas.","Corsairs can be found at Makham Jurrar, the lumber and shipyard camp on the north side of Tol Fennas.\
\
Glíreth asked you to venture to Makham Jurrar and disrupt the lumber camp there. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.","Defeated Corsairs at Makham Jurrar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13741]={"'This is a start. We will have to be vigilant to ensure these ones are left to grow.'","Planta las semillas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tol Fennas - Planting Anew","Dimlas is in Dol Amroth.\
\
Dimlas will be pleased to hear a new crop of seeds has been planted.","The Corsairs are cutting down the trees on Tol Fennas in order to build more ships and boats.","Semillas plantadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Planting locations can be found all over Tol Fennas.\
\
Dimlas asked you to go to Tol Fennas and plant seeds to grow new trees. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.","'The trees on Tol Fennas are quite important. The wildlife that lives there relies on them for food and shelter. Their roots also keep the island from slipping into the waters during the more violent storms.\
\
'The Corsairs that have settled there are cutting them down without care or concern. While I want to stop them from being able to build more ships, preserving the island is very important as well.\
\
'Use a small boat in the harbor and head to the island. Once there, find some suitable locations and plant some seeds so we can begin growing a new crop of saplings.'"},
[13747]={"Tolwin asks for assistance as he patrols Talath Anor, searching for his mother who has been missing since minions of Mordor invaded the stronghold of Cair Andros.","Complete: Dismantling Their Efforts","Tolwin is in the hall at Crithost.\
\
You should speak with Tolwin.","Tolwin wishes for your help in his search for his missing mother, Dúneth.\
\
You should complete a number of tasks in Talath Anor, using the whistle to call your friend for help if you become separated.","Complete: The Search for Dúneth Continues","'We can not delay further. We must work together to take back this land and find my mother, who may still be alive out there. I am certain The First Blade wants all of Talath Anor to burn. I have looked into his eyes and saw what he is capable of. He has murdered innocents with no remorse. He will leave nothing to chance.\
\
'I feel that Crithost's defences are sufficient for the time we will be away. Ceveneth and the Cair Andros guards will manage without us.'","Talk to Tolwin to dismiss him","Complete: The Doorstep of Cair Andros","'Call me to your side when you wish to depart.'","Complete: Protecting the Woods","Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated","Speak with Tolwin","Tolwin's Journey","You should speak with Tolwin.","Tolwin has asked you to join him on his search for his mother, Dúneth","'I thank you for your aid in finding my mother. Still, there is much to do.'"},
[13748]={"Bandas de tela de los saqueadores de tumbas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bandas de tela de los Saqueadores de Tumbas — Introducción","'Tus acciones hablan bien de tu habilidad y valentía. Ojalá pudiera recompensarte más generosamente por tus esfuerzos, pero nuestros recursos están al límite, y por ahora nuestros agradecimientos deberán bastar.'","Cannuion te habló de la terrible amenaza que los Angmarim y los saqueadores de tumbas representan para los Montaraces de Evendim.","'Saludos, ${PLAYER}. Llegas en un momento difícil... hemos sido terriblemente sobrepasados por las incursiones de los Angmarim en nuestras tierras y por la cantidad de bandidos sin ley que se han envalentonado con las nubes de guerra que se ciernen sobre nosotros.\
\
'Es contra estos últimos que espero puedas ayudarnos. Las bandas de saqueadores de tumbas se han vuelto tan audaces últimamente que incluso han comenzado a portar bandas de tela como muestra de lealtad hacia sus distintos y despreciables líderes. Me gustaría que me trajeras estas bandas como prueba de su derrota.\
\
'Si haces esto por nosotros, me aseguraré de que tu nombre sea bien considerado entre los Guardianes de Annúminas.'","'El tiempo no está de nuestro lado, ${PLAYER}. No nos faltan enemigos —especialmente esos carroñeros que saquean las tumbas de nuestros ancestros.\
\
'Reclamar unas cuantas bandas de ellos no debería suponer un gran desafío, ¿verdad?'","Recoge bandas de tela de los saqueadores de tumbas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las bandas de tela de los saqueadores de tumbas a Cannuion en Tinnudir.","Se pueden encontrar saqueadores de tumbas por toda Evendim. Cannuion se encuentra en Tinnudir.\
\
Cannuion te ha pedido que recojas las bandas de lealtad de los saqueadores de tumbas y se las lleves."},
[13749]={"This is the tomb of Lóni II","Kyrstig is scouting near Akhaldarâg.","Investigate the sixth dwarf-lord's tomb","This is the tomb of Thekki Stonefist","Akhaldarâg is in the south-west side of the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
Kyrstig asked you to investigate some of the tombs of dwarf-lords in the name of Longbeard scholarship.","Investigate the second dwarf-lord's tomb","This is the tomb of Althóf the Wise","Anár III rises from his tomb!","Investigate the third dwarf-lord's tomb","Nyráth Toothcrown rises from his tomb!","Investigate the fourth dwarf-lord's tomb","Investigate the fifth dwarf-lord's tomb","Tombs of the Old Lords","Investigate the first dwarf-lord's tomb","Brúni Trollbane rises from his tomb!","Kyrstig has asked you to investigate tombs she believes belong to note-worthy dwarves in Akhaldarâg.","Talk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg","'Akhaldarâg is smaller than the main mausoleum of the Houses of Rest, but I believe it still contains the tombs of some note-worthy dwarves. I think it would be beneficial for us to investigate who is interred here, for the sake of our Longbeard scholars if not for our own!'","'You say some of the dwarf-lords rose from their graves and attacked? That must have been a terrifying experience! I'm glad you were able to hold your own against them!\
\
'I had little idea that research could be so dangerous! Is it always?'"},
[13750]={"Glóin can be found in the war-room of Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You have found Glóin in the old keep of Annâk-khurfu. You should speak to Glóin.","The impressive dwarf-ruins of Annâk-khurfu loom overhead, but you see no sign of Glóin","Talk to Glóin at Annâk-khurfu","'Indeed, but that is only a wishful thought.\
\
'You have a duty to Durin and his army to see this march to its end, and I would not have you break an oath on my account. Most of the dwarves I have seen pass through the Slade have mustered at Annâk-khurfu. I overheard one of them speak the name Glóin. Is this name known to you?'\
\
You tell Nagli that Glóin is an old friend and a commander of the army passing through Elderslade.\
\
'It is there you must go then—to Glóin and your allies.\
\
'Beware the dangers that lie beyond our little encampment, ${PLAYER}. May good fortune be with you!'","Find Glóin in the old keep of Annâk-khurfu","Annâk-khurfu can be found to the west of Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade.\
\
Nagli Want-kin has suggested that you rejoin Durin's army at the dwarf-ruins of Annâk-khurfu. You should travel to Annâk-khurfu.","Too Close for Comfort","As the Want-kin bid you farewell, the conflict in Elderslade grows greater just beyond Annâk-khurfu.","Amidst the bustling war-room, you spy Glóin beside a table in the distance","Annâk-khurfu can be found to the west of Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade.\
\
You have arrived at Annâk-khurfu and you should now enter the old ruins in search of Glóin.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! I had begun to wonder where you'd gone.\
\
'You've arrived just in time. Come, let us speak.'","Ir a Annâk-khurfu"},
[13751]={"Hadroneth se encuentra en Talan Haldir, a orillas del Nimrodel, al sureste de Nanduhirion.\
\
Has prendido fuego a muchas de las barricadas orcas en Nanduhirion y ahora deberías informar a Hadroneth.","'Los orcos construyen barricadas fuera de los campamentos que han establecido en Nanduhirion, al noroeste. ¡Prende fuego a esas barricadas! Las encontrarás a lo largo del camino que va desde aquí hasta Moria.'","'Has matado a muchos orcos, pero sus campamentos en Nanduhirion siguen siendo un peligro para quienes se ven obligados a recorrer el camino entre aquí y Moria. Los orcos han levantado barricadas fuera de sus puestos a lo largo de la carretera.\
\
'Prende fuego a esas barricadas, ${PLAYER}, y quizá podamos convencer a los orcos de regresar a sus viles madrigueras bajo las montañas.\
\
'Encontrarás barricadas al noroeste, fuera de los campamentos de Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh y Athmadhul, a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion.'","Prende fuego a las barricadas orcas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Hadroneth","'¡Muy bien, ${PLAYER}! Prender fuego a sus barricadas hará que incluso el orco más torpe entienda que no es bienvenido en Nanduhirion, tan cerca de Lórien. Has hecho un buen trabajo.'","Hadroneth está preocupado por los campamentos de orcos que se han establecido en Nanduhirion y quiere que destruyas las barricadas levantadas fuera de ellos.","Encontrarás barricadas al noroeste de Talan Haldir, fuera de los campamentos orcos de Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh y Athmadhul, a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion.\
\
Hadroneth te ha pedido que debilites la permanencia de los campamentos orcos en Nanduhirion quemando las barricadas que levantan fuera de ellos.","Demasiado cerca de Lórien"},
[13752]={"You do not see anything unusual here...","'It is comforting to know that they are not on our doorstep today, but I still fear for what the future holds.\
\
'You have done me a great service, ${PLAYER}, as simple as it may have been.\
\
'Wait... what is that?'","Ost Lontir can be found in central Belfalas.\
\
Mildir has asked you to search outside for signs of Corsairs approaching Ost Lontir.","The haystack can be found behind Mildir in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas.\
\
You have reported to Mildir, but now have heard a suspicious noise coming from a nearby haystack. You should investigate the haystack.","Talk to Mildir","Search the overlook to the west of Ost Lontir","'I do not think we are safe here, ${PLAYER}. Corsairs have been spreading through our lands like a great blight.\
\
'Maybe the guards think it is amusing to have a drunk Corsair right outside our walls, but I do not! They are planning something for Ost Lontir, I just know it.\
\
'If you could search the overlooks to the east and west of town for any sign of the Corsairs, I would be grateful... and maybe I could actually sleep tonight.'","Too Far From Safety","Behind Mildir, you suddenly hear a haystack sneeze","Examine the haystack","DNT -- will not be seen","Mildir can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas.\
\
You have searched outside Ost Lontir and found little evidence of an impending Corsair attack.","Mildir can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas.\
\
You have found a small child in the haystack, much to Mildir's obvious dismay. You should talk to Mildir.","'Confound that child! If he were a Corsair I would have... Bah!\
\
'You have done enough for me, ${PLAYER}. If children are to be the worst of my problems, I shall count myself lucky!'","Aside from a view into the bay, nothing catches your eye...","Suddenly, a small, laughing child leaps out of the haystack and runs away","Search the overlook to the east of Ost Lontir","Mildir laments the grim future that might await the people of Ost Lontir and grows increasingly paranoid that the town will fall in the coming days."},
[13753]={"The fishing-nets can be found along the river-banks of northern Thinglad.\
\
You should destroy the fishing-nets without letting the fishermen from Stangard see what you are doing.","'Ah, you have returned without alerting the Rohirrim of our presence? That is good. I think we will be convincing them to leave by reinforcing their own superstitions of these lands.\
\
'Well done, ${PLAYER}.'","Too Far Upriver","'Return here when you have destroyed the fishing-nets, ${PLAYER}. Do try not to be seen!'","Destroyed fishing-nets without being seen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Men of Stangard once stayed clear of these lands. They must be truly desperate if they have come so far north into woods haunted by the Elves of Lórien -- Dwimordene, as the Men of Rohan name our lands. Such insults shall not be borne by trespassers.\
\
'We would rather remain hidden so that they do not see how few we are in number, so this must be done carefully. Let us begin by destroying those fishing-nets, for trapping is not permitted in Thinglad.\
\
'Avoid being seen, if you may. I will return to my people at Haldirith... meet me there when you have completed this task.'","Destroy fishing-nets without being seen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Noriel, who has joined her folk at Haldirith","Noriel has returned to Haldirith and awaits you there.\
\
You should return to Noriel and inform her that you have destroyed the forbidden fishing-nets laid out by the trespassers from Stangard.","Fishermen from Stangard seem to have moved too far upriver to spread their nets. They should be encouraged to return to their own lands, if possible."},
[13754]={"The Riders Four are in Edoras.\
\
Burnoth asked you aid him and his Riders as they prepare to depart Edoras.","Burnoth is in Edoras.\
\
You should return to Burnoth and give him the supplies he requested.","Complete Shoes for the Horses","Collect meat","'Are the preparations complete? We must ride at once if we are to overtake Théoden King's army!'","Vendajes recogidos","Completed Shoes for the Horses","Too Late","Recolectar vendajes","Collect medicine","The Riders Four, delayed in their journey from Eaworth, arrived at Edoras too late to join Théoden's muster and now prepare to follow behind.","Collected water","Collected vegetables","Bring the supplies you collected to Burnoth","Complete Arrows for Hutha","Burnoth is in Edoras.\
\
You should return to Burnoth and let him know that you have done as he has asked.","Collect vegetables","Completed Armour from the Smith","Talk to Burnoth","Collect water","'Are you certain that you collected all of the supplies I requested?'","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, I see that you arrived before us. We were delayed as we rode from Entwash Vale; however, that may prove a boon. Had we delivered our warning regarding the Easterlings in the north, Théoden King may have been distracted from the greater threat: Saruman.\
\
'We understand that he has ridden forth to the Fords of Isen...we make ready to follow behind. Would you aid us in our preparations? There is little time, and much to do. We need provisions and medicine for the journey...would you seek these things throughout the city and bring them here to me? We need dried meat, vegetables, water, medicine, and bandages.'","Collected medicine","'Our preparations are complete, thanks to you. Will you come with us to the Fords?\
\
'Ah, but nay...you have your own tasks to be about...perhaps we will meet again, provided we survive the confrontation with Saruman.\
\
'Farewell, friend ${PLAYER}!'","Collected meat","Completed Arrows for Hutha","Complete Armour from the Smith","'Aye, this will do, my friend. There is still much to be done, however. You should speak with Hutha, Ulf, and Léofdag and see what tasks they might have for you.'","Hutha, Ulf, and Léofdag are in Edoras.\
\
Burnoth asked you to help his Riders complete their preparations as well."},
[13755]={"'You have taken care of the arid sand-flies and brought me what remains of them? Yes, this collection will do; combined with the coins you brought, this will cover the cost of the remedy you sought.\
\
'Bring this remedy back to your friends and their flea-bites will become only an itchy memory.'","Talk to Shêsha","'Bring that remedy back to your friends and their flea-bites will become only an itchy memory.'","Bring the bug parts to Aphila near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven","Talk to Yosarin at the Baths of Kadax in the Lower Ward","Bring the foul-smelling unguent to Shêsha in the Lower Ward","The Baths of Kadax are located to the north-east in the Lower Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Bring the bag of coins to Aphila in the Fisherfold","'I cannot allow fleas inside the Baths of Kadax! What are you trying to do to our reputation here? Go back to your friend and tell her to keep Rûmina well away from our waters!'","Shêsha is to the south-west of the Baths of Kadax, in the Lower Ward.","'You mentioned the fleas? Why did you do that? I thought we had an understanding!\
\
'Ah, well, I need to do something before Rûmina's fleas spread throughout the whole city! There is a merchant of unguents near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven named Aphila. Take this bag of coins and see if she has a remedy of some sort that will cure Rûmina of her tiny, biting friends.'","'You have a remedy for our fleas? Did you hear that, Rûmina? Our new friend has performed a great service for us!'\
\
Rûmina sleeps on, unconcerned, and Shêsha gives her a contented scratch.\
\
'You have her thanks and mine, friend! Now there will be at least one part of the Lower Ward that is not a home for fleas!'","Collect bug parts from arid sand-flies outside the city (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The bug parts requested by Aphila can be found from arid sand-flies outside Umbar Baharbêl.","'I need to do something before Rûmina's fleas spread throughout the whole city! There is a merchant of unguents near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven named Aphila. See if she has a remedy of some sort that will cure Rûmina of her tiny, biting friends.'","'I do make a remedy for fleas, but this bag of coins is not enough to cover the cost. I will give it to you if you collect some ingredients for me. Are you willing to do this?\
\
'I require an array of parts from the arid sand-flies that gather outside the city, by the rocks that block passage further to the east. They often harry travellers to Umbar Baharbêl, so collecting parts from them will aid both me and those who venture to our fair city.'","'All are welcome at the Baths of Kadax, of course. What did you say were the names of your friends? Shêsha and Rûmina?'\
\
Yosarin's eyes narrow.\
\
'Rûmina? Not the same Rûmina that sailed with the Corsair Jeduth? She was a fine black ship-cat, as I remember, but she always had a problem with fleas, as I recall. Jeduth has now retired from that life... has Rûmina chosen a life on land as well?'\
\
You are forced to admit that she is thinking of the same Rûmina.\
\
'I cannot allow fleas inside the Baths of Kadax! What are you trying to do to our reputation here? Go back to your friend and tell her to keep Rûmina well away from our waters!'","Aphila is near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven.","'Could you go to the Baths of Kadax to the north-east and ask Yosarin, the Keeper of the Baths, if I might allow her to douse herself in the water? That might cause her troublesome friends to leave us alone.'","Shêsha has adopted a new friend, but her new friend also has old friends.","Shêsha is to the south, in the Lower Ward.","'You have returned to Rûmina and me! Oh... perhaps you should keep your distance. You see, it turns out my new friend Rûmina also has some old friends who have come along for the ride. Fleas, my friend, fleas!\
\
'Could you go to the Baths of Kadax to the north-east and ask Yosarin, the Keeper of the Baths, if I might allow her to douse herself in the water? That might cause her troublesome friends to leave us alone.'","Collected bug parts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I require an array of parts from the arid sand-flies that gather outside the city, by the rocks that block passage further to the east. They often harry travellers to Umbar Baharbêl, so collecting parts from them will aid both me and those who venture to our fair city.'","Aphila is located near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven, waiting for you to return with the bug parts you collected.","Too Many Friends"},
[13756]={"Defeated spiders in the Tower of Cirith Ungol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Spiders can be found lurking in the shadows of the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Lúksu has asked you to slay the small spiders that have snuck into the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","As Lúksu asked, you have defeated many of the small spiders that snuck into the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","Too Many Legs","You have defeated many of the small spiders that made their way into the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","Defeat spiders in the Tower of Cirith Ungol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","'Nar, not again! Can you hear them, Silent One?'\
\
You shrug.\
\
'Damned, little spiders skittering about in the tower! I found a few of 'em in the pot earlier, and I'm not going to cook while they're crawling about!\
\
'Find those little biters and get rid of them, will you?'","Annoyed that they've begun to steal Orkish food, Lúksu has asked you to slay small spiders that have snuck into the Tower of Cirith Ungol."},
[13758]={"¡Demasiadas Tortugas Terribles!","Regresa con Gwendrian","'Normalmente soy reacio a dañar a la fauna, pero las tortugas aterradoras de Gwâl Cruban se han reproducido en exceso y están agotando los recursos locales. Si reduces su número, te recompensaré.'","Tortugas aterradoras derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las ruinas de Gwâl Cruban están infestadas de tortugas feroces.","Derrota tortugas aterradoras en Gwâl Cruban (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gwendrian te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de tortugas en Gwâl Cruban.\
\
Gwâl Cruban se encuentra en el norte de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","'Te agradezco que te hayas ocupado de esta tarea. No es poca cosa derrotar a una tortuga aterradora. ¡Tienes mi agradecimiento!'","Deberías avisarle a Gwendrian que has reducido la cantidad de tortugas aterradoras en Gwâl Cruban.\
\
Gwendrian se encuentra en Echad Terthas."},
[13759]={"'Oh, hola, tienes pinta de ser alguien servicial. ¡Quizá podrías ayudarme con un pequeño problema que tengo! He estado disfrutando tanto del festival que parece que he extraviado algunas de las cosas que traía conmigo.\
\
'¿Podrías encontrarlas por mí? El concurso de baile está a punto de empezar y debo marcharme. ¡Aquí tienes la lista de los objetos que me faltan!'","'¿Ya has encontrado mis cosas perdidas? ¡Las necesito de verdad! Por favor, mira la lista que te di para recordar cuáles son.'","Objeto encontrado (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Dedalera Tunelero ha extraviado algunos objetos mientras celebraba el Festival del Lithe.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","'¿Has encontrado alguna de mis cosas perdidas, ${PLAYER}? ¡Estoy desesperada!'","Demasiado festival","Una vez encontrados todos sus objetos, regresa con Dedalera Tunelero al Árbol de la Fiesta, en la Comarca.","Encuentra todos los objetos (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'¡Los has encontrado! ¡Sabía que lo conseguirías! ¡Te dije que tenías pinta de ser una persona servicial! Muchas gracias.\
\
'Con mucho gusto te recompensaré con una moneda del festival. ¡Disfruta de los juegos de verano!'","Dedalera Tunelero te ha dado una lista de los objetos que ha perdido para que recuerdes exactamente cuáles son. Dedalera puede encontrarse cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta, en la Comarca.\
\
Dedalera Tunelero quiere que encuentres los objetos que ha extraviado. Sabe que los dejó en algún lugar de la Comarca, pero no recuerda dónde.","Devuelve los cinco objetos a Dedalera Tunelero"},
[13760]={"'¡Oh! ¡Hola de nuevo! Me alegra mucho verte y debo contarte mi historia. Ese carro en el que me escondí se detuvo allí, en la carretera de Cepeda, y me escabullí. Algunos Hombres Grandes vinieron y se llevaron el tabaco de pipa, así que los seguí. Cerca del granero del viejo Odo, pusieron el tabaco de pipa en otro carro, y yo también me escabullí en ese. ¡Qué error! Ese viajó durante días y días hasta que finalmente llegamos a una torre horrible.\
\
'Me escabullí del carro antes de que lo descargaran en las puertas de la torre, y me escondí de nuevo. Pronto llegó un hombre terrible vestido con una túnica. Algunos de los rufianes lo llamaban Zarquino. ¡Su voz era tan aterradora! Incluso los Gente Grande parecían tenerle miedo. Les ordenó que regresaran aquí, así que me escondí en el carro una vez más.\
\
'La verdadera ironía es que una vez que volvimos a la Comarca, esos hombres me vieron y me encerraron. ¿No es una historia bastante curiosa? Aunque esos hombres daban miedo, creo que ese hombre con túnica es más problemático. Creo que el Thain debería saber esto. ¿Te importaría decírselo? ¡He terminado con los viajes por un buen rato!'","'Ese tal Zarquino era terrible y aterrador... aunque debo decir que me recordó un poco a ese Gandalf que solía ir a Bolsón Cerrado.'","'No creerías la historia de Gerebert. Parece que al esconderse a bordo del carro de Longo, fue mucho más lejos de lo que nadie habría esperado. Simplemente debes hablar con él. El pobre está dentro de mi casa, temblando de miedo.'","'¿Qué te dije sobre la historia de Gerebert? Fantástica, ¿no es así?\
\
'Pero estoy de acuerdo con él. Creo que deberías contarle la historia al Thain. Deberías encontrarlo en los Grandes Smials. Esos Hombres en la Comarca parecen un mal asunto.'","'¡Oh, gracias por haber encontrado a mi primo Gerebert...! ¡Tenía tanto miedo de que se perdiera la cena!'","Un Tuk y una torre","'Esa es una historia bastante curiosa la que le has contado a Gerebert. Un poco fantasiosa, pero merece la pena investigarla.'","'Entra en la casa. Gerebert te está esperando allí. Simplemente debes escuchar su historia. ¡No lo vas a creer!'","'¡Gracias por rescatarme! ¡Tenía miedo de que esos Hombres me mataran!'","'Esa es una historia bastante curiosa la que nos cuentas, ${PLAYER}: Gente Grande en la Comarca y un tipo con túnica y voz autoritaria. ¡Estos son días realmente extraños!\
\
'Creo que voy a mantener un ojo en ese Longo Madriguera y sus amigos entre los Gente Grande. Probablemente podríamos expulsarlos, pero me gustaría vigilarlos durante un tiempo y quizás aprender más sobre ese Zarquino que vio Gerebert.\
\
'Quizás en el futuro vuelva a necesitarte, pero por ahora, tienes mis gracias y ningún otro deseo.'","'Creo que su historia fue bastante emocionante... aunque no estoy seguro de que realmente la crea.'","'Parece que he oído el nombre de Zarquino recientemente en algún lugar. Haré que la Guardia investigue la presencia de estos Hombres.'","Paladin Tuk, el Thain, se encuentra en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Esilia Tuk te envió a su casa para hablar con su primo, Gerebert. Gerebert te contó una historia fantástica sobre una terrible torre en tierras lejanas, donde vio a un extraño hombre con túnica llamado Zarquino. Te pidió que contaras su historia al Thain.","'Mis gracias de nuevo por rescatarme. No puedo creer todo lo que ha pasado, y para ser honesto, me parece tan extraño estar de vuelta en la seguridad de la Comarca otra vez.\
\
'Aunque, con esos Hombres merodeando y ese tal Zarquino, creo que podría no ser tan seguro como pensaba. ¿Podrías contarle mi historia al Thain? Debería saber de estos peligros.'","Esilia Tuk te dijo que Gerebert finalmente llegó a su casa y contó una historia fantástica sobre su viaje a bordo del carro de Longo.","Gerebert Tuk está dentro de la casa de Esilia.\
\
Esilia Tuk te agradeció que hubieras rescatado a su primo y te dijo que Gerebert contó una historia asombrosa. Te recomendó que entraras y hablaras con él tú ${PLAYERNAME:mismo[m]|misma[f]}."},
[13762]={"Herramientas del pasado","Herramientas de enanos recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recupera herramientas de los enanos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las forjas de Khazad-dûm fueron en su día el corazón herrero en Moria. Allí, los inigualables herreros enanos trabajaban el mithril y forjaban sus mayores maravillas. Desde su caída, las forjas de Khazad-dûm se han visto inundadas por enormes aludes de lava y pobladas por los orcos de Moria y sus trols y trasgos. Allí, el ejército orco trabaja sin cesar, construyendo armas y máquinas de asedio en preparación para la guerra contra Lothlórien.","'Te diré esto, ${PLAYER}, hay destinos peores que la muerte. Para las herramientas de los enanos, uno de esos destinos es estar en manos de un orco, y eso es precisamente lo que ocurre en las forjas de Khazad-dûm. Si no hubiera visto las herramientas con mis propios ojos, no lo creería... ¡pero las vi apoyadas contra el yunque mientras ese Uruk forjaba!\
\
'Esto es incomprensible para mis pobres ojos. No lo toleraré. Necesito que recuperes las herramientas enanas de las forjas de Khazad-dûm. Las reconocerás, ya que descansan contra los yunques orcos por toda la forja. Recógelas y tráemelas.\
\
'Puedes encontrar las forjas de Khazad-dûm al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.'","'Una cosa es ser destruido, y otra muy distinta ser blandido por un orco. No lo permitiré. Recupera las herramientas enanas que los orcos están usando en las forjas de Khazad-dûm y devuélvemelas.\
\
'Las forjas se encuentran al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.'","Las forjas de Khazad-dûm se encuentran al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Sigir está indignado de que se utilicen herramientas enanas para forjar las armas de guerra de los orcos. Te encomendó la misión de rescatar dichas herramientas de su ignominioso destino dentro de las forjas de Khazad-dûm.","'Ya está, pequeño martillo y tornillo de banco. Os hemos acompañado a casa sanos y salvos. Bueno, ${PLAYER} al menos.\
\
'Tienes mi bendición, ${PLAYER:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}, y me aseguraré de informar a Pálmar. Gracias por todo lo que has hecho.'","Habla con Sigir en Anazârmekhem"},
[13764]={"Recoge Picas de Orco en Ongbishúk(${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge Sierras de Orco en Ongbishúk(${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sierras de Orco recogidas en Ongbishúk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Herramientas de los Orcos","'Buen trabajo, ${CLASS}. Lo has hecho bien. Me aseguraré de que estas herramientas sean fundidas. Al menos su metal nos servirá.\
\
'Lamentablemente, parece que te envié demasiado tarde para frustrar los planes de los Orcos. He descubierto que estaban más avanzados de lo que pensaba.'","El campamento orco de Ongbishúk se encuentra al noreste de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Avar te pidió que tomes las herramientas de los Orcos para ayudar a frenar sus esfuerzos por construir armas de asedio.","Hachas de Orco recogidas en Ongbishúk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge Hachas de Orco en Ongbishúk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Avar, el líder del puesto enano en Gabilshathûr, te habló de su situación desesperada. Los Orcos han descubierto su refugio oculto y están talando árboles al norte. Avar teme que estén usando la madera para construir armas de asedio, con las que podrían atacar y destruir el puesto.","'Hemos tenido suerte de que hayas llegado cuando lo hiciste. Nos hemos ocultado bajo la sombra de Angmar por tanto tiempo, pero ahora hemos sido descubiertos. Un explorador orco se coló en nuestros salones hace unos días y escapó antes de que pudiéramos matarlo. Ahora los Orcos nos atacan con regularidad, y si mis sospechas son ciertas, esto solo empeorará.\
\
'Uno de mis enanos regresó y nos dijo que los Orcos están talando árboles al norte de aquí, y eso solo puede significar una cosa: están fabricando armas de asedio para atacarnos. ¡Debemos ralentizar o detener su trabajo!\
\
'Si deseas ayudarnos, ve a Ongbishúk, al norte de aquí, y derrota a los Orcos que encuentres. Recolecta sus herramientas, como hachas, picos y sierras, y tráelas aquí.'","Lleva las herramientas de los Orcos a Avar.","Picas de Orco recogidas en Ongbishúk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Debemos ralentizar a los Orcos, ${PLAYER}! Ve al campamento orco de Ongbishúk y recolecta sus herramientas. ¡Sin ellas, no podrán talar los árboles que necesitan para sus armas!"},
[13766]={"Dientes de salamandra recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Las salamandres ya no son una amenaza tan grande como antes.'","A Mundarico Hojarena le preocupan las salamandras que se arrastran entre las dunas de Barandalf.","Mundarico Hojarena está en Dwaling.\
\
Has recogido los dientes que te pidió Mundarico Hojarena y has mermado la población de las salamandras letales que hacen peligrosas las arenas de Barandalf. Ahora deberías volver a él para que pueda estudiar los dientes.","Recoge dientes de salamandra (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿No tienes los dientes que te pedí que me trajeras? Sin ellos no aprenderemos nada.'","'Utilizamos las escamas de salamandra como material para moler y hacer cristal, y por eso son importantes para nosotros. Pero desde que Dwaling se ha llenado de la gente grande, no nos hemos centrado tanto en reunir materiales como antes.\
\
'Esto ha provocado que las salamandras campen a sus anchas. Están empezando a alcanzar una cantidad que no podemos controlar, y me temo que cualquier hobbit que se aventure en las dunas pueda ser víctima de una de ellas. Mientras estés por ahí, derrota a algunas y recoge sus dientes. Quizás podamos encontrar una forma de fabricar ropa que resista mejor los cortes.\
\
'Ten cuidado, ${PLAYER}. Las salamandras pueden ser despiadadas si no estás preparado.'","Llévale los dientes a Mundarico Hojarena","Las salamandras se deslizan entre las dunas y arenas de Barandalf, al norte y al este de Dwaling.\
\
Mundarico Hojarena quiere que derrotes a las salamandras en Barandalf y le lleves sus dientes incrustados de arena.","'Tus esfuerzos han hecho que Barandalf sea más seguro, ${PLAYER}, y te lo agradezco.'","Diente y escama","'Las salamandras se deslizan entre las dunas de Barandalf, al norte y al este de aquí. Derrota a las criaturas y tráeme sus dientes.'","'Son de lo más impresionantes, ${PLAYER}: ¡los dientes están afilados, desde luego! Recibe mi agradecimiento con la certeza de que has hecho que Barandalf sea más seguro para todos nosotros, los hobbits.'"},
[13767]={"The pack-leader of the Isen Wargs, a beast named Mangle-maw leads den-mates when they raid in the night. His death would trigger a battle for dominance among the pack that could cause many more casualties before a new leader arises.","'Have you dealt with Mangle-maw yet?'","You have defeated Mangle-maw","You must remain within the Circle of Fangs","'The lord of this pack of mongrels is called Mangle-maw. He is as terrible as they come, but you will not be able to get close to him without the rest of the pack tearing you apart...unless you can challenge him, that is.\
\
'Wargs always choose their pack-leaders in battle and usually have some place where they issue challenges to each other until enough of them have been ripped apart that the rest are too frightened to fight the one on top.\
\
'No ranking Warg can refuse a challenge, so if you step in there, they will fight by tradition...beat enough of them, and Mangle-maw will no doubt face you.'","Top Dog","'I don't suppose that Wargs would ever accept you as their pack-leader, but you have thrown the pack into chaos by killing Mangle-maw.\
\
'They will spend days tearing at each other until they figure out who the new pack-leader will be.'","Ondor is encamped near the caves of western Nan Curunír.\
\
You should tell Ondor of Mangle-maw's defeat in the Circle of Fangs.","The Circle of Fangs lies outside the caves in western Nan Curunír.\
\
Ondor has asked you to defeat the Warg pack-leader, Mangle-maw. Defeating a number of lieutenants in the Circle of Fangs may draw him forth.","Defeat Mangle-maw within the Circle of Fangs","Talk to Ondor in Nan Curunír"},
[13770]={"'Así que, después de ocuparse primero de todos los demás problemas que pudieron encontrar, finalmente me envían ayuda. Más vale tarde que nunca, supongo.'","El deber de Torogethir","Torogethir vigila el paso desde las Quebradas del Norte hacia Evendim y custodia las fortalezas de Fornost y Ost Heryn.","Habla con Torogethir en Parth Aduial","'Torogethir lleva mucho tiempo velando por Ost Heryn. Conoce bien su historia y sus secretos'.","El campamento de Torogethir se encuentra junto al camino que lleva a las Quebradas del Norte, al este de Tinnudir y al norte de Ost Heryn.\
\
Orchalwë te pidió que encontraras a Torogethir y le ayudaras en sus esfuerzos por resolver los problemas a los que se enfrenta Ost Heryn.","'Las propiedades están de nuevo bajo control y, aunque aún queda mucho por hacer en ellas, es un trabajo que podemos llevar a cabo nosotros mismos con el tiempo. Sin embargo, los Campos del Crepúsculo aún no son seguros. Todavía queda Ost Heryn.\
\
'Torogethir se encarga de vigilar esta fortaleza en ruinas y, aunque ha podido hacer algo para evitar que los problemas allí aumenten, no ha tenido tiempo ni apoyo para resolverlos.\
\
'Sigue la carretera hacia el este, en dirección a las Quebradas del Norte. Encontrarás a Torogethir en una pequeña colina al norte del camino, sobre las ruinas de Ost Heryn.'"},
[13771]={"Talk to Sidnoth","Bring the evidence to Torferth at Tordag's camp","Found evidence of another traitor (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The belongings of the Toringas and their allies can be found throughout Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
Thane Torferth asked you to search the belongings of the Toringas and their allies for evidence of another traitor.","'Have you found nothing yet?'","'Thane Tordag sheltered my folk when the Dunlendings came to Woodhurst, despite the counsel of Tidric and his own reservations regarding any who are not pure of blood...and yet it was one of my folk who betrayed him.\
\
'I can understand the young thane's suspicions, and we will willingly consent to whatever questions or searches he deems necessary to allay his suspicions.\
\
'Alas, I cannot say much more about Frithmund. I confess that he was little more than a casual acquaintance in Woodhurst, and I did not know him well.'","'Alas, I know not what to make of these things.\
\
'The knife could easily belong to any of the folk from Woodhurst, for many of them bear the blood of both Rohan and Dunland. The note can be read many ways; some suspicious, some not. The Falcon-clan badge is incriminating, but could just as likely be a trophy from the battle. The necklace could be just that, though its design is not familiar to me.\
\
'The letter piques my suspicion the most, for it is signed with an \\qS\\q which could stand for Saruman and reads strangely, but it is also in a hand not well-trained in letters. I will have to think upon these things.'","'The people of Torsbury loved their thane...I can think of none among us who would even consider betraying him! It was one of those Woodhurst mongrels what killed him...you should be questioning them instead.\
\
'We are Thane Torferth's people and will submit to his will, but it is an insult! We have fought and bled with him.\
\
'Do what you must and leave me be.'","The captains of the Toringas and their allies may be found at Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
Torferth has asked you to confront the captains of the Toringas and their allies and obtain their permission to search their belongings for evidence of treason.","Find evidence of another traitor (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Talk to Tidric","Talk to Dudsig","Talk to Wilsig","'Bah! Does the boy's hatred of all who do not bear the pure blood of Rohan run so deep that he would cast aspersions upon us all? It is an insult, not only to me, but to my thane who sent me! We came to aid Torsbury, and now he seeks hostilities?\
\
'Nevertheless, Torferth is now Thane of Torsbury, and these are his forsaken lands. I will submit...but you may inform him that I will be bringing my grievances to Thane Ordlac and Reeve Fríthild.\
\
'I have brought no possessions of my own, save what you see upon my person, but you have my leave -- with objection -- to search my tent and those of my men.'","'${PLAYER}, you find me in a terrible state. I wish to grieve my loss, yet I am now Thane and cannot afford that privilege. I suspect that there is more behind my father's murder than a single traitorous coward. From what I have learned, Frithmund was not a clever man...it is doubtful that he crafted the trap himself.\
\
'I confess I have become suspicious of everyone around me, but you. You are new to Torsbury, and the one who masterminded this plan had to already know somewhat of my father's ways.\
\
'Will you speak with my captains and our allies? You may learn something from them that they might not be willing to share with me. I would also have you obtain their permission to search their belongings...it is the nature of evil to unwittingly leave signs of its actions.'","Thane Torferth is in Tordag's camp, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
You should bring the evidence you found to Torferth for his review.","With the defeat at Torsbury and the death of Thane Tordag, Torferth and his people regroup at Tordag's camp.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Torsbury Defeated","'I have ever been a faithful servant to Thane Tordag, and it is an insult to be treated with the same suspicion as the half-blood rabble! However, I cannot fault Torferth for his blind suspicion...he has just lost his father and become Thane of Torsbury in one evil stroke.\
\
'My men and I will submit to whatever searches and inquiries Thane Torferth demands of us...and we will be found innocent, one and all.\
\
'Alas, I warned Thane Tordag not to admit the folk from Woodhurst. The half-bloods cannot be trusted. You should look more closely into their number...or even that captain from Oserley.'"},
[13772]={"The people of Torsbury are shattered by the loss of their Thane, and Torferth is consumed with discovering the mastermind of his father's murder.","Talk to Reeve Fríthild in the Mead Hall of Stoke","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke, south-east of Tordag's camp.\
\
Torferth instructed you to return to Reeve Fríthild and let her know that the Torsbury garrison will be late coming.","Torsbury Delayed","'Reeve Fríthild was wise in choosing you to bring her summons. Alas, however, my people cannot come yet to Stoke. We are worn from our battle and from the grief of loss, but as well I must learn who the true mind behind my father's death is.\
\
'You should return to Stoke at once. The Reeve will need your doughty arm in the time ahead. Let her know that we will come as soon as we may.\
\
'I must thank you again, as well, for bringing me Lúfa's favour. My heart remains broken, for I know we shall never meet again under favourable circumstances, but the blow is softened somewhat to know that her heart remains mine.'","'Welcome back, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'You say that Tordag is dead, slain by treason, and the Toringas shall come late to our defence? That is ill news, indeed, but at least we have the consolation that Ordlac has brought nearly his full garrison in good time!'"},
[13773]={"Torso de Helgi Cazatrasgos","Se trata de un fragmento del torso de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos que una vez se erigió frente a la Cámara de la Encrucijada.\
\
Los trasgos del Camino de Durin destruyeron la estatua, y sus partes se pueden encontrar dispersas por toda Moria. Un enano llamado Uxi se esfuerza por reensamblar esta estatua.","Has descubierto el torso de la estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos.","Habla con Águti en la Bodega Putrefacta","'¡He oído hablar del esfuerzo del enano Uxi por reconstruir la gran estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos! ¿Así que el torso de la estatua estuvo a punto de perderse en las profundidades inundadas? Me alegra que hayas venido cuando lo hiciste.\
\
'Parece que el agua sube a diario. Antes de mucho, la estatua podría haberse perdido para siempre. Enviaré este fragmento a la Cámara de la Encrucijada.'","Águti se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, al norte.\
\
Águti querrá saber si encontraste un fragmento de la estatua destrozada."},
[13774]={"Toss a coin to the journeyman lutist","Toss a coin to a noisy minstrel (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'You there! You look like you didn’t spend last night with as much ale as some of us. Do me a favour, and I’ll make it worth your while.\
\
'My name is Ulthir, greatest florist in all the land. I’m sure you’ve heard of me? No? Well, no accounting for taste, is there. By the by, wedding season is the most important time of year for a flower monger like myself. I labour for months growing, harvesting, and transporting my renowned blossoms and arrangements from my farm to various cities. This week I have the misfortune of being stuck in this smouldering pile of rocks. Mmmf, my head.\
\
'Where was I? Oh yes, I seem to have imbibed a bit more than I am accustomed to last evening. Ah, don’t look at me like that! Do you have any inkling how difficult it is to keep roses fresh from my farm to here?! The stress nearly eats you alive! I've probably gone down an entire tunic size! So I might have had more than I should have to drink. What do you care? You’re not my wife! Wait, you’re not my wife, are you?'\
\
The merchant squints up at you with bleary eyes.\
\
'No, no you aren’t. Right, listen. You help me out and I’ll make it worth your while!\
\
'You hear that ruckus? Someone in this tavern fancies themselves a bard, but a croaking frog has more melody than that cacophony. Here, take these coins and toss them to whoever that dreadful squalling is coming from. I need at least ten more hours of sleep and they aren’t helping in the slightest.'","Toss a coin to the bodhran minstrel","The famous flower peddler Ulthir is regretting the festivities of the night before.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Talk to Ulthir","Toss a coin to the journeywoman lutist","Noisy minstrels wander about the Splintered Shield, keeping Ulthir awake.\
\
You should toss a coin to noisy minstrels in the Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith.","'Ahhh, my friend. Do you hear that? Blessed silence.\
\
'I'm stuck here all week. Why don’t you come back tomorrow, just in case… more ale happens?'","Ulthir is trying to sleep it off in the bedchambers of the Splintered Shield.\
\
You should inform Ulthir that you've made the minstrels move on.","'I still hear their infernal caterwaulings!'","Toss a Coin","Toss a coin at the adept harper","Tossed a coin to a noisy minstrel (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Toss a coin to the journeyman harper","Toss a coin to the adept flutist"},
[13775]={"Captain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Garmund awaits the results of your attempt to destroy the Orc symbols marking the precious farmlands beyond Cliving.","Orc-totems and banners can be found around the farmsteads south of Cliving and west of the road.\
\
Captain Garmund has asked you to destroy many of the banners and totems the Orcs have placed across their sacked territory.","Captain Garmund is distressed by the presence of the many Orc-banners and totems being strewn across the once-peaceful farmlands outside of Cliving.","Destroyed Orc-totems at the western farmlands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed Orc-banners at the western farmlands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hail, ${CLASS}. Take care as you travel in these lands. The vacant farms south-west of the city have fallen under the control of White Hand Orcs, their previous residents fleeing to Edoras or seeking sanctuary within the walls of Cliving.\
\
'The Orcs have taken it upon themselves to mark our lands with their various brands and symbols. It may not matter to most, but I cannot bear to see our homelands so crudely desecrated. If it is not much trouble, I request that any Orc-banners or totems that you come across be destroyed. I shall see that you are compensated generously for your efforts.'","Destroy Orc-banners at the western farmlands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Captain Garmund outside of Cliving","Totems and Banners","Destroy Orc-totems at the western farmlands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I suspect that seeing the banners and totems fall disturbs the Orc-invaders as greatly as it has disturbed me to see them erected on our land.\
\
'I praise your convictions, ${PLAYER}. Few have the bravery to risk undertaking such a task. I am pleased to reward you, as promised.'"},
[13776]={"Bolsas de veneno Ongbûrz recolectadas(${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolecta bolsas de veneno Ongbûrz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gandelin está de vuelta en Lin Giliath.\
\
Gandelin te pidió que mataras al profanador Ongbûrz y regresaras con las bolsas de veneno Ongbûrz.","'${PLAYER}, necesitamos algunas muestras del veneno de los orcos para poder crear un antídoto.'","'Llegará el momento en que debamos expulsar a los orcos de Kingsfell.'","Toque de corrupción","'Has debilitado mucho a los Ongbûrz, más que antes.'","'¿Todavía no has obtenido las bolsas de veneno que te pedí, ${PLAYER}?'","'Necesito tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Un orco profanador, experto en el uso de venenos, se unió a las filas de los Ongbûrz en el sur de Lin Giliath. Ha comenzado a envenenar las aguas de este claro, y todo quedará arruinado.\
\
'Mata a los orcos en Merenost y recolecta sus bolsas de veneno. Me aseguraré de que nunca más se usen con fines malignos.\
\
'Mientras estés en el campamento, pon fin a la fuente del vil veneno de una vez por todas matando al profanador Ongbûrz. Ten cuidado, ${PLAYER}: estos orcos son brutales y despiadados, y puede que necesites aliados.'","Lleva las bolsas de veneno Ongbûrz a Gandelin","Los orcos Ongbûrz se encuentran en las ruinas de Merenost, en el sur de Lin Giliath.\
\
Gandelin te pidió que mataras al profanador Ongbûrz y regresaras con las bolsas de veneno Ongbûrz.","'Las bolsas de veneno. ¿Supongo que también mataste al profanador? Muchas vidas se salvarán gracias a tus esfuerzos.\
\
'Me resulta extraño que los orcos cacen a sus aliados arañas. Se fortalecen a costa de otros....... y al final, debilitan al Enemigo en su conjunto. Así son las cosas malignas, pues las arañas no dudarían en beber la sangre de sus compañeros orcos.'","Los orcos de Merenos, en Meluinen, usan veneno de araña para bañar sus espadas y flechas"},
[13777]={"'No son buenas noticias. Solo sabíamos que esos orcos venían del noroeste. Llegaron una noche, incendiaron las ruinas y masacraron a nuestros hermanos que se encontraban allí.\
\
'Desde entonces, parecen estar interesados en el Gran Río al este y en los pantanos al sur. Dejan los pantanos del norte a los Muertos...\
\
'${PLAYER}, estás en casa de los Eglain. Te pedimos que trates con respeto a la gente y las tierras que te rodean.'","Frideric el Anciano se encuentra en Ost Guruth, al noreste de Refr Mercurio.\
\
Refr Mercurio está preocupado por la colaboración entre los orcos y los Duramano, y cree que se debe informar al líder de los Eglain sobre esta situación.","Los Duramano y los orcos están colaborando. Esta noticia no es bienvenida por Refr Mercurio, un enano que vive entre los Eglain de Ost Guruth.","'Por favor, dirígete hacia el este por la carretera y gira hacia el norte cuando veas el estanque que cubre unas ruinas. Hay que informar a Frideric el Anciano de este acontecimiento entre los orcos y los Duramano.'","Habla con Frideric el Anciano en Ost Guruth","Hacia los Eglain","'¿Los orcos están colaborando con los Duramano? Es una noticia terrible. Los orcos han llegado recientemente a estas tierras y han estado excavando en unas ruinas al este. Han matado a muchos Eglain y se han apoderado de otras ruinas que antes considerábamos nuestras.\
\
'¿Es posible que los Duramano les hayan ayudado? ${PLAYER}, ¿podrías dirigirte hacia el este?\
\
'A cierta distancia, encontrarás a Ost Guruth y al líder de los Eglain, Frideric el Anciano. Cuéntale esta noticia.'"},
[13778]={"Burned the Watch-tower Súth-torr","Picked up the torch","Tower An Inferno","'My fears were not unfounded; you found no trace of the men who stood guard at that tower. Igniting the tower drove away the fell beast and its Master, but I suspect they are still nearby.\
\
'The Nazgûl leads the Easterling assault, so this victory is short-lived, but we shall take any victories we can muster nowadays.'","Use a torch to burn the Watch-tower Súth-torr","The Easterlings have built a massive encampment on the bank of the Anduin river. This camp is growing at an alarming rate as more enemies flow down the river from the ford.","Return to Guthferth at North-torr","The fallen Rohirrim watch-tower is in the north-east corner of their large encampment of Jóshkhin Orda to the north of North-torr.\
\
You should search for a torch near the watch-tower and burn it to drive out the evil that dwells there.","Sergeant Guthferth is rallying the defences of North-torr just north of Floodwend, attempting to hold back the flood of Easterlings threatening to drown the Wold in chaos.\
\
You should speak with Sergeant Guthferth.","The note reads:\
\
'We have captured the tower Suth-torr from the horse-riding weaklings, and the dark one resides there now. The camp has been built, and it is from here that the attack upon Rohan shall be launched.\
\
'Complete production of the siege-weapons as soon as possible. Do not be late with them. They are instrumental in the siege.'"},
[13799]={"'Me has dejado asombrado, ${PLAYER}, y admiro tu capacidad para derrotar a los poderosos campeones de los gigantes.\
\
No tengo ninguna duda de que levantarán nuevos campeones contra nosotros, pero nos has comprado algo de tiempo, valiente ${RACE}, y por eso nosotros, los de Imladris, estamos agradecidos.'","Golhador está en el campamento del Risco Alto, en la parte central de las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Golhador estará encantado de saber que has derrotado a los poderosos campeones responsables de domar a los feroces mamuts.","'¡Los habitantes de Imladris te estamos en deuda, ${PLAYER}! ¡Los gigantes aprenderán a temer tu nombre!'","La Aguja del Gigante se encuentra en el corazón de la zona de las Montañas Nubladas conocida como los Salones de los Gigantes, al sureste de la fortaleza enana de Gabilazan.\
\
Madfurr está al este de la Aguja del Gigante, en una grieta de la roca. Sukdyr está al noreste de la Aguja del Gigante, entre los senderos rocosos. Kulgurz está en las laderas altas sobre la Aguja del Gigante.\
\
El Elfo Golhador te ha indicado dónde se encuentran los poderosos campeones gigantes responsables de domar a los feroces mamuts.","'Ha hecho falta que gigantes excepcionalmente poderosos domaran a los mamuts de las Montañas Nubladas. Si estos campeones son derrotados, no tendremos que temer la alianza entre gigantes y mamuts hasta que surjan nuevos campeones. Reúne a los aliados que puedas, porque estos campeones son realmente poderosos, incluso entre los ya temibles gigantes.\
\
'Los mamuts llevan las marcas de tres gigantes. Estos campeones nunca han tratado conmigo, pero conozco sus reputaciones. Madfurr es un maestro de la guerra sin armas y vive en el desfiladero al este de la Aguja del Gigante. Pocos se atreven a pasar cerca de las piedras que ha colocado para protegerse de los elementos. Otros gigantes están impresionados por la habilidad de Sukdyr con su gran garrote; búscalo en algún lugar de los senderos al noreste de la Aguja del Gigante, entre las grietas rocosas.\
\
'Kulgurz es el último, y sé menos de él que de los otros. ¡Cuidado con su habilidad desde lejos! Se dice que puede derribar a un poderoso uro con un solo lanzamiento desde una distancia de dos millas. Kulgurz camina por las laderas altas sobre la Aguja del Gigante, buscando problemas. Que la fortuna te sonría, ${PLAYER}. La necesitarás.\
\
'¿Ah, y la propia Aguja del Gigante? Es una aguja de roca negra natural en un pequeño valle en forma de cuenco. La encontrarás en el corazón de la zona de las Montañas Nubladas conocida como los Salones de los Gigantes, a cierta distancia al sureste de una antigua fortaleza enana llamada Gabilazan.'","'¡Tus hechos hablan por ti, ${PLAYER}, y su eco se oye por las montañas!'","Golhador ha identificado a los gigantes que tienen dominio sobre los mamuts de las Montañas Nubladas y te ha pedido que pongas fin a esta peligrosa alianza.","Gigantescos campeones","'Los grandes campeones de los gigantes eran poderosos adversarios, ${PLAYER}. Has demostrado tu fuerza.'","'¡He aquí a ${PLAYER}, que ha triunfado incluso sobre los poderosos campeones de los gigantes!'"},
[13801]={"While exploring The Towers of the Teeth, you notice some treasures from the lands of Rhûn.\
\
You take it upon yourself to collect samples of these Black Númenórean treasures for the Host of the West.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires The Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","'These artifacts are extremely interesting. While I do not know what powers they may hold or history they may tell, we should keep them until the battle is won. Perhaps a scholar from Minas Tirith would be able to study them.'","Collect Black Númenórean artifacts","Collect Black Númenórean artifacts within The Towers of the Teeth.","You should collect Black Númenórean artifacts and bring them to Candúr.","Collect Black Númenórean artifacts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected Black Númenórean artifacts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Towers of the Teeth: A Brush with Darkness","Bring the Black Númenórean artifacts to Candúr"},
[13802]={"'Indeed these are fine spoils of war. Someday, we may be glad to have them. We must keep focus on the task at hand for now, though.'","Bring the gifts of Rhûn to Thurindol","Collect gifts of Rhûn","Towers of the Teeth: A Brush with Death","Collected gifts of Rhûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect gifts of Rhûn within The Towers of the Teeth.","While exploring The Towers of the Teeth, you notice some treasures from the lands of Rhûn.\
\
You take it upon yourself to collect samples of these gifts of Rhûn treasures for the Host of the West.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>>","You should collect gifts of Rhûn and bring them to Thurindol.","Collect gifts of Rhûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","While exploring The Towers of the Teeth, you notice some treasures from the lands of Rhûn.\
\
You take it upon yourself to collect these gifts of Rhûn for the Host of the West.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>"},
[13803]={"'You have done well, friend. Your efforts will be duly noted!'","Defeat Uruk-hai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You should return to Thurindol and inform him of your deeds within The Towers of the Teeth.","Defeated Uruk-hai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Uruk-hai within The Towers of the Teeth.","Talk to Thurindol","Defeat Uruk-hai in The Towers of the Teeth","To weaken the resolve of the invaders within The Towers of the Teeth, you take it upon yourself to thin their numbers.","Towers of the Teeth: Depths of Shadow","Those who dwell in The Towers of the Teeth are numerous. Driving off even a fraction of their number will better position the Host of the West to travel safely through The Wastes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>"},
