\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Teeth to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Defeat Black Númenóreans in The Towers of the Teeth","'You have done well, friend. Your efforts will be duly noted!'","You should return to Candúr and inform him of your deeds within The Towers of the Teeth.","Defeat Black Númenóreans (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Candúr","Defeat Black Númenóreans within The Towers of the Teeth.","To weaken the resolve of the invaders within The Towers of the Teeth, you take it upon yourself to thin their numbers.","Those who dwell in The Towers of the Teeth are numerous. Driving off even a fraction of their number will better position the Host of the West to travel safely through The Wastes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Teeth to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Towers of the Teeth: Foundation of Shadow","Defeated Black Númenóreans (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13805]={"'You have done it? That is well. That Uruk captain was a true threat.'","Thurindol has asked you investigate the The Towers of the Teeth and find a way to discourage the invaders from remaining there.","You ran out of time...","Defeated Kúrgrush","'The time to attack is now!'","You should return to Thurindol and apprise him of your efforts.","Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Depths","Talk to Thurindol","'The time is right to strike those who dwell within Carchost and Narchost. Their captain, the Uruk they call Kúrgrush, was seen entering the base of Carchost. It can only mean that some serious business is afoot. We must defeat him quickly.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Uruk-hai, dwelling beneath the Towers of the Teeth, could prove a mighty foe if left unchecked.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time-limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeat Kúrgrush"},
[13806]={"You ran out of time...","'The time to attack is now!'","Towers of the Teeth: Guardian of the Teeth","Talk to Candúr","Defeat Gúrthrokh","You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","Defeated Gúrthrokh","'You have succeeded, have you? Good. I do not think we acted a moment too soon.'","Candúr has asked you investigate The Towers of the Teeth and find a way to discourage the invaders from remaining there.","Uruk-hai, dwelling beneath the Towers of the Teeth, could prove a mighty foe if left unchecked.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time-limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","'The time is right to strike those who dwell within Carchost and Narchost. Their leader, the Uruk they call Gúrthrokh, was seen entering the base of Carchost. It can only mean that some serious business is afoot. We must defeat him quickly.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>"},
[13813]={"Return to Vaskorn","Search for clues along the edge of the lake in Thornholt","You begin to tell Vaskorn all you have seen, when he interrupts.\
\
'More poisoned creatures? Poison weapons? Spider-folk? Slow down, you're talking too fast for this Beorning. There is no doubt, you had an eventful expedition!'","You should carry on Vaskorn's search, continuing on to the outskirts of Thornholt, heading north towards the Steel Keep.","Search for the wielders of the poison weapons","Search for clues in Óinsbridge","Traces of Poison","The Beorning Vaskorn has scouted much of Thornholt searching for clues to the mysterious poisoning.","Vaskorn can be found in the Beorning dwellings of Skoghús, in Thornholt.\
\
You should hurry back to Vaskorn and alert him to your findings.","You should carry on Vaskorn's search, continuing on to the edge of the lake in Thornholt.","It appears these creatures were defeated with a deadly poison","Defeated an attacker at Kêr Bréin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Much like the wizard Radagast, we have seen many animals sickened with a mysterious poison. I would swear it must be the work of spiders, and yet - no spiders! Everyone knows they are gone.\
\
'I have just returned from a wearying search for clues, and must rest or fall asleep standing. Would you visit the few locations I was unable to, ${CLASS}?'","Vaskorn has asked you to continue his search, beginning at Óinsbridge.","You should defeat the attackers at Kêr Bréin, on the north-western outskirts of Thornholt.","Even without the shade of trees, the darkness feels more oppressive here","Defeat the attackers at Kêr Bréin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","These weapons appear to have a poisonous substance on them"},
[13814]={"'Well done. The presence of the Gauredain in Evendim is disturbing, but knowing that neither Angmarim nor Orc yet occupies the far shores of the lake is a relief. Thank you for your efforts.'","Traces of the Enemy","Scouted Tollobel","Scout the Eave-mere","Scout Tollobel","Handarod is concerned for the safety of the Wardens of Annúminas, who struggle to secure the ruined home of their forebears.","The Eave-mere lies in Evendim, far to the west of the North Downs, on the western side of Lake Evendim.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the Eave-mere, a small lake that feeds down into the much larger Lake Evendim.","The Even-rills lie in Evendim, far to the west of the North Downs, on the northern end of Lake Evendim.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the area around the Even-rills, one of the two major sources of water coming into Lake Evendim from the north.","Scouted the Eave-mere","Talk to Handarod","'Greetings, ${PLAYER}. Urgent news has come to my attention, and I could use your aid.\
\
'Our bretheren in Evendim are preparing an offensive to break the foul occupation of Annúminas, but these preparations have left them with no scouts to spare in patrolling the far side of Lake Evendim -- that is where you come in.\
\
'Up until now, there has been little evidence of the Angmarim or their Orc-soldiers in that area of Evendim, but we need to know if they have constructed any outposts there, lest they catch the Wardens by surprise. I want you to scout the far side of the lake and make sure that there is no sign of the Angmarim there.'","Scouted the Even-rills","Scout the Even-rills","Tollobel lies in Evendim, far to the west of the North Downs, in the south-west reaches of Lake Evendim.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the island of Tollobel. It could make an ideal location for the Angmarim to strike from should their hold on the city of Annúminas be weakened.","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the east of Evendim.\
\
You should report to Handarod and tell him what you have found along the shores of Lake Evendim."},
[13815]={"Encuentra a la mujer misteriosa","Baya de Oro te ha pedido que coloques las flores de polvo en el agua, a la orilla del río.\
\
El río se encuentra en el Bosque Viejo.","'¡Has vuelto! Oh, tienes algo de telaraña en el pelo. ¿Has encontrado las flores de polvo? ¡Maravilloso! Ahora, coloca las flores en el agua aquí, ¡y asegúrate de permanecer cerca!'","Deberías hablar con Baya de Oro.\
\
Baya de Oro está junto al río, en el Bosque Viejo.","Henbran te ha sugerido que busques a una mujer misteriosa a orillas del río.\
\
La orilla del río se encuentra en el Bosque Viejo.","Siguiendo a Luilloth","Con el descubrimiento del grimorio se ha revelado más sobre los últimos días de Luilloth.","'¡Saludos! Debes de conocer a la joven Henbran para haberme encontrado así. Soy Baya de Oro, y tanto las sombras en tus ojos como el murmullo del río me dicen que te han traído aquí malas noticias'.\
\
Le explicas tu búsqueda de Luilloth y de una forma de devolver el descanso a los muertos inquietos.\
\
'¡Me alegra saber que estás desafiando al Miedo Gris! Aunque mi corazón vuelve a sentir tristeza al oír el nombre de la querida Luilloth. Hablé con ella hace mucho tiempo, muy cerca de este mismo lugar. ¡Vino a mí en busca de ayuda, como tú ahora! Le di toda la protección que pude y espero que le sirviera de ayuda en sus últimas horas. Porque, aunque ella desapareció, ¡los muertos también volvieron a sus tumbas!\
\
'Te daré la misma bendición, pero debes seguir sus pasos para obtenerla. En lo profundo del bosque, detrás de las enredadas telas de los mortíferos tejedores, crecen flores de polvo, cuyo aroma fortalece el corazón contra el miedo. Tráeme cinco flores de las ruinas del centro del bosque, para que puedas ir a la batalla con el corazón preparado.'","Lleva las flores a Baya de Oro","Coloca las flores en el agua","Flores de polvo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Baya de Oro te dijo que las flores de polvo prefieren crecer cerca de ruinas antiguas y en las partes elevadas del Bosque Viejo.","'Las flores de polvo prefieren las partes oscuras y húmedas del bosque. Por desgracia, las arañas también.'","Habla con Baya de Oro","'Me llevó un tiempo encontrar el pasaje sobre Luilloth, pero aquí está. Aquí dice que la dama vino en busca de ayuda para encontrar la fuente de poder que obligaba a los muertos a caminar. Mi antepasado y Luilloth descubrieron la ubicación del Miedo Gris. Ah, sí, recuerdo las historias sobre este ser malvado. A ver...'\
\
Hace una pausa para leer.\
\
'Sí, aquí está. Mi antepasado Darogandes instó a Luilloth a reunir fuerzas, pero Luilloth se fue por su cuenta a... No lo entiendo muy bien... Pero espera, no recuerdo este pasaje. Darogandes escribió que Luilloth primero fue a pedir consejo a otra persona. Hmm, creo que sé de quién habla.\
\
'Hay alguien que recorre este bosque aún más poderoso que yo. Su memoria es larga y sabrá adónde fue Luilloth a continuación. La encontrarás a la orilla del río, si sigues el camino de la derecha. La reconocerás por su brillante cabello y, si tienes suerte, por su canto en el viento","Vuelve con Rhiangar","Recolecta flores de polvo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡${PLAYER}! ¡Has vuelto! Estaba preocupada, hace tiempo que te marchaste.'\
\
Le cuentas lo que has descubierto.\
\
'¡La mujer que conociste parece fascinante! ¿Y Sarch Vorn? He oído hablar de ese lugar, pero nunca he estado allí. Era un lugar embrujado incluso antes de que los muertos de Cardolan volvieran a levantarse.'","'Ve con alegría y camina con más ligereza, porque el día siempre seguirá a la noche. Que esta pequeña cosa te ayude a hacer grandes cosas'.","¡Una nube de humo mohoso te envuelve! Te sientes con más determinación.","Deberías llevarle las flores de polvo a Baya de Oro.\
\
Baya de Oro está junto al río, en el Bosque Viejo.","Debes decirle a Rhiangar que el grimorio de la familia de Henbran y Baya de Oro rastrearon la persecución de Luilloth al Miedo Gris hasta Sarch Vorn.\
\
Rhiangar se encuentra en el campamento de caravanas, al sur de Andrath."},
[13816]={"The hobbits walked south-west, towards where they believed the Entwash to be.\
\
You should try to find the Entwash and search for signs of the two lost halflings.","Find a sign of Merry and Pippin's passage","Follow the path through the forest to search for signs of Merry and Pippin","You have come to the banks of the Entwash","This tree-ish Ent has decided that he is curious about the creatures he saw -- hobbits whom you know to be Meriadoc Brandybuck and Peregrin Took of the Shire. Ashlimb's inquisitive gaze speaks plainly: he wishes to know whither these hobbits have gone, and what fate they have met. Are they safe?\
\
You find yourself wondering the same thing.","Signs of the hobbits' passage may be found along the Entwash heading north-west, deeper into the forest.\
\
You should search for signs of the two lost halflings.","'Well met, ${PLAYER}. This would be a surprising meeting, if I had not known that you would appear at this very spot around this very time.\
\
'Come, let us speak at some length. Do make yourself comfortable!'","Climb the hill to try to see if you can spot the hobbits from above","Tracking Some Hobbits","Ashlimb has spotted two young hobbits whom you know to be Merry and Pippin of the Shire, friends you have met on your travels.","Find the Entwash and search for signs of the hobbits' passage","Found a hobbit-footprint in the mud","The hobbits veered north-east on the path running alongside the Entwash.\
\
You should search for signs of the two lost halflings.","This footprint points away from the river now, following a low path through the wood","The hobbits walked north along the Entwash.\
\
You should search for signs of the two lost halflings.","You have followed the hobbits to a strange hill in Fangorn that promises an overlook above the treetops.","It looks like a pair of hobbits may have paused here to wash their cares away in the clear water","You find some crumbs. Only a hobbit could stop for a nibble upon the discovery of such a strange hill. Surely they climbed this...."},
[13817]={"'Did you find that scroll yet?'","Celofa te ha enviado a las Profundidades Occidentales en busca de antiguos acertijos de estilo enano. Al parecer, pueden encontrarse pistas en las estanterías de allí, pero Celofa advierte que hacer demasiado ruido podría atraer a los orcos cercanos.","'Muy bien, ${PLAYER}. Para empezar, ve y desentierra algunos viejos acertijos de estilo enano... o, al menos, acertijos que los enanos hayan puesto por escrito. No es necesario que sean de origen enano, claro está, pero dado que Moria alberga una reserva tan grande de todo lo imaginable, esperando a ser descubierta, uno pensaría que aquí pueden encontrarse excelentes acertijos.\
\
'Ahora, ¿en qué estaba...? Ah, sí. ¡Acertijos! Hay algunas estanterías antiguas en las Profundidades Occidentales, pero me temo que también encontrarás orcos desagradables. Intenta registrar las estanterías en busca de buenos acertijos y tráeme uno.\
\
'Y en cuanto a esos orcos: podrían oírte si haces demasiado ruido hurgando entre las estanterías. Yo que tú mantendría los ojos bien abiertos y haría el trabajo con rapidez.'","Esta estantería no contiene el pergamino que buscas.","'¡Bien hecho! ¡Esto es un tesoro, sin lugar a dudas!\
\
Celofa frunce los labios y examina con avidez el texto desvaído, con los ojos brillantes de una travesura esperanzada.\
\
'¡Un momento! ¡Este texto está incompleto! Esto no sirve... no sirve en absoluto.\
\
'Tendremos que encontrar el texto que falta para acompañar este pergamino que hallaste, ${PLAYER}.'","Encuentra un pergamino de acertijos","Celofa se encuentra en las Fundaciones de Piedra, al sureste de las Profundidades Occidentales y de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Celofa con el pergamino que encontraste.","Rastreo de tesoros","Pergamino de acertijos encontrado","'Entonces, ${PLAYER}, ¿has descubierto alguno de los acertijos de manufactura enana que te pedí?'","Regresa junto a Celofa con el pergamino","Las Profundidades Occidentales se encuentran al noroeste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. Celofa te sugirió que comiences tu búsqueda entre Gabil-mamach y el Salón del Agua que Fluye.\
\
Celofa te ha pedido que revises cualquier montón de pergaminos que encuentres en las Profundidades Occidentales, entre Gabil-mamach y el Salón del Agua que Fluye, pero te advirtió que tu búsqueda podría alertar a los orcos de la zona si no tienes cuidado."},
[13819]={"You pull a damp missive off Glupronk...","'${PLAYER}, what did you hear of Kála-murg?'\
\
You tell Legolas about the disease ravaging Kála-murg and the Orc-tracker, Glupronk, that was mentioned by the Orcs.\
\
'This Glupronk must lead the Orc-trackers in their search for the Elf-warrior. It is likely he knows many of the hidden paths of Lhingris, and his knowledge may be useful in our search.\
\
'Travel to Kála-murg and seek the Orc, Glupronk. If he bears any orders, take them and we shall see what can be learned from them.\
\
'Be careful, ${PLAYER}. We know little of the disease that has taken the Orcs....'","You are carrying a missive from Cirith Ungol. You should read it.","Find and confront Glupronk in Kála-murg","Tracking the Enemy","Deliver the missive to Legolas in Rath Cail","A gruesome figure shambles out of the shadows...","Desperate to capture an elusive Elf-warrior, the Orc-trackers of Kála-murg now keep a close watch on Rath Cail.","Read Glupronk's missive from Cirith Ungol","'What have you found, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You hand Legolas the missive from Cirith Ungol.\
\
'Are you certain the Orcs have confused Master Samwise with the Elf-warrior? This Captain Róglarg seems to think Sam slew an entire garrison of Orcs by himself. Master Samwise is a loyal and brave hobbit, but he is not a practised warrior!\
\
'Stranger still, Captain Róglarg speaks of the Elf-warrior sticking a pin in Shelob. A mere blade could not wound such an ancient creature... not on its own. If only Sam had told us of his encounter with Shelob!\
\
'There can no longer be any doubt! Ungwetári still dwells in the Ephel Dúath, but she now tends her wounds in the shadowed caverns of the mountains...'","The missive warns of an Elf-warrior that slew the garrison of Cirith Ungol and stuck \\qShelob\\q!","Glupronk can likely be found deep within the Orc-hold of Kála-murg.\
\
The Orc, Glupronk, is in command of Kála-murg and seeks the Elf-warrior. Legolas hopes to learn more of the Orcs of Lhingris and of the hidden cavern where Shelob makes her home.","Legolas can be found in Rath Cail.\
\
You have read a troubling missive from the Captain of Cirith Ungol. You should deliver it to Legolas and see what he makes of it."},
[13822]={"Talk to Doron","'These belongings are so scattered, ${PLAYER}. I cannot discern his whereabouts from so little.\
\
'I must try to remember the time I spent here. Perhaps something has fallen from my memory.'","Rastreando al intruso","Doron wishes for you to search for the Easterling's belongings while travelling through Ost Celebrant. He has described them as having a different look than any of the relics of Gondor that still lay in the ruins.","Search Ost Celebrant for Easterling belongings (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Have you noticed the strange objects around you?\
\
'These primitive trappings are not of Gondor...surely they belong to the Easterling. What a fool to leave such a trail in his wake! Quickly, see if we can find more evidence of his passing, we must find him!'","Doron has noticed strange relics and supplies strewn about the ruins of Ost Celebrant. He believes these to be the belongings of the Easterling that has taken control of the fortress.","Discovered Easterling belongings (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[13823]={"Search for the invader's boot-prints near the river Blackroot","Suspicious and worried in the wake of Sardol's supplies being ferried down-river, Gordir hopes to uncover who has infiltrated Blackroot Vale.","'The waters of the Blackroot itself rose against you? That is not the work of any corsair I've ever heard of, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'You mentioned that the tracks continued into the vale, so perhaps the invader still lurks our lands... I only hope this corruption he has surrounded himself with spares the rest of the vale.\
\
'Many foul things are at work, ${PLAYER}, and I fear too many remain beyond our control.'","Tracking the Unknown","You seem to have lost the trail, but suddenly, the river-water churns and bubbles","Search for more boot-prints across the river Blackroot","You find a single boot-print leading across the river to where maddened bears now dwell","DNT -- will not be seen","Gordir can be found on the dock on the river Blackroot to the west of Sardol.\
\
You have lost the trail of the invader, but were confronted by a foul spirit that rose out of the Blackroot.","More evidence of the invader can be found along the western bank of the river Blackroot.\
\
You have uncovered a single boot-print on the eastern bank of the Blackroot, and it appears to lead into the water.","Some evidence of the invader can likely be found along the eastern bank of the river Blackroot, to the south of Sardol.\
\
Gordir hopes to uncover the identity of the person who has been ferrying resources out of Blackroot Vale.","'If someone has been stealing away our goods, they must have come from the south.\
\
'I have heard news of corsairs landing near Dol Amroth, but none of us have seen any in the vale. If they have truly come this far north, we shall have more to worry about than Orcs and the Dead...\
\
'They must have travelled the river's edge to send the barrels downstream, so if you find any sign of their passing, it may aid us in routing them out.'","Talk to Gordir"},
[13826]={"The old cairn can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should examine the cairn.","You hope that continuing north along the river is the correct route","Trail of the Worm","Talk to Fróthi","The next mark on the map indicates a location somewhere in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel north along the river to search for the next location on the map.","Search for the final location on the map","'Thank you Fróthi for that perspective. I say, had hot-headed Gundobad been lord when Thorin arrived, matters might have taken a much less friendly turn! It would seem the depiction of Hildáric in later tales has obscured this fact. According to the minstrels, Hildáric sought war against the dwarves, and it was only his death and Gundobad’s rise to take his place that kept that from happening! It is a shame when the truth of the matter becomes lost in years.'\
\
Léothred pauses for a moment.\
\
'Come, let us continue the journey along this river. The location the map leads us to can not be far!'","This seems to be where the map ends","Whoever built this cairn did not want it to be found without this map","You are assured that you are still heading in the correct direction","'It almost feels as if whoever made this map was hiding it from someone.'\
\
Léothred continues his tale.\
\
'At first Gundobad proved as poor a lord as Hildáric had feared, and made three bloody and rash attempts to enter the Mountain-hold before his own thanes begged him to stop spending the blood of his people on such folly. Afterwards, his temper eased, and he ruled indifferently to the age of fifty-three, growing fat from food and mead until his heart gave out.'","This cairn is as well hidden as the last that you found","'I knew there was a river here in Elderslade, but I did not know the Drekvath to flow from so far in the north.'\
\
Fróthi interjects into Léothred's tale for a moment.\
\
'Léothred, did you know that Hildáric is seen as a good leader in the eyes of dwarves? During his reign, the Dwarves of Erebor came north to settle the kingdom of Grárik in Ered Mithrin. Rather than dwelling on the troubles between their peoples, Hildáric made peace with King Thorin I and welcomed him to the north. Relations between Durin’s Folk and the Ai-thúda remained cordial, though seldom warm, during the rest of the time they dwelt beside each other.'","Talk to Léothred","A cairn lies hidden in the rocks","'I am sure that if we continue north, we will find the trail again.'\
\
Léothred continues his tale.\
\
'Gundobad's son, Gundolávi, was little better. He was a bellicose man who found joy in nothing more than hunting and battle, he is said to have slain more than thirty trolls and at least five giants. In the end, the pride of his line overcame him, and like his grandfather and father he sought to enter Gundabad. Unlike them, however, he succeeded, finding a way inside the Mountain-hold, accompanied by his two sons and many mighty warriors of his household.'","There does not seem to be any sign of a cairn here","'I am glad that you spotted the cairn! I did not see it!'\
\
Léothred continues his tale.\
\
'Gundolávi swore, as he entered the gates, that he would return bearing the heads of every Orc-chief he found within. Two weeks later, the gates opened again, and the Orcs flung out the heads of all who had entered, last of all Gundolávi and his sons.'","'Hmm, it seems the map ends here at this fork in the pass. Shall we rest a moment then? I will conclude my tale while we rest.\
\
'Following Gundolávi's death, his brother Thíudric became lord at the age of seventeen. Thíudric was a more thoughtful man than his brother and father had been, and his first act was to declare that neither he, nor any other of his blood, would ever again seek to set foot inside the Mountain-hold.'","The next mark on the map lies somewhere in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel north along the river to search for the next location on the map.","The carved map has led Léothred and Fróthi to an unexplored region of Elderslade.","Léothred can be found following Fram's map in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Léothred.","Search for the next location on the map","'Songs sung among the Ai-thúda call Hildáric a usurper, false and cruel, and even imply that he himself slew his brother to become lord. I believe that Hildáric was in fact a prudent ruler, if not kind, serving his people nobly but unremarkably, rather than following any lust for glory.'\
\
Léothred pauses for a moment.\
\
'Well then, I am eager to return to following this map. What say you, ${PLAYER}?'","Examine the old cairn","'There does not seem to be any other direction forward but to continue along the Drekvath River.'\
\
Léothred continues his tale.\
\
'Hildáric died of a sudden illness at the age of sixty-five. It has long been rumoured to have been poison. Gundobad appeared at his funeral to lay claim to lordship. He was challenged in this by Hildigar, Hildáric’s son, and the two fought for the right to rule the Ai-thúda. In the end, Gundobad cut Hildigar down, taking back rule over his people.'","You almost did not see the cairn hidden along the path","The final mark on the map indicates a location somewhere in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel north along the river to search for the next location on the map.","Fróthi can be found following Fram's map in Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Fróthi."},
[13827]={"Some parts of Edsig's Farm seem to have been converted by the Orcs to help them breed Wargs and train future Warg-riders. Defeating the Orcs responsible for training and breeding the Wargs would help slow the enemy recruitment of new riders to their ranks.","White Hand Warg-trainer defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Warg-trainers have been defeated, but more Orcs will come to take their place. Edsig's Farm was not reclaimed from the enemy, but its usefulness to the White Hand has been reduced, for now.","Edsig's Farm appears to have been captured by the White Hand Warg-riders that are ravaging the Fallows' less populated areas.","The Warg-trainers have been defeated, but more Orcs are likely to eventually take their place. Edsig's Farm may still be in the hands of the enemy, however your efforts have reduced the usefulness of their outpost.","Edsig's Farm appears to have been captured by the White Hand Warg-riders that are ravaging the Fallows' less populated areas.\
\
Some parts of the farm further from the road seem to have been converted for breeding and training of new Wargs for future Warg-riders.","Trained with Cruelty","Edsig's Farm was recently abandoned and the Orcs have taken the opportunity to use the farm as an outpost. They now use it as a base of operation for their Warg-rider raids on the outlying farms.","Defeat White Hand Warg-trainers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Defeat White Hand Warg-trainers (0/6)"},
[13828]={"Lleva las manzanas a Bingo, en el exterior de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande","'No tengo más consejos para el señor Boffin, pero sé que necesitará provisiones para su viaje. Si vas hacia Manzanal, en la ladera de la Colina y recoges algunas manzanas caídas, me atrevería a decir que su estómago estará satisfecho, ¡incluso cuando su cabeza no lo esté! ¡Que tengas un buen día!'","El Tío Gamyi vive en el número 3 de Bolsón de Tirada, a la mitad de camino de la Colina en Hobbiton, al noreste del agujero hobbit de Bingo.\
\
Bingo te ha pedido que consultes al Tío Gamyi para saber si aprendió algo sobre ir de aventuras de Bilbo Bolsón.","Entrenando para el viaje","Esmeralda Madriguerales te observa con recelo","Habla con Bingo en el exterior de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande","'Ah, esta es la mejor forma de entrengar los músculos de los brazos, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}: ¡levantar una buena jarra de cerveza hasta mi boca!\
\
'Bien, ya nos han dado unos cuantos consejos sobre ir de aventuras, he adquirido algunos de las provisiones que necesitaré, y he hecho un poco de ejercicio para estar en forma para el viaje. Hay solo un área más que necesito entrenar... ¡pero pasaremos a eso en un rato!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Nada o húndete' (Nivel recomendado: 10)</rgb>","'No sé si lo sabías, pero el viejo Tío Gamyi, allá en Hobbiton, fue el jardinero de Bilbo Bolsón durante muchos años, y podría ser que estuviera al tanto de los secretos del viejo Bilbo. ¡Quizá haya dado al Tío algunos consejos sobre aventuras! ¡Ve a Bolsón de Tirada en Hobbiton para ver si el Tío tiene algún consejo útil para un hobbit que va a comenzar su viaje!'","'Este parece un buen puñado de manzanas, y deberían bastar al señor Boffin para comenzar con buen pie su viaje.\
\
'¡Ojalá que cuando las manzanas se le acaben se dé la vuelta y regrese a casa! La espesura no es lugar para un hobbit.'","'No puedo esperar para comenzar mi viaje, ${PLAYER}, pero sé que queda mucho por hacer antes de partir. ¡Necesito entrenarme para la aventura si quiero tener éxito en el camino! Necesitaré conocimientos, suministros y fuerza física, y... y... '\
\
Bingo se estremece.\
\
'Hay una cosa más que necesitaré, pero de momento no hablemos de eso. ¡Hay suficiente que hacer para prepararse antes de abordar la más peligrosa de las tareas!\
\
'Lo primero: ¡conocimientos! No sé si lo sabías, pero el viejo Tío Gamyi, allá en Hobbiton, fue el jardinero de Bilbo Bolsón durante muchos años, y podría ser que estuviera al tanto de los secretos del viejo Bilbo. ¡Quizá haya dado al Tío algunos consejos sobre aventuras! ¡Ve a Bolsón de Tirada en Hobbiton para ver si el Tío tiene algún consejo útil para un hobbit que va a comenzar su viaje!'","El Tío Gamyi está esperando que regreses de Manzanal con las manzanas para Bingo.","Bingo está emocionado por comenzar su viaje, pero sabe que necesitará entrenar para la aventura antes de partir.","'¿Cómo? ¿Dices que Bingo Boffin se va de aventuras? ¡Creía que los Boffin de los Campos de Cavada eran respetables!'\
\
El Tío carraspea y titubea por un momento.\
\
'Dile a Bingo que el único consejo que tengo para los hobbits que están pensando en dejar la Comarca es este: '¡no lo hagas!' Los viajes solo traen problemas. El señor Bilbo era un hobbit tan bien hablado como el que más, pero me temo que se juntó con gente de lo más extraña allá afuera. Pobre hombre.\
\
'No tengo más consejos para el señor Boffin, pero sé que necesitará provisiones para su viaje. Si vas hacia Manzanal, en la ladera de la Colina y recoges algunas manzanas caídas, me atrevería a decir que su estómago estará satisfecho, ¡incluso cuando su cabeza no lo esté! ¡Que tengas un buen día!'","Habla con Bingo en la torre de Cepeda, al sur del pueblo de Cepeda","Habla con Bingo en la posada de la Perca Dorada, en el pueblo de Cepeda","'¿Así que Bingo Boffin se va de viaje? ¿Qué mosca le ha picado a ese hobbit?'","La posada del Pájaro y el Bebé está al suroeste del agujero hobbit de Bingo, en Michel Delving.\
\
Bingo no soporta las manzanas, y te ha pedido que las lleves a la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé y las dejes cerca del mostrador que hay dentro. Alguien se las comerá.","Esmeralda Madriguerales ha llamado tu atención en el interior de la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé. Le gustaría hablar contigo sobre algo.","Habla con Esmeralda Madriguerales en la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé","Bingo ha intentado subir a la torre de Cepeda, pero se ha rendido. Te ha dicho que se encontrará contigo en la posada de la Perca Dorada, en el pueblo de Cepeda, para continuar con su entrentamiento.","'¡Uf! ¡Puf! Oh, ${PLAYER}, ¡esto no ha sido... una buena idea!'\
\
'La cara de Bingo está roja como un tomate, y está doblado del agotamiento.\
\
'Esto... quién iba a decir... que esta torre... huf... puf... ¡fuera tan alta!! No voy a... seguir subiendo... ¡Uh! Conozco un... un camino mejor...\
\
'Reúnete conmigo... en la Perca Dorada... ${PLAYER}. Está en... en el pueblo de Cepeda...'","El huerto de Manzanal está subiendo la colina, al noroeste de Bolsón de Tirada.\
\
El Tío Gamyi te ha recomendado que recojas algunas manzanas caídas en el huerto de Manzanal, que serán un buen comienzo para que Bingo se aprovisione para su viaje.","'No has ignorado a Esmeralda en la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé, ¿verdad? Oh, no deberías haber hecho eso. ¡Esto va a traer cola! Será mejor que vuelvas y averigües lo que quería.'","El Tío te da una buena cesta en la que llevar las manzanas","'Estás de vuelta, ¡y sin las manzanas! Perfecto, estoy seguro de que alguien las disfrutará. Mientras tanto, he comprado algunos suministros a Petunia Manoverde, y debería tener suficiente comida para una buena temporada. ¿Por qué esa cara larga, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
Le cuentas a Bingo que Esmeralda Madriguerales consiguió enterarse de la próxima partida de Bingo, aunque apenas hablaste sobre ello.\
\
'Bueno, no hay nada que hacer, supongo. Si Esmeralda lo sabe, todo Cavada Grande lo sabrá por la mañana, ¡y el resto de la Comarca será un hervidero para la semana que viene! No hay remedio.\
\
'El siguiente área en que debo entrenar es la fuerza física, y sé cómo hacerlo. ¡Subiré a la torre de Cepeda! Reúnete conmigo en la base de la torre, al sur del pueblo de Cepeda, ¡y subiremos a la torre de Cepeda juntos!'","Bingo está fuera de su agujero hobbit en Cavada Grande, justo al norte del Agujero Municipal.\
\
Has conseguido una buena selección de manzanas para Bingo provenientes de Manzanal en Hobbiton.","Bingo te ha pedido que te reúnas con él en la torre de Cepeda, al sur del pueblo de Cepeda. Planea subir a la torre para conseguir la destreza física que necesitará para su viaje.","'Quién diría... que esta torre fuera... huf... puf... ¡tan alta! No voy a... subir más... ¡uh! Conozco una forma... una forma mejor...\
\
'Reúnete conmigo en... en la Perca Dorada... ${PLAYER}. Está en... en el pueblo de Cepeda...'","Deja las manzanas junto al mostrador del interior de la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé","Recoge algunas manzanas caídas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge manzanas caídas en el huerto de Manzanal (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Qué es eso? ¿El Tío te ha dado provisiones para mi viaje? Qué considerado por su parte. Tengo que asegurarme de escribirle una nota de agradecimiento. Es... realmente... un hobbit...'\
\
La voz de Bingo se apaga cuando ve lo que traes.\
\
'¿Manzanas? Oh. ¡No SOPORTO las manzanas! Estoy seguro de que son muy buenas, ${PLAYER}, ¡pero es que no puedo ni ver a esos bichos asquerosos!\
\
'¡No puedo ni tomar ni un pequeño bocado! Lleva esa cesta de manzanas a la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé y déjala junto al mostrador, por favor. Alguien se comerá las manzanas, pero una cosa es segura: ¡no seré yo!'","'¡Eh, tú! ¿Quién te crees que eres, dejando esas manzanas ahí? ¿Son para que se las lleve alguien? ¿De dónde vienen?'\
\
Te ves en la obligación de contarle a Esmeralda que eran un regalo para Bingo, pero no las quería.\
\
'¿Bingo Boffin? ¿De quién era el cumpleaños? ¿Y cómo no sabían sus amigos que no le gustan? ¿Qué dices? ¿Que eran un regalo del viejo Ham Gamyi? ¿Un regalo de despedida?'\
\
Los ojos de Esmeralda adquieren un brillo conspirador, y te disculpas todo lo amablemente que puedes.'","'El siguiente área en que debo entrenar es la fuerza física, y sé cómo hacerlo. ¡Subiré a la torre de Cepeda! Reúnete conmigo en la base de la torre, al sur del pueblo de Cepeda, ¡y subiremos a la torre de Cepeda juntos!'","Vuelve con el Tío Gamyi en Bolsón de Tirada","Bingo está en su casa, al noreste de la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé.\
\
Has dejado la cest ade manzanas en la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé, pero en el proceso Esmeralda Mariguerales consiguió descubrir que Bingo está planeando un viaje.","Habla con el Tío Gamyi en Bolsón de Tirada, en Hobbiton","'Lleva esa cesta de manzanas a la posada del Pájaro y el Bebé y déjala junto al mostrador, por favor. Alguien se comerá las manzanas, pero una cosa es segura: ¡no seré yo!'"},
[13829]={"Spar with Ambassion","Spar with Faratúr","'I would rather rest than spar, but Hildvar is looking this way! I suppose we should begin.'","'Have you come to train? Good, I could use someone like you: someone who has seen battle recently! The men who survived the fighting against the Ghâzab Bôron are too exhausted from the pitched retreat to even stand, and most of the soldiers we found here at Díngarth are unfit to take to the battlefield! If they cannot fight in a skirmish upon the Corpse-fields, how can they hope to survive the coming of the Storm of Wrath?\
\
'Spar with these soldiers and teach them the techniques that have allowed you to survive upon the battlefield. I will watch and give you some recommendations after you have finished sparring. After all, I have seen battle with Huneric, Lord of the Thíuda, and I have picked up some of his techniques!'","Spar with Hallatan","Estenan can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Estenan.","Spar with Estenan","Tulcandur can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Tulcandur.","Spar with Ostondil","'I have not seen combat in quite some time. Prepare yourself!'","Hildvar can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Hildvar.","Armacar can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Armacar.","'I am in need of the practice. I hope to learn much under the command of Hildvar.'","Spar with Armacar","Hildvar, daughter of Huneric Hundred-slayer, has been tasked with training the soldiers before the Storm of Wrath strikes.","Celuher can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Celuher.","Hallatan can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Hallatan.","Ostondil can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Ostondil.","'I am happy to spar with you, friend!'","'Go easy on me. I just recovered from an injury.'","Spar with Tulcandur","Training the Forces","'I have killed ten Orcs! How many have you bested?'","'I am ready to spar, my friend!'","Spar with Celuher","Talk to Hildvar","'Let me see your skills. I am a quick learner!'","Ambassion can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Ambassion.","Faratúr can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should spar with Faratúr.","'You handled yourself well against eight of the soldiers under my command. It is important to anticipate your enemies' actions before they happen; otherwise you will always be reacting, and not setting the pace of the combat. When you know your enemy well, you can counter their blow before they even make the attack!\
\
'These are the words of my father, and I have seen the truth in them for myself. Heed them well and you will never know defeat!'"},
[13830]={"Habla con el entrenador de capitanes en la Atalaya de Edhelion\
\
Ahora que has usado exitosamente tu Golpe Devastador, deberías regresar con tu entrenador y contarle tu éxito.","'Debes golpear al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con el Golpe Devastador más poderoso que puedas realizar. Una vez que te sientas ${PLAYERNAME:seguro[m]|segura[f]} de tu habilidad, regresa conmigo. ¡Debemos asegurarnos de que estés ${PLAYERNAME:preparado[m]|preparada[f]} para enfrentar los peligros de la Tierra Media!'\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Capitanes dependen de su <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para ponerse en un <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb>. Mientras estén en este estado, los Capitanes pueden usar habilidades especiales como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>, un ataque muy efectivo que inflige gran daño. Ataca al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu <rgb=#00FF00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para entrar en <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb> y luego golpea al muñeco con tu <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>.","'¡Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}! A medida que continúes perfeccionando tus habilidades, aprenderás nuevas técnicas con las que fortalecer a tus aliados y dominar el campo de batalla.\
\
'Si eso es todo, deberías regresar con Elladan.'","Habla con el entrenador de capitanes en la Atalaya de Edhelion","Usa tu <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> en el Muñeco de Entrenamiento, y luego golpéalo con tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>","Has usado exitosamente Golpe Devastador","'¿${PLAYERNAME:Un compañero Capitán[m]|Una compañera Capitana[f]}, eres tú? Si nuestra misión no fuera tan urgente, habría más tiempo para tu entrenamiento, pero aquí va un consejo:\
\
'A diferencia del impetuoso Campeón, un Capitán no sirve mejor a sus compañeros lanzándose imprudentemente al combate. No, es el Capitán que se mantiene atrás y guía con diligencia los esfuerzos de sus compañeros quien obtiene la victoria. Aun así, llegará el momento en que deberás empuñar armas y entrar tú mismo en la batalla, ¡y ese no es momento para mostrar debilidad! Con técnica cuidadosa y precisión, un Capitán puede asestar un Golpe Devastador incluso al enemigo más poderoso.\
\
'Demuestra tu habilidad y realiza un <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb> a uno de estos Muñecos de Entrenamiento. ¡No te contengas!'\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Capitanes dependen de su <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para ponerse en un <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb>. Mientras estén en este estado, los Capitanes pueden usar habilidades especiales como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>, un ataque muy efectivo que inflige gran daño. Ataca al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu <rgb=#00FF00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para entrar en <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb> y luego golpea al muñeco con tu <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>.'","Entrenamiento: La Carga del Capitán","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb> en el Muñeco de Entrenamiento cercano.\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Capitanes dependen de su <rgb=#00ff00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para ponerse en un <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb>. Mientras estén en este estado, los Capitanes pueden usar habilidades especiales como <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>, un ataque muy efectivo que inflige gran daño. Ataca al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con tu <rgb=#00FF00>Grito de Batalla</rgb> para entrar en <rgb=#ffff00>Estado de Preparación para la Batalla</rgb> y luego golpea al muñeco con tu <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Devastador</rgb>.","Tu entrenador quiere que uses tus nuevas habilidades para demostrar que estás ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para enfrentar los muchos peligros que existen en el mundo."},
[13831]={"Habla con el Entrenador de Guardianes en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion","Has golpeado al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con 'Barrido de Escudo'","El Entrenador de Guardianes está en el Puesto de Vigilancia de Edhelion.\
\
Ahora que has usado con éxito tu habilidad recién aprendida, deberías regresar con tu entrenadora y contarle tu éxito.","Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento cercano.\
\
PISTA:\
\
Los Guardianes dependen de las <rgb=#ffff00>Habilidades Reactivas para infligir daño y generar <rgb=#ff0000>Amenaza</rgb> contra sus enemigos. <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb> requiere que el Guardián <rgb=#ffff00>Bloquee</rgb> un ataque enemigo entrante antes de poder usar la habilidad. Dirígete a los <rgb=#ff0000>Muñecos de Entrenamiento</rgb> al norte del entrenador y ataca hasta que bloquees con éxito uno de sus ataques. Si tienes problemas para bloquear, intenta usar <rgb=#00ff00>Resguardo del guardián</rgb> para aumentar tus probabilidades de bloquear ataques enemigos. Una vez que hayas bloqueado un ataque, podrás usar tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb>. Golpea al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo.</rgb>","Golpea al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con 'Barrido de Escudo'","Entrenamiento: El Barrido de Escudo de un Guardián","A medida que subas de nivel, aprenderás nuevas habilidades que te ayudarán a convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Guardián más poderoso[m]|una Guardiana más poderosa[f]}.","'Golpea al Muñeco de Entrenamiento con tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb> y regresa conmigo. Debemos asegurarnos de que estás preparado para enfrentarte a los peligros de la Tierra Media.'\
\
PISTA: Los Guardianes dependen de las <rgb=#ffff00>Habilidades Reactivas para infligir daño y generar <rgb=#ff0000>Amenaza</rgb> contra sus enemigos. <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb> requiere que el Guardián <rgb=#ffff00>Bloquee</rgb> un ataque enemigo entrante antes de poder usar la habilidad. Dirígete a los <rgb=#ff0000>Muñecos de Entrenamiento</rgb> al norte del entrenador y ataca hasta que bloquees con éxito uno de sus ataques. Si tienes problemas para bloquear, intenta usar <rgb=#00ff00>Resguardo del guardián</rgb> para aumentar tus probabilidades de bloquear ataques enemigos. Una vez que hayas bloqueado un ataque, podrás usar tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo</rgb>. Golpea al <rgb=#ff0000>Muñeco de Entrenamiento</rgb> con <rgb=#00ff00>Barrido de Escudo.</rgb>","'¡Bien, ! Creo que algún día serás ${PLAYERNAME:un excelente Guardián[m]|una excelente Guardiana[f]}. Ahora deberías regresar con Elladan; creo que desea comenzar la investigación.'","'Estoy aquí para ayudarte a aprender a usar habilidades que te harán -1:{un Guardián más poderoso[m]|una Guardiana más poderosa[f]}. A medida que subas de nivel, más habilidades estarán disponibles para ti.'\
\
