<rgb=#FFFF00>Optional:</rgb><rgb=#00FF00>Speak with the trainer again if you wish to purchase additional skills and traits.</rgb>","Speak with Sovairlë","'Without steeds we must rely on our fell magic to speed our travel through the harsh land. Use this to keep up with the tireless forces of the Lord.\
\
'But, be warned. While using <rgb=#FFFF00>March!</rgb>, you can speak with allies and interact with items in the world. However, you cannot use any of your other abilities to fight against the foe while you are marching, so best to be quick to stop marching when it comes time to fight!\
