'Use the skill now, then visit the vendor Nadar near the front gate to learn more.'","Speak with Nadar near the gate of Gramsfoot","You have learned to strengthen yourself and to move swiftly. Sovairlë directed you to a vendor near the gate. Curious. Seek out the vendor Nadar and speak with them.","'Welcome, mistress. I know your presence here will bring about positive change to our efforts. Still, you are fresh to the battle and it would be best for you to hone your talent before heading out into the wilds.\
\
'Speak with me again and purchase the skill <rgb=#FFFF00>March!</rgb>. Then, use the skill to prove that you have learned and know how to enable what you learn.'\
